            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1788/S.10.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1788/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1788> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1788/S.3.7>
