<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1896> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1896> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de sondage est le r&eacute;pertoire Sirene (Syst&egrave;me informatique pour le r&eacute;pertoire des entreprises et de leurs &eacute;tablissements).<br /><br />L'&eacute;chantillon est stratifi&eacute; par secteur d'activit&eacute;, par taille. Selon l'ann&eacute;e d'enqu&ecirc;te, environ 12 500 entreprises sont interrog&eacute;es.<br />L'&eacute;chantillon est stratifi&eacute; par secteur d'activit&eacute; et par taille.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1896> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The scope covers businesses with 10 employees or more belonging to the following sectors of NACE rev. 1: industry and the agri-food industries (section D), the energy sector (section E), the building industry&nbsp;(section F), trade (section G), hotels and restaurants (section H), transport and communications (section I), financial services (section J partial), real-estate, leasing and services to businesses (section K) and the audiovisual sector (groups 92.1 and 92.2 in NAF rev. 1).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1896> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The topics covered are: the development of new technologies and the intensity of their use in business; the types of use of ICT&nbsp;(electronic commerce, sharing and exchanging of information and, more generally, relations with the world outside the business); the obstacles and impacts of this dissemination.<br /><br />Each year, some topics, determined by the annual European regulation for the implementation of the framework regulation, are developed in particular.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The EC survey on the \"use of ICT and electronic commerce\" in business is a set of surveys conducted by the national institutes of statistics of the member countries of the European Union.<br /><br />It complies with regulation n&deg;808/2004 adopted on April 21, 2004&nbsp;as part of the implementation of the 2005 eEurope action plan devoted to information and communication technologies: this regulation was amended by European regulation n&deg; 1006/2009 of September 16, 2009. Accordingly, the surveys on ICT and electronic commerce in business conducted by the countries of the European Union follow a common methodology and the same model of questionnaire.<br /><br />Each year, one or more topics, determined by the annual European regulation for&nbsp;the implementation of the framework regulation, are developed in particular.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Janvier &agrave; avril</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/148> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/947>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire 2007 de l'enquête sur les technologies de l'information et de la communication et le commerce électronique (auprèsdes entreprises) / TIC"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/tic07_quest2007.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>La p&eacute;riode de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence est 2007 pour la plupart des questions&nbsp;; le dernier exercice comptable (2006) pour le commerce &eacute;lectronique.</p>"@fr , "<p>The reference period is mainly 2007 except for the characteristics referring to the previous accounting year (turnover, websales).</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1896> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2006A110EC"@fr , "2006A110EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1896> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s sont : le d&eacute;veloppement des nouvelles technologies et l'intensit&eacute; de leur utilisation au sein de l'entreprise ; les types d'utilisation des TIC (commerce &eacute;lectronique, partage et &eacute;change d'information, plus g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement les relations avec le monde externe &agrave; l'entreprise) ; les obstacles et l'impact de cette diffusion.<br /><br />Chaque ann&eacute;e, certains th&egrave;mes, d&eacute;termin&eacute;s par le r&egrave;glement europ&eacute;en annuel d'application du r&egrave;glement cadre, font l'objet d'un d&eacute;veloppement particulier. En 2007, le th&egrave;me d&eacute;velopp&eacute; est les comp&eacute;tences des personnels dans le domaine des TIC.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1896/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1896> .
    
