    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Sylvie Rousseau</p>"@fr , "<p>Sylvie Rousseau</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La m&eacute;thodologie est d&eacute;crite dans le document &laquo;&nbsp;M&eacute;thodes et pratique des enqu&ecirc;tes entreprises.pdf&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/994> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le questionnaire aborde les th&egrave;mes suivants &agrave; partir de questions principalement qualitatives, c&rsquo;est &agrave; dire appelant des r&eacute;ponses sous la forme oui / non&nbsp;:<br />- le soci&eacute;tal&nbsp;: relations avec les clients, les fournisseurs, la soci&eacute;t&eacute; civile&nbsp;;<br />- le social, dont la lutte contre les discriminations dans l'entreprise, le dialogue social&nbsp;;<br />- l'environnemental&nbsp;: lutte contre le changement climatique, sobri&eacute;t&eacute; dans la gestion des ressources et de l'&eacute;nergie, pr&eacute;servation de l'environnement naturel&nbsp;;<br />- la RSE&nbsp;: connaissance de la RSE et actions men&eacute;es dans une perspective de RSE&nbsp;;<br />- la gouvernance d'entreprise et l'organisation interne.<br /><br />Le terme &laquo;&nbsp;RSE&nbsp;&raquo; n&rsquo;apparaissait pas dans la d&eacute;nomination de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te lors de la collecte, et les questions portant sur la RSE n&rsquo;interviennent qu&rsquo;en fin du questionnaire. Il s&rsquo;agit d&rsquo;une d&eacute;marche volontaire car le terme de &laquo;&nbsp;d&eacute;veloppement durable&nbsp;&raquo; &eacute;tait jug&eacute; mieux connu que la notion de RSE. De cette fa&ccedil;on, l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te permet d&rsquo;&eacute;valuer, d&rsquo;une part, la notori&eacute;t&eacute; du terme &laquo;&nbsp;RSE&nbsp;&raquo; aupr&egrave;s des entreprises, et, d&rsquo;autre part, les actions des entreprises qui &laquo;&nbsp;font de la RSE sans le savoir&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is conducted electronically (e-questionnaire). The address of the collection website and a login ID and password are provided in the notice letter. If requested, the company may receive a paper questionnaire.<br />In 2016, 95% of respondents chose the Internet response.</p>\n<p>Two surveys were conducted in 2011 and 2016.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.7.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour les entreprises choisissant d&rsquo;utiliser le support internet, le site de collecte est enti&egrave;rement s&eacute;curis&eacute; et les normes en termes de gestion des codes d&rsquo;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te sont strictes. Pour les entreprises choisissant d&rsquo;utiliser le support papier, la saisie est assur&eacute;e par les gestionnaires, dans le strict respect de la confidentialit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es r&eacute;colt&eacute;es.<br />Avant la diffusion des donn&eacute;es les&nbsp; r&egrave;gles de confidentialit&eacute; sur les donn&eacute;es sont appliqu&eacute;es. Pour les donn&eacute;es relatives aux entreprises&nbsp;: on ne publie aucun r&eacute;sultat qui concerne moins de trois entreprises ou &eacute;tablissements. De m&ecirc;me, un r&eacute;sultat ne sera diffus&eacute; que si aucune entreprise ou &eacute;tablissement ne contribue &agrave; plus de 85&nbsp;% de ce r&eacute;sultat. Les suppressions primaires correspondent aux cases ne r&eacute;pondant pas au crit&egrave;re ci-dessus. Le secret secondaire supprime d'autres cases pour que les donn&eacute;es ne puissent pas &ecirc;tre retrouv&eacute;es par addition soustraction avec les marges des tableaux. Le secret statistique est d&eacute;finit dans la loi n&deg;&nbsp;51-711 du 7 juin 1951.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par voie &eacute;lectronique (e-questionnaire). L&rsquo;adresse du site web de collecte ainsi qu&rsquo;un identifiant et un mot de passe de connexion sont indiqu&eacute;s dans la lettre-avis. Si elle en fait la demande, l&rsquo;entreprise peut recevoir un questionnaire papier.<br />En 2016, 95% des r&eacute;pondants ont choisi la r&eacute;ponse par internet.</p>\n<p>Deux enqu&ecirc;tes ont &eacute;t&eacute; men&eacute;es en 2011 et 2016.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>The situation described is that of the company at the time the information was collected in 2016.</p>"@en , "<p>La situation d&eacute;crite est celle de l&rsquo;entreprise au moment de la collecte des informations en 2016.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The Insee-Premi&egrave;re on <a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3197097\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">&laquo; Les pratiques environnementales des entreprises &raquo; &ndash; n&deg;1673</a> is available on insee.fr.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le r&eacute;pertoire ayant servi &agrave; tirer l'&eacute;chantillon est le Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus). Sa couverture des entreprises est plut&ocirc;t bonne, on consid&egrave;re que toutes les cr&eacute;ations d'entreprises sont enregistr&eacute;es, le num&eacute;ro SIREN &eacute;tant obligatoire pour toutes les d&eacute;marches administratives. Par contre, les cessations peuvent ne pas toutes &ecirc;tre correctement enregistr&eacute;es.<br /><br />Il n&rsquo;existe pas d&rsquo;autre enqu&ecirc;te sur le m&ecirc;me sujet dans le service statistique public. L&rsquo;approche int&eacute;gr&eacute;e des pratiques des entreprises dans les diff&eacute;rentes dimensions de la RSE en fait l&rsquo;originalit&eacute;. Les concepteurs de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te ont veill&eacute; &agrave; la pertinence des interrogations dans ces diff&eacute;rentes dimensions, et notamment &agrave; la non-redondance avec des interrogations d&eacute;j&agrave; existantes par ailleurs (conditions de travail dans l&rsquo;entreprise, ou traitement des d&eacute;chets par exemple).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different stages of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:<br />- tests carried out upstream of the collection, with 51 companies;<br />- stratified sampling;<br />- reminders and controls of data being collected;<br />- data cleaning;<br />- correction of overall non-response;<br />- calibration;<br />- correction of partial non-response.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/314> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/313> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.8.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.8.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.8.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.8.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.7.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.7.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.7.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The results of the 2016 survey can be compared to those of the 2011 survey with certain precautions.</p>\n<p>On the one hand, the field has evolved:<br />In the 2011 survey, companies are surveyed from 10 employees;<br />In 2016, companies are surveyed from 20 employees;<br />In 2011, network and group heads are specifically surveyed, which is no longer the case in 2016;<br />The employees taken into account were annual full-time equivalents in 2011, they are employees as at 31/12 in 2016;<br />In 2016, some questions are only asked of companies with 50 or more employees.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, the questionnaires have evolved between the two vintages: comparisons can therefore only be made for common questions, with caution because the order and previous questions have been modified, and response behaviours may be slightly different.</p>\n<p>Consequently, to compare the results, it is imperative to work on common questions and on the same field (20 or more employees). It is also necessary to use the same definition of size for both surveys, i.e. employment in full-time equivalent. This variable is called TAILLE for the 2011 survey and TAILLE_ETP for the 2016 survey.<br />The common field thus defined represents 71,658 companies with 20 or more employees for the 2011 survey and 69,785 for the 2016 survey.</p>\n<p>As a result, the results for 2016 will be slightly different depending on whether we are reasoning in the 2016 scope of the survey or in this common scope.<br />For example, in the 2016 survey, to the question \"Have you ever heard of corporate social responsibility\", 61% of companies answered yes in the common field to the 2011 survey (69,785 companies), but only 59% in the entire scope of the survey (80,445 companies).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision (&eacute;cart-type, coefficient de variation, intervalle de confiance &agrave; 95&nbsp;%) prennent en compte les erreurs dues &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage, &agrave; la correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale, au calage et &agrave; la winsorisation, mais pas l&rsquo;erreur li&eacute;e &agrave; la correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle.</p>\n<p>Des variables ont &eacute;t&eacute; d&eacute;finies pour les calculs de pr&eacute;cision sur EnDD 2016&nbsp;:<br />Le plus grand march&eacute; g&eacute;ographique o&ugrave; l&rsquo;entreprise vend des biens ou prestations de service (A1a A1b A1c A1d)<br />B1, avoir un oui parmi les questions&nbsp;: B1a_ECO_CLIENT_CCD B1b_ECO_CLIENT_CCS B1c_ECO_CLIENT_CCE<br />C1, avoir un oui parmi les questions&nbsp;: C1a_SOC_DISCRI_SEX<br />C1b_SOC_DISCRI_ORI C1c_SOC_DISCRI_SEN<br />C1d_SOC_DISCRI_JEU C1e_SOC_DISCRI_HAN<br />C1f_SOC_DISCRI_ORS<br />C4_2_SOC_GPECMI50 (C4_2)<br />D1h_ENV_IMPACT_TOX suivant les modalit&eacute;s&nbsp;: Aucun ou tr&egrave;s faible, Faible et Fort ou tr&egrave;s fort (D1h1 D1h2 D1h3) ;<br />- D2_ENV_CERTIF (D2)<br />D6_ENV_EFFICA (D6)<br />E1_RSE_CONNU (E1)<br />E2_RSE_ACTION (E2)<br />F6_GVN_PPEXTE50 suivant les modalit&eacute;s&nbsp;: non, oui et non concern&eacute; (F60 F61 F62)</p>\n<p>Ces variables ont &eacute;t&eacute; choisies de la fa&ccedil;on suivante&nbsp;:<br />- les variables de diffusion \"cible\"&nbsp;;<br />- compl&eacute;t&eacute;es par quelques autres variables choisies de fa&ccedil;on &agrave; obtenir un &eacute;chantillon de variables recevant soit une grande fr&eacute;quence de r&eacute;ponses positives, soit une fr&eacute;quence proche de 50%, soit des fr&eacute;quences&nbsp; faibles, et aussi de fa&ccedil;on &agrave; tester &agrave; la fois des variables concernant l'ensemble du champ de l'enqu&ecirc;te ou des variables pos&eacute;es seulement aux entreprises de 50 salari&eacute;s ou plus, soit des variables filtr&eacute;es par le questionnaire.<br />L'objectif est que l'utilisateur puisse se faire une id&eacute;e rapidement de la pr&eacute;cision des indicateurs qu'il obtient en fonction de l'effectif de l'&eacute;chantillon ou du sous-&eacute;chantillon sur lequel il travaille.</p>\n<p>Pour les variables qualitatives, les indicateurs sont les suivants&nbsp;:<br />moyenne (%) = proportion de &laquo;&nbsp;oui&nbsp;&raquo; rapport&eacute;e &agrave; l&rsquo;ensemble des unit&eacute;s (concern&eacute;es ou non)<br />&eacute;cart-type (s) = racine(variance)<br />intervalle de confiance (IC) &agrave; 95&nbsp;% = [moyenne +/- 1,96 s].<br />Pour les variables qualitatives ayant plus de deux modalit&eacute;s, le calcule est fait pour chaque modalit&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.11.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Avant toute exploitation, il est utile d&rsquo;appr&eacute;cier la qualit&eacute; des variables au travers de leur taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle et des intervalles de confiance fournis dans les indicateurs de qualit&eacute; de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te.</p>\n<p>Variables &agrave; analyser avec pr&eacute;caution&nbsp;:<br />D5_ENV_PARTCA<br />Temps de r&eacute;ponse</p>\n<p>Il s'agit des variables pr&eacute;sentant les plus forts taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle (seuil mis arbitrairement &agrave; 5%). Ces variables sont &agrave; interpr&eacute;ter avec pr&eacute;caution puisqu'une partie non n&eacute;gligeable des r&eacute;ponses a &eacute;t&eacute; imput&eacute;e.</p>\n<p>D'autres &eacute;l&eacute;ments sont &agrave; prendre en compte, tels que la pr&eacute;cision des estimations (intervalles de confiance) et le fait de croiser ou pas la variable avec des domaines de diffusion.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.6.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.6.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.6.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.6.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A document describing the individual data file and the processing operations that have been carried out is available to persons having access to the data.</p>\n<p>The document \"MET_ENQ_ENDD.pdf\" is a summary of the operations.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E430> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.6.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The committees that have given Insee the right and legitimacy to collect its data are:<br />- The Cnis, which examines each new project, whether it is a survey, a directory or the exploitation of administrative files ... These projects are presented by all the institutions that contribute by their work to producing public statistics. The discussion focuses in particular on the purpose of the project, its place in the information system and the conditions anticipated for its dissemination. Each operation must be examined to ensure it is in the general interest and does not duplicate existing sources of information, in other words to ensure that it is suitable. It provides an opinion on suitability.<br />- The quality label committee, within the Cnis, ensures that it meets the criteria of statistical quality. The committee checks that the survey meets the statistical quality criteria in so far as concerns the collection and sampling method (survey design, data correction method, handling of non-responses guaranteeing the reliability of results..), relevance of the questions and adaptation of the distribution to the objectives announced. It also checks that the survey does not place an excessive burden on the respondents, that consultations have been held with the partners concerned and that any wishes expressed by the CNIS during the debate on suitability were taken into account. It gives a quality label of general interest and statistical quality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.15.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The unit investigated is the legal unit. The answers therefore concern the whole company, not its establishments. The location entered in the survey file is the location of the head office establishment.<br />Regional statistics should take into account their respective accuracies. See the tables provided in the accuracy indicators file.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.8.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Premi&egrave;re publication en novembre 2017.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is subject to an internal database archiving procedure.<br />Individual files are made available to users outside Insee via the CASD, after being reviewed by the Confidentiality Committee.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>At the time of collection, three types of controls were carried out, covering:<br />&nbsp;- partial non-response;<br />&nbsp;- internal consistency (filtered/filtered question);<br />&nbsp;- internal likelihood (size of the company/response, answer between questions from different blocks).<br />A data clearance is carried out to ensure internal consistency.<br />During the adjustments, it is verified that the different re-weighting phases do not change the weights too much, that all partial non-response of the respondents in the field is corrected and that the correction of partial non-response is not added illogical between the filtered and filtered questions.</p>\n<p>Precision calculations have been made to measure the quality of the indicators.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/314>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice du questionnaire de l'enquête sur les entreprises et le développement durable"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2016-06-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/DOC_ENQ_ENDD_NOTICE_2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>De juin &agrave; octobre 2016.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Before any exploitation, it is also useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and the confidence intervals provided in the survey's quality indicators.</p>\n<p>Variables to be carefully analysed (non-exhaustive list):<br />D5_ENV_PARTCA<br />Response time</p>\n<p>These are the variables with the highest rates of partial non-response (threshold arbitrarily set at 5%). These variables should be interpreted with caution since a significant portion of the responses have been imputed.</p>\n<p>Other factors to consider include the accuracy of the estimates (confidence intervals) and whether or not to cross the variable with diffusion domains.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>To avoid measurement errors:<br />&nbsp;- the questionnaire was tested with 51 companies face-to-face with an interviewer. There were companies from different sectors, 21 were small companies (20 to 49 employees), with the simplified questionnaire, and 30 had 50 or more employees. As a result of these tests, the questionnaires were modified: some questions were clarified or reformulated, others were deleted or filtered;<br />&nbsp;- instructions were given to managers: many questions were open to interpretation such as the feeling of carrying out RSE actions. A two-day training session was held, the content of which was a general presentation of the EnDD 2016 survey and the presentation of collection tools and management application;<br />&nbsp;- the managers contacted the companies whose answers came out during the collection checks;<br />&nbsp;- a clearance was carried out to make the questionnaires consistent.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>This survey has several types of users: the general public for studies directly or through journalists, associations and politicians working in this field, researchers,... This public includes users with more or less knowledge of the field and statistics.<br />Two consultation committees were held. The users present were: Insee, CGDD, Dares, the Mediator of inter-company relations, representatives of Medef, CFDT, CFDT, Nicolas Hulot Foundation, National CSR Platform, Paris IX-Irisso University, Paris V Descartes University, Banque de France, CEE, CCI Paris Ile-de-France, Association les amis de la mon&eacute;tarisation, Paris I University, Cnam.<br />The conclusions of the first meeting were to interview companies in the legal sense of having more than 10 or 20 employees, including the financial sector, using a very broadly common questionnaire using the 2011 European definition based on practices and effects and no longer on the voluntary aspect of the approach. Particular attention should be paid to certain questions to ensure continuity with the 2011 survey.<br />Those of the second meeting (with a first version of the questionnaire) were:<br />- in order to avoid the risk of \"green washing\" and the lack of precision of the answers obtained, reproaches made to the 2011 survey, the project at this stage is to systematically question on the commitment of companies, more specific questions of concrete actions, instances or procedures for regular monitoring of the announced objectives.<br />- the limitation of the duration and complexity of the questioning appeared to be imperative. That is why arbitrations have been made. The questionnaire for the smallest companies in the field, i.e. companies with 20 to 49 employees, has been simplified.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.1.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.7>
                    "01 87 69 61 70"@fr , "01 87 69 61 70"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>The situation described is that of the company at the time the information was collected in 2016.</p>"@en , "<p>La situation d&eacute;crite est celle de l&rsquo;entreprise au moment de la collecte des informations en 2016.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te fait l'objet d'une proc&eacute;dure d'archivage interne des bases de donn&eacute;es.<br />Les fichiers individuels sont mis &agrave; disposition des utilisateurs ext&eacute;rieurs &agrave; l&rsquo;Insee via le CASD, apr&egrave;s avis favorable du Comit&eacute; du secret.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The directory used to draw the sample is the Statistical Unit Register Registration System. Its coverage of companies is rather good, we consider that all company creations are registered, the SIREN number being mandatory for all administrative procedures. However, not all terminations may be properly recorded.<br /><br />There is no other survey on the same subject in the public statistical service. The integrated approach to business practices in the different dimensions of corporate social responsibility makes it unique. The survey designers ensured that the questions were relevant in these different dimensions, and in particular that they did not overlap with questions already existing elsewhere (e. g. working conditions in the company or waste treatment).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/E> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Eurostat SIMS (Simple Integrated Metadata Structure) quality sheet.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Dans l'enqu&ecirc;te, la nomenclature d&rsquo;activit&eacute; fran&ccedil;aise (NAF r&eacute;v. 2) est utilis&eacute;e pour coder l&rsquo;activit&eacute; principale exerc&eacute;e (APE).<br />Les domaines de diffusion sont&nbsp;:<br />- l'appartenance &agrave; un groupe&nbsp;;<br />- le secteur de l'entreprise, dont les modalit&eacute;s sont&nbsp;:<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Industrie agro-alimentaire&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Autres industries&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &Eacute;nergie environnement&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Commerce de gros&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Commerce de d&eacute;tail, r&eacute;paration et service personnels&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transports et entreposage ;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; H&eacute;bergement et restauration&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Information et communication&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Activit&eacute;s immobili&egrave;res&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Activit&eacute;s sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;es, scientifiques et techniques&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Activit&eacute;s de services administratifs et de soutien.<br />- la taille de l'entreprise en 4 tranches&nbsp;:<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; de 20 &agrave; 49 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; de 50 &agrave; 249 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; de 250 &agrave; 499 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 500 salari&eacute;s ou plus.<br />- &eacute;ventuellement, la r&eacute;gion du si&egrave;ge de l'entreprise.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E401> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.12.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Cette enqu&ecirc;te a plusieurs types d'utilisateurs&nbsp;: le grand public pour les &eacute;tudes directement ou par l'interm&eacute;diaire des journalistes, des associations et des politiques s'occupant de ce domaine, des chercheurs, &hellip; Ce public regroupe des utilisateurs ayant plus ou moins de connaissances du domaine et de la statistique.<br />Deux comit&eacute;s de concertation ont eu lieu. Les utilisateurs pr&eacute;sents &eacute;taient&nbsp;: l&rsquo;Insee, le CGDD, la Dares, le M&eacute;diateur des relations interentreprises, des repr&eacute;sentants du Medef, de la CFDT, de la Fondation Nicolas Hulot, de la Plate-forme nationale RSE, de l&rsquo;Universit&eacute; Paris IX-Irisso, de l&rsquo;Universit&eacute; Paris V Descartes, de la&nbsp; Banque de France, du CEE, CCI Paris Ile-de-France, de l&rsquo;Association les amis de la mon&eacute;tarisation, de l&rsquo;Universit&eacute; Paris I, du Cnam.<br />Les conclusions de la premi&egrave;re r&eacute;union ont &eacute;t&eacute; d'interroger les entreprises au sens l&eacute;gal de plus de 10 ou 20 salari&eacute;s, en incluant le secteur financier, &agrave; partir d&rsquo;un questionnaire tr&egrave;s largement commun se servant&nbsp; de la d&eacute;finition&nbsp; europ&eacute;enne de 2011 fond&eacute;e sur les pratiques et effets et non plus sur l&rsquo;aspect volontaire de la d&eacute;marche. Une attention particuli&egrave;re devait &ecirc;tre port&eacute;e &agrave; certaines questions pour assurer une continuit&eacute; avec l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te de 2011.<br />Celles de la deuxi&egrave;me r&eacute;union (avec une premi&egrave;re version du questionnaire) ont &eacute;t&eacute; :<br />- afin d&rsquo;&eacute;viter le risque de &laquo;&nbsp;green washing&nbsp;&raquo; et le manque de pr&eacute;cision des r&eacute;ponses obtenues, reproches faits &agrave; l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te de 2011, le projet &agrave; cette &eacute;tape est d&rsquo;interroger syst&eacute;matiquement sur l&rsquo;engagement des entreprises, des questions plus pr&eacute;cises d&rsquo;actions concr&egrave;tes, les instances ou proc&eacute;dures de suivi r&eacute;gulier des objectifs annonc&eacute;s.<br />- la limitation de la dur&eacute;e et de la complexit&eacute; du questionnement sont apparues comme imp&eacute;ratives. C&rsquo;est pourquoi des arbitrages ont &eacute;t&eacute; faits. Le questionnaire pour les plus petites des entreprises du champ, soit les entreprises de 20 &agrave; 49 salari&eacute;s, a &eacute;t&eacute; simplifi&eacute;.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Fiche qualit&eacute; au format SIMS (Simple Integrated Metadata Structure) d&rsquo;Eurostat.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur les entreprises et le développement durable 2016"@fr , "Quality report: Companies and sustainable development 2016"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1306> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/P> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The methodology is described in the document &laquo;M&eacute;thodes et pratique des enqu&ecirc;tes entreprises.pdf&raquo;.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>11&nbsp;000 unit&eacute;s l&eacute;gales interrog&eacute;es.<br />Celles de 500 salari&eacute;s ou plus sont interrog&eacute;es exhaustivement, soit 2&nbsp;158 sur un &eacute;chantillon total de 11&nbsp;000 unit&eacute;s.<br />Les strates sont &eacute;tablies suivant l&rsquo;activit&eacute; principale exerc&eacute;e (division) par l'entreprise, sa taille (4 tranches d&rsquo;effectifs), son appartenance &agrave; un groupe et sa r&eacute;gion.<br />L'allocation dans les strates non exhaustives est la moyenne d'une allocation proportionnelle au nombre d'unit&eacute;s l&eacute;gales dans la strate et d'une allocation proportionnelle au nombre d'unit&eacute;s l&eacute;gales effectuant des actes de RSE mesur&eacute; par l'enqu&ecirc;te de 2011.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Lors de la collecte des contr&ocirc;les de trois types&nbsp;ont &eacute;t&eacute; effectu&eacute;s et portaient sur&nbsp;:<br />&nbsp;- la non r&eacute;ponse partielle&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;- la coh&eacute;rence interne (question filtre/filtr&eacute;)&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;- la vraisemblance interne (taille de l'entreprise/r&eacute;ponse, r&eacute;ponse entre des questions de blocs diff&eacute;rents)&nbsp;;<br />Un apurement des donn&eacute;es est r&eacute;alis&eacute; pour avoir une coh&eacute;rence interne.<br />Lors des redressements, il est v&eacute;rifi&eacute; que les diff&eacute;rentes phase de re-pond&eacute;rations ne modifie pas trop les poids, que toute la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle des individus r&eacute;pondant du champ est &eacute;t&eacute; corrig&eacute;e et que la correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle n'est pas ajout&eacute; d'illogisme entre les questions filtres et filtr&eacute;es.</p>\n<p>Des calculs de pr&eacute;cision permettent de mesurer la qualit&eacute; des indicateurs.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/994>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Méthodes et pratique des enquêtes entreprises"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2018-11-29"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/MethodesEtPratiqueDesEnquetesEntreprises.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.12.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.12.3>
                    "<p>Les tableaux (Insee r&eacute;sultats) qui seront publi&eacute;s reprendront toutes les questions ou quasiment (la part de oui) sur les diff&eacute;rents domaines.</p>"@fr , "<p>The tables (Insee results) that will be published will include all or almost all the questions (the yes part) on the different fields.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Law n&deg; 51-711 of 7 June 1951 on obligations, co-ordination and confidentiality in respect of statistics. Available from <a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573&amp;categorieLien=cid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a>.<br /><br />Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L. 213-3 of the French Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires endorsed as provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to private and family life and, in general, to private acts and conduct can not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after examining the opinion of the Statistical Confidentiality Committee and relating to a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, be the subject of any communication by the depositary service before the expiry of a period of seventy-five years following the date of completion of the survey or a period of twenty-five years from the death of the person concerned, whichever is the shorter.<br />A Statistical Confidentiality Committee is set up. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to the confidentiality of statistics. It expresses its opinion on requests for the communication of individual data collected pursuant to this law. The committee is chaired by a State Councillor, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes in particular representatives of the French National Assembly and Senate. The composition and operating methods of the committee are set by decree of the Council of State. Recipients of the data communications resulting from Ministerial decisions made after consulting the Statistical Confidentiality Committee agree to not communicate these data to anyone. Any violation of the provisions of this paragraph is punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Penal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/313>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire de l'enquête sur les entreprises et le développement durable /  (EnDD)"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2016-06-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/DOC_ENQ_ENDD_QUEST_2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour &eacute;viter les erreurs de mesure&nbsp;:<br />&nbsp;- le questionnaire a &eacute;t&eacute; test&eacute; aupr&egrave;s de 51 entreprises en face &agrave; face avec un enqu&ecirc;teur. Test r&eacute;alis&eacute; aupr&egrave;s d&rsquo;entreprises de diff&eacute;rents secteurs, 21 petites entreprises (20 &agrave; 49 salari&eacute;s), ayant le questionnaire all&eacute;g&eacute;, et 30 entreprises de 50 salari&eacute;s ou plus. Suite &agrave; ces tests, les questionnaires ont &eacute;t&eacute; modifi&eacute;s&nbsp;: certaines questions ont &eacute;t&eacute; pr&eacute;cis&eacute;es ou reformul&eacute;es, d&rsquo;autres ont &eacute;t&eacute; supprim&eacute;es ou filtr&eacute;es&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;- des consignes ont &eacute;t&eacute; donn&eacute;es aux gestionnaires&nbsp;: beaucoup de question laissaient place &agrave; de l'interpr&eacute;tation comme celle portant sur le sentiment de mener des actions de RSE. Une formation a eu lieu sur deux journ&eacute;es, dont le contenu &eacute;tait une pr&eacute;sentation g&eacute;n&eacute;rale de l'enqu&ecirc;te EnDD 2016, la pr&eacute;sentation des outils de collecte et l'application de gestion&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;- les gestionnaires ont contact&eacute; les entreprises dont les r&eacute;ponses ressortaient lors des contr&ocirc;les de collecte&nbsp;;<br />&nbsp;- des contr&ocirc;les de coh&eacute;rence (apurement) suivis de corrections ont &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;alis&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.3.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.15.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.15.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>In the survey, the French activity nomenclature (NAF rev. 2) is used to code the main activity carried out (APE).<br />The fields of diffusion are:<br />- membership in a group;<br />- the company sector, the terms and conditions of which are as follows:<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Food and beverage industry;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Other industries;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Energy environment;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Construction;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Wholesale trade;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Retail trade, repairs and personal service;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Transport and storage;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Accommodation and catering;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Information and communication;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Real estate activities;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Specialized, scientific and technical activities;<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Administrative and support services activities.<br />- the size of the company whose terms and conditions are:<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; from 20 to 49 employees,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; from 50 to 249 employees,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; from 250 to 499 employees,<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 500 employees or more.<br />- possibly, the region of the company's headquarters.\"</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.15.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;unit&eacute; enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;e est l&rsquo;unit&eacute; l&eacute;gale. Les r&eacute;ponses portent donc sur l&rsquo;ensemble de l&rsquo;entreprise, et non pas sur ses &eacute;tablissements. La localisation renseign&eacute;e dans le fichier de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te est la localisation de l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement si&egrave;ge.<br />Les statistiques r&eacute;gionales doivent tenir compte de leurs pr&eacute;cisions respectives, Voir les tableaux fournis dans le fichier indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Follow-up and controls have been implemented to avoid non-response. The survey was collected from June to October 2016. In addition to telephone reminders, a reminder by mail was sent, followed, if necessary, by a formal notice and a statement of non-response.<br />The file \"Effet redressement sur agr&eacute;gats.pdf\" summarizes the deviations on the aggregate from the adjustment (clearance, imputation and correction of total non-response) for the target variables.\"</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La non-r&eacute;ponse totale est trait&eacute;e par constitution de groupe homog&egrave;ne de r&eacute;ponse (GRH) puis par re-pond&eacute;ration, les entreprises voient leur poids divis&eacute; par leur probabilit&eacute; de r&eacute;ponse (celle du GRH).<br />La variance apr&egrave;s calage d'une variable est &eacute;gale &agrave; la variance des r&eacute;sidus de la r&eacute;gression de celle-ci sur les variables de calage.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> , <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The questionnaire addresses the following topics based on mainly qualitative questions, i. e. calling for answers in the form of yes / no: <br />- societal: relations with customers, suppliers, civil society;<br />- social issues, including the fight against discrimination in the workplace, social dialogue;<br />- the environment: the fight against climate change, sobriety in the management of resources and energy, preservation of the natural environment;<br />- corporate social responsibility: knowledge of corporate social responsibility and actions carried out with a view to corporate social responsibility;<br />- corporate governance and internal organization.<br /><br />The term \"corporate social responsibility\" did not appear in the survey name at the time of collection, and questions on corporate social responsibility are only asked at the end of the questionnaire. This is a voluntary approach because the term \"sustainable development\" was considered to be better known than the concept of corporate social responsibility. In this way, the survey makes it possible to assess, on the one hand, the awareness of the term \"corporate social responsibility\" among companies, and, on the other hand, the actions of companies that \"do corporate social responsibility without knowing it\".</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1655/S.13.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1655> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/993>
