            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Collection takes place by mail, with an opportunity to respond by Internet the past two years, using a self-administered questionnaire, from September to December of the current year. The questionnaire is different depending on whether the institution belongs to the sector the automotive industry (questionnaire 2012 for vehicle manufacturers) or is connected to the sector (questionnaire 2012 to institutions in the automotive industry)."@en ;
