    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1886/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The Companies which are monthlydeclaring VAT are those falling under the \"actual normal tax system\". This system applies to service provider companies generating a turnover of more than &euro; 236,000 as well as to companies selling goods or dwellings and generating a turnover of more than &euro; 783,000. Companies for which value added tax due amount doesn't exceed &euro; 4,000 for a given year&nbsp;may however present VAT declarations quarterly.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1886/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A partir de janvier 2009, les indices de chiffre d'affaires sont calcul&eacute;s selon la nomenclature agr&eacute;g&eacute;e NA, fond&eacute;e sur la NAF r&eacute;v. 2 entr&eacute;e en vigueur le 1er janvier 2008.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1886/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>\"Whole France\" (except French Guyana and Mayotte which are not liable&nbsp; to VAT</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1886/S.18.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1886/S.18.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1886/S.18.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1886> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/115>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Une meilleure prise en compte de la démographie d’entreprises dans les indices mensuels de chiffre d’affaires via une exploitation de l'exhaustivité des déclarations mensuelles de TVA"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
