    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1525/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Strengthened exploitation of two administrative sources:<br /><br />- the files of income annual statements of enterprises: Industrial and Commercial Profits System (BIC), Non-Commercial Profits system (BNC) or Agricultural Profits (BA), coming from the DGFiP;<br /><br />- the annual declarations of social data (DADS).<br /><br />These two administrative sources are completed by statistical surveys&nbsp;: the annual production survey (EAP) on industry, and the annual sectoral survey (ESA) for other sectors of activity.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1525/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "4.5 millions companies concerned by the scheme, approximately 2.9 millions belong to the field on which we realize the statistical surveys ESA and EAP."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1525/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Main tax data: turnover, gross operating surplus (EBITDA), value added (VA), accounting result, fixed assets, sales margin, total employment, paid employment, self-employment, etc.</p>\n<p>Associated ratios: turnover per employee, VA per employee, annual gross wage per employee, fixed assets per employee, total assets per employee, gross margin rate (EBITDA/VA), export rate etc.</p>\n<p>The turnover's breakdown by activity, which allows the determination of the main activity (APE code).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1525/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1525/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1525/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1525> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1525/S.10.6>
