    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.3.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.9>
                    "<p>En annuel&nbsp;: 2007, soit le premier mill&eacute;sime issu du dispositif Estel.<br />En trimestriel&nbsp;: derni&egrave;re estimation annuelle d&rsquo;emploi connue (ann&eacute;e N-1 ou N-2).</p>"@fr , "<p>Annually: 2007.<br />Quarterly: last annual employment Estimates computed.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1754> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.17.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.17.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.17.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.17.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1754> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.15.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les Estimations d&rsquo;emploi donnent des r&eacute;sultats tr&egrave;s comparables aux comptes nationaux, dans la mesure o&ugrave; les sources et m&eacute;thodes utilis&eacute;es sont largement partag&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.8.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.8.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.8.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.8.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1754> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.17.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les r&eacute;visions entre publications (trimestrielles ou annuelles) sont syst&eacute;matiquement pr&eacute;sent&eacute;es et comment&eacute;es dans les publications. Les plus importantes font l&rsquo;objet d&rsquo;une explication d&eacute;taill&eacute;e dans la fiche m&eacute;thodologique attach&eacute;e &agrave; chaque publication.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Nomenclature d'activit&eacute;s fran&ccedil;aise r&eacute;vis&eacute;e 2 (Naf r&eacute;v.2).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.3.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.3.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.3.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1754> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The CNIL declaration n&deg;494569 of 27 January 1998, as amended, defines the rules of confidentiality and anonymisation applicable to social declarations (DADS then DSN) processed by INSEE.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2017-10-26"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1754> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The annual Estimates cover total employment (employed and self-employed) in France (excl. Mayotte), over all business sectors. Detail is available as follows: <br />- Metropolitan France: level A88 of Naf r&eacute;v.2 for paid employment; level A5 for self-employed<br />-&nbsp;&laquo;&nbsp;R&eacute;gions&nbsp;&raquo; and &laquo;&nbsp;d&eacute;partments&nbsp;&raquo;: level A38 for paid employment; level A5 for self-employed<br />- Areas of employment: level A5 for paid emloyment;&nbsp; total level for self-employed.</p>\n<p>The quarterly Estimates cover only paid employment in France (excl. Mayotte), over all business sectors. Detail is available as follows: <br />- France: level A38 of Naf r&eacute;v.2 and some levels A88 (Transportation and storage, construction, wholesale and retail trade, accomodation and food service activities)<br />- &laquo;&nbsp;R&eacute;gions&nbsp;&raquo; and &laquo;&nbsp;d&eacute;partments&nbsp;&raquo;: level A17</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.15.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.15.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1754/S.15.1/text> ;
