            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'ILC est calcul&eacute; comme la somme pond&eacute;r&eacute;e de trois indices :<br />- indice des prix &agrave; la consommation, hors tabac et loyers, publi&eacute; pour l'ensemble des m&eacute;nages de France m&eacute;tropolitaine et des d&eacute;partements d'outre-mer (IPCL) ;<br />- indice du co&ucirc;t de la construction (ICC) ;<br />- indice de chiffre d'affaires du commerce d&eacute;tail, en valeur, corrig&eacute; des variations saisonni&egrave;res et des jours ouvr&eacute;s (ICAVaCD).<br /><br />Ces trois indices interviennent dans le calcul de l'ILC avec la pond&eacute;ration&nbsp; suivante :<br />Indice trimestriel des loyers commerciaux (ILC) = 50 % mIPCL + 25 % mICC + 25 % mICAVaCD.<br /><br />Chacun des trois indices composant l'ILC est calcul&eacute; en moyenne :<br />- sur 12 mois cons&eacute;cutifs pour les prix &agrave; la consommation (mIPC) et le chiffre d'affaires (mICAVaCD) qui sont des indices mensuels ;<br />- sur 4 trimestres pour le co&ucirc;t de la construction, indice calcul&eacute; trimestriellement (mICC).<br /><br />Pour calculer ces moyennes, le dernier mois (ou trimestre) consid&eacute;r&eacute; correspond au dernier mois du trimestre (ou au trimestre) de calcul de l'ILC. L'ILC, de m&ecirc;me que chaque indice le composant, est exprim&eacute; en retenant la r&eacute;f&eacute;rence 100 au 1er trimestre 2008.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/799> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/68> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1783/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The ILC is calculated as the weighted sum of three indices:<br />- Consumer Price Index, excluding tobacco and rents, published for all households in Metropolitan France and French Overseas Departments (IPCL)<br />- Cost-of-construction (ICC) index<br />- Retail Trades Index, in value, corrected for seasonal variations and calendar effects (ICAVaCD).<br /><br />These three indices are used to calculate the ILC with the following weighting:<br />Quarterly Commercial Lease Index (ILC) = 50% mIPCL + 25% mICC + 25% mICAVaCD.<br /><br />Each of the three indices comprising the ILC is calculated as a mean:<br />- Over 12 consecutive months for consumer prices (mIPC) and the turnover (mICAVaCD), which are monthly indices<br />- Over 4 quarters for the cost of construction, an index calculated on a quarterly basis (mICC).<br /><br />In order to calculate these means, the last month (or quarter) considered corresponds to the last month of the quarter (or to the quarter) of calculation of the ILC. The ILC, like each of its constituent indices, is expressed in relation to the reference 100 in the first quarter of 2008.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/608> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1783/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-07-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1783> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1783/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1783> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/68>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Indice des loyers commerciaux / ILC"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2016-06-21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/MET_ILC_FR_2016.pdf> .
}

