                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1589> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1795> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L' IPCH est fond&eacute; sur les collectes effectu&eacute;es pour le calcul de l'IPC. Chaque &Eacute;tat membre fournit des indices qui permettent le calcul de sous-indices compatibles avec la classification COICOP/IPCH (classification des fonctions de la consommation individuelle des m&eacute;nages adapt&eacute;e aux exigences du calcul des indices des prix &agrave; la consommation harmonis&eacute;s).<br /><br />Les IPCH sont fond&eacute;s sur des &eacute;chantillons permettant d'obtenir des r&eacute;sultats fiables et comparables compte tenu de la diversit&eacute;&nbsp;nationale des produits et des prix ainsi que des changements des points de vente et des produits.<br /><br />L'importance relative de la d&eacute;pense des consommateurs pour chaque bien ou service variant d'un pays &agrave; l'autre il n'existe aucun&nbsp;\"panier uniforme\" s'appliquant &agrave; tous les &Eacute;tats membres.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2017-02-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.19/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.19/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The HICP is based on the data collected to calculate the CPI. Each Member State supplies indices that are used to calculate sub-indices compatible with COICOP/HICP (classification of individual consumption by purpose, adapted to the needs of the calculation of the harmonised consumer price indices).<br /><br />The HICP are based on samples that are used to obtain reliable and comparable results, bearing in mind the national diversity of products and prices, as well as changes to retail outlets and products.<br /><br />As the relative level of consumer expenditure for each good or service varies from country to country, there is no \"uniform basket\" applicable to all the member States.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Harmonised index of consumer prices"@en , "Rapport qualité : Indice des prix à la consommation harmonisé"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/produits/indicateur/p1654> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1795> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The harmonised consumer price indices (HICP) have not replaced the national CPIs. They are intended for international comparisons and calculation of a price indices for the European Union.<br /><br />The creation of the Monetary Union reinforced the role of the HICP, the principal instrument used to guide monetary policy in the eurozone.<br /><br />In the case of France, the CPI and HICP follow quite similar trends, reflecting their methodological similarity. However, the CPI and HICP do not have the same scope: the HICP's scope covers final household consumption monetary expenditure.<br /><br />The HICP monitors the \"net\" prices of administrative reimbursements, whereas the CPI monitors the \"gross\" prices, which are representative of the purchase price of the products consumed.<br /><br />The indexes and weightings calculated are therefore different in the sectors where cost coverage by the national authorities is high (health, social welfare services).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1795/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les indices de prix &agrave; la consommation harmonis&eacute;s (IPCH) ne se substituent pas aux IPC nationaux. Ils sont destin&eacute;s aux comparaisons internationales et au calcul d'un indice de prix pour l'Union europ&eacute;enne.<br /><br />La mise en place de l'Union mon&eacute;taire renforce le r&ocirc;le de l'IPCH, principal instrument de pilotage de la politique mon&eacute;taire dans la zone Euro.<br /><br />Dans le cas de la France l'IPC et l'IPCH ont des &eacute;volutions assez voisines, reflet de leur proximit&eacute; m&eacute;thodologique. IPC et IPCH diff&egrave;rent toutefois sur leur champ : celui de l'IPCH est la d&eacute;pense de consommation finale mon&eacute;taire des m&eacute;nages.<br /><br />L'IPCH suit les prix \"nets\" des remboursements des administrations alors que l'IPC suit les prix \"bruts\", repr&eacute;sentatifs des prix d'achat des produits consomm&eacute;s.<br /><br />Les indices et pond&eacute;rations calcul&eacute;s sont donc diff&eacute;rents dans les secteurs o&ugrave; la&nbsp;prise en charge par la collectivit&eacute; nationale est importante (sant&eacute;, services de protection sociale).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1674> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The scope of the survey covered all people aged between 18 and 65, living in ordinary housing."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Le champ de l'enquête correspond à l'ensemble des personnes âgées de 18 à 65 ans, résidant dans un logement ordinaire."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Training and vocational skills survey 2003"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête Formation et qualification professionnelle 2003"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1377> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The FQP survey was conducted in 1964, 1970, 1977, 1985, 1993 and 2003.</p>\n<p>In 2003, by using identical questions to those used in the previous surveys, comparisons could be made of the different topics over time.</p>\n<p>Data were collected by INSEE researchers in face-to-face interviews with the respondents and using a computer-assisted data collection method (CAPI).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.19/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.19/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Comme les &eacute;ditions pr&eacute;c&eacute;dentes de l'enqu&ecirc;te, le questionnaire s'articule autour de cinq volets :</p>\n<p>- la mobilit&eacute; professionnelle ;<br />- la formation initiale ;<br />- la formation continue ;<br />- l'origine sociale ;<br />- les revenus du travail.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Des logements, identifi&eacute;s sur le terrain, n'ont pu donner lieu &agrave; une enqu&ecirc;te : ils ne sont pas habit&eacute;s r&eacute;guli&egrave;rement, ils abritent des personnes qui n'ont pas pu r&eacute;pondre (inaptitude en raison de probl&egrave;me de sant&eacute; mentale, par exemple), etc.</p>\n<p>Ainsi, au final et compte tenu des refus de r&eacute;ponse ou de l'impossibilit&eacute; de joindre les personnes, l'enqu&ecirc;te porte sur pr&egrave;s de&nbsp;40 000 personnes.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te FQP a &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;alis&eacute;e en 1964, 1970, 1977, 1985, 1993 et 2003.</p>\n<p>En 2003, la reprise &agrave; l'identique de questions des enqu&ecirc;tes pr&eacute;c&eacute;dentes permet des comparaisons temporelles sur les diff&eacute;rents th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s.</p>\n<p>La collecte a &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par les enqu&ecirc;teurs de l'Insee dans le cadre d'entretiens en face &agrave; face avec les enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s et au moyen d'une collecte assist&eacute;e par informatique (CAPI).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2010-04-19"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/278> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/P> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>As in previous editions of the survey, the questionnaire was divided into five sections:</p>\n<p>- professional mobility;<br />- initial training;<br />- continuing training;<br />- social origin;<br />- income from work.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/I> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/territoireFrancais/franceMetropolitaine> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/278>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "La méthodologie de l'enquête sur la Formation et la Qualification professionnelle / FQP"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2006-11-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/FQP.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "L'échantillon cible comprend environ 40 000 logements, tirés dans l'échantillon-maître de l'Insee."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The target sample consisted of about 40,000 dwellings, taken from the INSEE master sample."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Some dwellings identified in the field could not be surveyed: they were not regularly inhabited, the inhabitants were unable to&nbsp;respond (e.g. due to mental health problems), etc.</p>\n<p>Ultimately, therefore, and taking into account people who refused to participate or who were impossible to contact, the survey included almost 40,000 people.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1674/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1674> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1553> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.16/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le temps de r&eacute;ponse m&eacute;dian (estim&eacute; apr&egrave;s redressement) est de 30 minutes.<br />Le comit&eacute; du label s&rsquo;assure que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te n&rsquo;entra&icirc;ne pas de charge excessive sur les enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s, De plus, d'autres d&eacute;cisions ont &eacute;t&eacute; prises afin de limiter la charge des r&eacute;pondants&nbsp;: <br />- coordination n&eacute;gative de l'&eacute;chantillon de TIC avec les &eacute;chantillons d'un certain nombre d'autres enqu&ecirc;tes ;<br />- collecte &eacute;lectronique ;<br />- possibilit&eacute; de valider les derniers chiffres d'affaires et effectifs connus, pr&eacute;-remplis dans le questionnaire ;<br />- possibilit&eacute; de r&eacute;pondre &agrave; certaines questions en&nbsp;% si la valeur exacte en nombre est inconnue.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sample is drawn from a sampling frame constructed from the Sirus inventory using a simple random sampling design stratified by activity, workforce segment and region where possible. The calculation of the allocations combines a Neyman allocation on the rate of innovative units and a proportional allocation on the number of innovative units, which makes it possible on the one hand to be precise on the central variable of the survey (the innovation rate) and also to query a reasonable number of innovative units in order to ensure satisfactory accuracy for questions concerning only these units.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.6.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les comit&eacute;s qui ont donn&eacute; &agrave; l'Insee le droit et la l&eacute;gitimit&eacute; pour collecter ces donn&eacute;es sont&nbsp;:<br />- Le Cnis qui examine chaque nouveau projet, qu&rsquo;il s&rsquo;agisse d&rsquo;une enqu&ecirc;te, d&rsquo;un r&eacute;pertoire ou d&rsquo;une exploitation de fichiers administratifs&hellip; Ces projets sont pr&eacute;sent&eacute;s par toutes les institutions qui contribuent par leurs travaux &agrave; la construction de la statistique publique. La discussion porte notamment sur la finalit&eacute; du projet, sa place dans le syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;information et les conditions pr&eacute;vues de sa diffusion. Il convient de v&eacute;rifier que chaque op&eacute;ration r&eacute;pond &agrave; un besoin d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et ne fait pas double emploi avec les sources d&rsquo;information existantes, en d&rsquo;autres termes de s&rsquo;assurer de son opportunit&eacute;. Il donne un avis d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute;.<br />- Le comit&eacute; du label, au sein du Cnis, veille &agrave; ce qu&rsquo;il respecte les crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique. Celui-ci s&rsquo;assure que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te r&eacute;pond aux crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique en ce qui concerne la m&eacute;thode de collecte et d&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage (plan de sondage, m&eacute;thode de redressement des donn&eacute;es, traitement des non-r&eacute;ponses garantissant la fiabilit&eacute; des r&eacute;sultats...), de pertinence du questionnement et d&rsquo;adaptation de la diffusion aux objectifs annonc&eacute;s. Il s&rsquo;assure &eacute;galement que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te n&rsquo;entra&icirc;ne pas de charge excessive sur les enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s, qu&rsquo;une concertation a &eacute;t&eacute; men&eacute;e avec les partenaires concern&eacute;s et que les souhaits exprim&eacute;s par le Cnis lors du d&eacute;bat d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute; ont bien &eacute;t&eacute; pris en compte. Il donne un label d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et de qualit&eacute; statistique.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.5/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.5/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/976>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Qualité de l'enquête relative à l'exercice 2016"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2018-09-12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Fiche_qualite_CIS2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/477>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire 2016 relatif à l'enquête communautaire sur l'innovation / CIS"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2017-05-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Questionnaire_CIS16.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.17.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pas de r&eacute;vision pr&eacute;vue sur les donn&eacute;es de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rents mill&eacute;simes des enqu&ecirc;tes CIS peuvent &ecirc;tre compar&eacute;s, modulo les changements &eacute;ventuels de formulation des questions. L'&eacute;volution des m&eacute;thodes de redressement peuvent affecter &agrave; la marge certaines &eacute;volutions.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.6.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The committees that gave INSEE the right and legitimacy to collect this data are:<br />- The CNIS, which examines each new project, whether it is a survey, a directory or an exploitation of administrative files... These projects are presented by all the institutions that contribute through their work to the construction of official statistics. The discussion focuses in particular on the purpose of the project, its place in the information system and the planned conditions for its dissemination. It should be verified that each operation meets a need of general interest and does not duplicate existing sources of information, in other words, to ensure that it is appropriate. He gives a notice of opportunity.<br />- The Label Committee within the CNIS ensures that it meets the statistical quality criteria. The latter ensures that the survey meets statistical quality criteria with regard to the collection and sampling method (sampling design, data adjustment method, treatment of non-responses guaranteeing the reliability of the results, etc.), the relevance of the questioning and the adaptation of the dissemination to the stated objectives. It also ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on the respondents, that consultation has been carried out with the partners concerned and that the wishes expressed by the CNIS during the opportunity debate have been taken into account. It gives a label of general interest and statistical quality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/974> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Results on Insee.fr<br />Eurostat indicators on <a href=\"http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/data/database\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/data/database</a></p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>CIS2016 was collected from May 11, 2017 to January 5, 2018, the date on which the Coltrane authentication portal was closed for this survey. It is carried out via the Internet (95% of returns) and, if necessary, by post (at the company's request).<br /><br />The geographical reference area covers metropolitan France and the overseas departments (DOM) including Mayotte.<br /><br />Units of measure :<br />- Employees (TEFF_coll) in number of employees;<br />- Amounts (CA, RALLX, RRDINX, RRDINX, RRDEXX, RMACX, ROEKX and ROTRX) in thousands of euros;<br />- Share of new products for one of the company's markets (TURNMAR), share of new products only for the company (TURNIN), share of unchanged products (TURNUNG), share of operating expenses devoted to logistics (LGPC), share of export turnover in 2014 (SLO14) and 2016 (SLO16) in percentage (%);<br />- Binary or multimodal variable for qualitative data.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.7.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Concernant la collecte internet, le site de collecte est enti&egrave;rement s&eacute;curis&eacute; et les normes en termes de gestion des codes d&rsquo;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te sont strictes. Pour les entreprises choisissant d&rsquo;utiliser le support papier, la saisie est assur&eacute;e par les gestionnaires, dans le strict respect de la confidentialit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es r&eacute;colt&eacute;es.<br />Avant la diffusion des donn&eacute;es le secret est appliqu&eacute;. Pour les donn&eacute;es relatives aux entreprises&nbsp;: on ne publie aucun r&eacute;sultat qui concerne moins de trois entreprises ou &eacute;tablissements. De m&ecirc;me, un r&eacute;sultat ne sera diffus&eacute; que si aucune entreprise ou &eacute;tablissement ne contribue &agrave; plus de 85% de ce r&eacute;sultat. Les suppression primaire correspondent aux cases ne r&eacute;pondant pas au crit&egrave;re ci-dessus. Le secret secondaire supprime d'autres cases pour que les donn&eacute;es ne puissent pas &ecirc;tre retrouv&eacute;es par addition soustraction avec les marge des tableaux. Le secret statistique est d&eacute;fini dans la loi n&deg;&nbsp;51-711 du 7 juin 1951.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/477> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/476> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour la diffusion,&nbsp;en plus des publications, il y a &eacute;galement&nbsp;des indicateurs de qualit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "The interrogation unit is the legal unit (UL), identified by its SIREN number, with the exception of 6 units which are interrogated in profiled companies (EP)."@en , "L’unité d’interrogation est l’unité légale (UL), identifiée par son numéro SIREN, à l'exception de 6 unités qui sont interrogées en entreprises profilées (EP)."@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s dans l'enqu&ecirc;te CIS sont les suivants&nbsp;:<br />- Pr&eacute;sence de l'innovation par type d'innovation (produits, proc&eacute;d&eacute;s, organisation, marketing)&nbsp;; <br />- Part en chiffre d'affaires des innovations de produits introduites entre 2014 et 2016&nbsp;;<br />- D&eacute;penses li&eacute;es aux activit&eacute;s d'innovation de produits et de proc&eacute;d&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- Existence de financements publics (nationaux, europ&eacute;ens) ; <br />- Formes de coop&eacute;ration pour le d&eacute;veloppement des innovations&nbsp;; <br />- Droits de propri&eacute;t&eacute; intellectuelle (d&eacute;p&ocirc;t de brevet, enregistrement de mod&egrave;le etc.) ;<br />- Entreprises non-innovantes&nbsp;: facteurs expliquant l&rsquo;absence d&rsquo;innovation sur la p&eacute;riode 2014-2016&nbsp;;<br />- Innovations de logistique.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/U> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Premi&egrave;re &ndash; Insee.fr<br />Insee R&eacute;sultats &ndash; Insee.fr<br />Eurostat Statistics explained - <a href=\"http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/Innovation_statistics/fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/Innovation_statistics/fr</a><br />European Innovation Scoreboard - <a href=\"http://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/innovation/facts-figures/scoreboards_fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/innovation/facts-figures/scoreboards_fr</a></p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different steps of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production: <br />- tests carried out prior to collection, with 11 companies<br />- stratified sample selection <br />- reminders and checks of data being collected <br />- clearance <br />- adjustment of total non-response <br />- shimming <br />- adjustment for partial non-response <br />- winsorisation</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2017X069EC"@fr , "2017X069EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/476>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice du questionnaire 2016 relatif à l'enquête communautaire sur l'innovation / CIS"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2017-03-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Notice_CIS2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/E> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Cf. Note m&eacute;thodologique</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, 92 541 Montrouge</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, 92 541 Montrouge</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/U> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For Internet collection, the collection site is completely secure and the standards for managing survey access codes are strict. For companies that choose to use paper, the data entry is carried out by the managers, with strict respect for the confidentiality of the data collected.<br />Before the data is released, confidentiality is applied. For company data: no results are published for less than three companies or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be disclosed if no company or establishment contributes more than 85% of that result. Primary deletions correspond to boxes that do not meet the above criteria. Secondary secrecy removes other boxes so that the data cannot be retrieved by subtraction with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in Act No.&nbsp;51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different vintages of the CIS surveys can be compared, modulating any changes in the wording of the questions. Changes in adjustment methods may affect certain changes at the margin.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.17.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.17.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.17.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.17.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For dissemination, in addition to publications, there are also data quality indicators.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    ""@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Act No.&nbsp;51-711 of 7 June 1951 on the obligation, coordination and secrecy of statistics. Available at https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573.<br /><br />Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality:<br />Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L.&nbsp;213-3 of the Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires bearing the visa provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to personal and family life and, in general, to private facts and conduct may not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after consulting the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality and in respect of a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, not to be communicated by the depositary service before the expiry of 75 years from the date of the survey or 25 years from the date of the person's death, whichever is the shorter.<br />A Committee on Statistical Confidentiality is hereby established. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to statistical confidentiality. It shall give its opinion on requests for the disclosure of individual data collected pursuant to this Law. The committee is chaired by a Councillor of State, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes representatives of the National Assembly and the Senate. The composition and operating procedures of the committee are determined by decree of the Conseil d'Etat. Beneficiaries of data communications resulting from ministerial decisions taken after consulting the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality undertake not to communicate such data to anyone. Any infringement of the provisions of this paragraph shall be punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Criminal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.11.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique&nbsp;:<br />- tests r&eacute;alis&eacute;s en amont de la collecte, aupr&egrave;s de 11 entreprises<br />- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon<br />- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte<br />- apurement<br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale<br />- calage<br />- redressement de la non r&eacute;ponse partielle<br />- winsorisation</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The enterprises belong to divisions 05 to 81 of NACE Rev. 2 (with the exception of 75: Veterinarians).</p>\n<p>Within Section K of NACE Rev2 (Divisions 64, 65 and 66), mutual banks (part of 64.19Z) and mutual insurance companies (part of 65.12Z) are treated separately:<br />- other monetary intermediaries\" (64.19Z) whose legal category (CJ) is 5195, 6595, 6596 or starting with 29 are excluded;<br />- those whose CJ starts with 51 or 65 and whose CJ is not 5195, 6595 or 6596 are only integrated from 50 or more employees;<br />- the other mutual insurance companies remain in the sampling frame.</p>\n<p>For mutual insurance companies, it is necessary to refer to the lists made available by ACAM (Autorit&eacute; de contr&ocirc;le des assurances et des mutuelles): <br />- Book III companies are declared out of scope;<br />- Book I and II companies are only in the field if their workforce is greater than or equal to 50 and if their CJ is worth one of the following codes (8210, 8290 or 9220, i.e. \"Mutual\", \"Other mutualist organisation\" and \"Declared Association\");<br />- the other mutual insurance companies remain in the sampling frame.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is subject to a database archiving procedure under GEN. <br />The individual files are made available to users outside INSEE via the CASD, after passing through the Secrecy Committee.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Controls during the collection phase<br />- Follow-ups during the collection phase: exhaustive mail reminders on non-respondents, priority telephone reminders on non-respondents<br />- Clearance to ensure consistency of responses within each questionnaire<br />- Winsorisation: control of the influence of atypical units<br />- Calculation of precision indicators</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.15.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.15.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/S.10.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1553> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1553/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
