<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1699> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/242>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire 2013 Enquête Loyers et charges (1ère interrogation)"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2013-01-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Questionnaire2013_1ere_interro.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Rents and Charges Survey 2013"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête Loyers et charges 2013"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1347> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Collection is carried out in January, April, July and October. This is a panel survey: the occupants of the accommodation are interviewed during 5 consecutive quarters.<br />The first and last interviews of a household are conducted by visits (and after any&nbsp;change of tenant, or in the event of any difficulties in obtaining information by telephone). Intermediate surveys are conducted by telephone.<br /><br />Survey in Guadeloupe since October 2010.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Characteristics of the residential building and accommodation (including conveniences);<br />- Rental method and benefits received;<br />- Total amounts of rents and charges.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte est effectu&eacute;e en janvier, avril, juillet et octobre.<br />Il s'agit d'une enqu&ecirc;te par panel : on interroge les occupants du logement pendant 5 trimestres cons&eacute;cutifs.<br />La premi&egrave;re et la derni&egrave;re interrogation d'un m&eacute;nage sont r&eacute;alis&eacute;es par visite (et apr&egrave;s tout changement de locataire ou en cas&nbsp;de difficult&eacute; &eacute;ventuelle d'obtention des informations par t&eacute;l&eacute;phone). Les interrogations interm&eacute;diaires sont men&eacute;es par t&eacute;l&eacute;phone.<br /><br />Enqu&ecirc;te en Guadeloupe depuis octobre 2010.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/241>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Pourquoi les ménages pauvres paient-ils des loyers plus ou moins élevés ? L’incidence des aides au logement en France"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2005-10-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/enq_loyer_charges_incidences_revenus.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Caract&eacute;ristiques de l'immeuble, du logement (dont les &eacute;l&eacute;ments de confort) ;<br />- Mode de location et aides per&ccedil;ues ;<br />- Montants des loyers et des charges.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Ensemble des r&eacute;sidences principales lou&eacute;es vides dont l'objet essentiel de la location est l'habitation.<br />Depuis 2013, l'enqu&ecirc;te&nbsp;en m&eacute;tropole porte uniquement sur les loyers du secteur libre (les logements du secteur HLM sont interrog&eacute;s via l'enqu&ecirc;te ELBS).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Chaque trimestre, environ 3 700 logements en m&eacute;tropole et 600 en Guadeloupe font partie de l'&eacute;chantillon &agrave; enqu&ecirc;ter.<br />Il s'agit de r&eacute;sidences principales lou&eacute;es vides dont l'objet essentiel de la location est l'habitation : les logements concern&eacute;s ne doivent pas avoir plus de 50 % de leur surface consacr&eacute;e &agrave; une activit&eacute; professionnelle.<br />Sont exclus du champ les logements en sous-location, les locations-ventes (ou locations-accession) ainsi que les logements occup&eacute;s &agrave; titre gratuit.<br />L'&eacute;chantillon est tir&eacute; dans l'&eacute;chantillon ma&icirc;tre de l'Insee (issu du recensement de la population).<br />Un cinqui&egrave;me de l'&eacute;chantillon est renouvel&eacute; chaque trimestre : l'&eacute;chantillon sortant se compose des logements interrog&eacute;s 5 fois&nbsp;et des logements hors champ &agrave; l'enqu&ecirc;te pr&eacute;c&eacute;dente.<br />On effectue chaque trimestre le remplacement du sous-&eacute;chantillon sortant par un sous &eacute;chantillon entrant.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/Q> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/241> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Each quarter, approximately 3,700 homes in Metropolitan France and 600 in Guadeloupe form part of the sample to be surveyed.<br />These are main residences rented in an unfurnished state, whose main purpose is residential: the accommodation concerned must not have more than 50% of its surface area used for a professional activity.<br />Sub-let accommodation, leases with purchase options (or rental/purchase schemes) and accommodation occupied on a free basis, are excluded from the field of the survey.<br />The sample is drawn from the INSEE master sample (derived from the population census).<br />One fifth of the sample is renewed each quarter: the outgoing sample consists of accommodation surveyed 5 times and accommodation which fell outside the scope of the previous survey.<br />Each quarter, the outgoing sub-sample is replaced by an incoming sub-sample.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/242> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/243> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-07-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>All main residences rented in an unfurnished state which essential reason for the rental is housing.<br />Since 2013, the scope of the survey in metropolitan France has been restricted to the private sector (social sector is collected through the quarterly survey on the rents of the social sector).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>Depuis 1958</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/P> , <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/F> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/243>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire 2013 Enquête Loyers et charges (ré-interrogation)"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2013-01-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Questionnaire2013_reinterro.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1699/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/territoireFrancais/franceMetropolitaine> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1699> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1554> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is biennial and each survey covers a three-year period.<br />CIS2014 covers the three years 2012, 2013 and 2014.<br />It took place between June and December 2015.<br />Collection on the Internet is preferred. However, companies that request it are given the opportunity to reply on paper.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@fr , "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The CIS2014 sample is taken directly from the SIRUS directory.<br />It consists of approximately 23,000 units. It includes an exhaustive part (legal units with a minimum of 250 employees or more). The sampling design is stratified according to the crossover of activity and the number of employees.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>CIS2014 covers the following activities (NAF rev. 2):<br />- Manufacturing, mining and quarrying and other industrial activities (sections B to E)<br />- Construction (section F)<br />- Wholesale and retail trade, transportation and storage (section G)<br />- Transports (section H)<br />- Accommodation and food service activities (section I)<br />- Information and communication (section J)<br />- Financial and insurance activities (section K)<br />- Real estate activities (section L)<br />- Professional, scientific, technical, administrative and support service activities ; public administration and defence, education, human health and social work activities (sections M and N except 75 and 82)</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s dans l'enqu&ecirc;te CIS 2014 sont les suivants :<br />- Fr&eacute;quence de l'innovation par type d'innovation (produits, proc&eacute;d&eacute;s, organisation, marketing),<br />- Part en chiffre d'affaires (2014) des innovations de produits introduites entre 2012 et 2014,<br />- D&eacute;penses li&eacute;es aux activit&eacute;s d'innovation de produits et de proc&eacute;d&eacute;s,<br />- Existence de financements publics (nationaux, europ&eacute;ens),<br />- Formes de coop&eacute;ration pour le d&eacute;veloppement des innovations,<br />- Droits de propri&eacute;t&eacute; intellectuelle (d&eacute;p&ocirc;t de brevet, enregistrement de mod&egrave;le etc.),<br />- Entreprises non-innovantes&nbsp;: facteurs expliquant l'absence d'innovation sur la p&eacute;riode 2012-2014,<br />- Innovations apportant des b&eacute;n&eacute;fices environnementaux.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.11.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
