<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1640> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "About 12,000 households surveyed each year. At the first year, nine panels of individuals are drawn. Each year, one panel is dropped out and a new one is substituted for. It is therefore a rotating sample renewed by one-ninths."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Statistiques sur les ressources et conditions de vie 2015"@fr , "Quality report: Statistics on income and living conditions 2015"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1073> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is conducted face-to-face from May to June using computer assisted personal inter-aided method. The data is collected annually in the form of a panel survey.</p>\n<p>The principle consists in surveying the same sample of households and individuals in nine consecutive years in France (Most of the countries have a rotational design based on four rotational groups as recommended by Eurostat).</p>\n<p>Unlike other surveys of households, a household questionnaire is completed and an individual questionnaire is completed for each person aged 16 years or over in the household.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/territoireFrancais/franceMetropolitaine> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Environ 12 000 ménages interrogés chaque année, dont 10 000 ménages environ ont déjà été interrogés l'année précédente."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Each year, the target primary areas cover the following themes:</p>\n<p>- socio-demographic characteristics of households members;</p>\n<p>- components of annual income: income from employment, property income, government transfers received, current transfers from&nbsp;other households etc ;</p>\n<p>- labour information;</p>\n<p>- financial situation of households: savings, debt etc;</p>\n<p>- living conditions: indicators of material deprivation, housing and equipment, environment and health.</p>\n<p>A so-called \"ad hoc\" secondary module has been added each year since 2005. It goes in greater depth into certain topics, such as the equipment and commodities of the dwelling, over-indebtedness, material deprivation, etc.</p>\n<p>The data from these complementary modules are included in the annual spring report to the European Council.</p>\n<p>In addition to this, since 2008, France introduced supplementary questions on social indicators : some of them were present in the former survey on living conditions (EPCV).</p>\n<p>Three sets of supplementary questions have been defined, each being applied every three years:</p>\n<p>- the first one is on health, associative activities, professional relationships and social participation;</p>\n<p>- the second on sports and recreation;</p>\n<p>- he third on social mobility and contacts with close personal relations.</p>\n<p>Since 2008, a statistical matching is made with the tax sources for the year, in particular with. the tax returns for year N. The amounts of social benefits actually received by the households over the reference year N are collected directly from the three main Benefit funds in France: the national family allowances fund (CNAF), the national old-age insurance fund (CNAV) and the central agricultural social insurance fund (CCMSA).</p>\n<p>A self-administered questionnaire on well-being has been introduced since 2010 in the french part of the EU-SILC. Every year, a sub-sample (one-ninths) is concerned.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.11.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.11.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/342> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/H> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e en face &agrave; face de mai &agrave; juin par un mode de collecte assist&eacute; par informatique (Capi).Les donn&eacute;es sont collect&eacute;es annuellement sous la forme d'une enqu&ecirc;te en panel.</p>\n<p>Le principe consiste &agrave; interroger le m&ecirc;me &eacute;chantillon de m&eacute;nages et individus neuf ann&eacute;es de suite.</p>\n<p>Ainsi, chaque ann&eacute;e, un nouvel &eacute;chantillon de 3 000 fiches adresses vient alimenter le panel ; un &eacute;chantillon de m&eacute;nages dit \"sortant\" quitte alors le panel. Il s'agit donc d'un &eacute;chantillon rotatif renouvel&eacute; par neuvi&egrave;me.</p>\n<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te se pr&eacute;sente sous la forme d'un questionnaire m&eacute;nage et de questionnaires individuels. Chaque personne &acirc;g&eacute;e de 16 ans ou plus appartenant au m&eacute;nage interrog&eacute; se voit proposer un questionnaire individuel.&nbsp;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/F> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/I.18.10/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/I.18.10/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/342>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Qualité de l'enquête relative à l'exercice 2015"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2015-12-18"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/BIL_SRCV_2015.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Chaque ann&eacute;e, un module dit &laquo;primaire&raquo; permet d'aborder les th&egrave;mes suivants :</p>\n<p>- caract&eacute;ristiques sociod&eacute;mographiques des personnes appartenant aux m&eacute;nages dans lesquels ils vivent ;</p>\n<p>- d&eacute;tail des revenus per&ccedil;us l'ann&eacute;e civile pr&eacute;c&eacute;dant la collecte ;</p>\n<p>- situation financi&egrave;re des m&eacute;nages : &eacute;pargne, endettement&hellip; ;</p>\n<p>- conditions de vie : indicateurs de privation, logement et &eacute;quipement, environnement et sant&eacute;.</p>\n<p>Un module secondaire dit &laquo;ad hoc&raquo; est introduit chaque ann&eacute;e depuis 2005. Il permet d'approfondir certains th&egrave;mes comme l'&eacute;quipement et les commodit&eacute;s du logement, le surendettement et l'exclusion, les privations mat&eacute;rielles, etc...</p>\n<p>Les donn&eacute;es issues de ces modules compl&eacute;mentaires figurent dans le rapport annuel de printemps destin&eacute; au Conseil europ&eacute;en.</p>\n<p>Par ailleurs, la France a introduit &agrave; partir de 2008 un questionnement suppl&eacute;mentaire d'indicateurs sociaux dont les th&egrave;mes &eacute;taient trait&eacute;s par les anciennes enqu&ecirc;tes permanentes des conditions de vie (EPCV).</p>\n<p>Trois modules ont &eacute;t&eacute; d&eacute;finis, chacun sera pos&eacute; tous les 3 ans :</p>\n<p>- le premier module porte sur la sant&eacute;, la vie associative, les relations professionnelles et la participation sociale ;</p>\n<p>- le deuxi&egrave;me sur les sports et les loisirs ;</p>\n<p>- le troisi&egrave;me sur la mobilit&eacute; sociale et les contacts avec les proches.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1640/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-04-26"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1640> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1870> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.7.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.7.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.7.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The variables with high partial non-response rate have to be analysed with caution because a significant proportion of the responses have therefore been imputed. Other elements are also to include, as precision of estimators and the fact to cross the variable or not with fields of diffusion.<br /><br />Before any exploitation, it is also useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and the confidence intervals provided in the survey quality indicators.<br /><br />Below the ten variables with the hightest partial non-responses rates (between 34&nbsp;% and 53&nbsp;%)&nbsp;:<br />- Quantity of rubber waste;<br />- Quantity of mineral waste;<br />- Quantity of textile and leather waste;<br />- Quantity of equipment out of service;<br />- Quantity of chips, sawdust, bark and pallets;<br />- Quantity of canteen waste;<br />- Quantity of other non-hazardous waste;<br />- Quantity of used wooden crates;<br />- Share of packaging in other non-hazardous waste;<br />- Nature of other non-hazardous waste.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Voir les documents</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/734> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/960> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.15.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.15.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux indicateurs diffus&eacute;s sont les quantit&eacute;s de d&eacute;chets regroup&eacute;es&nbsp;:<br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets organiques <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets en m&eacute;lange <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets de verre<br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets m&eacute;talliques <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets plastiques <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets de papier et carton <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets textiles et de cuir <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets de caoutchouc <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets de bois <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets min&eacute;raux<br />- Quantit&eacute; totale d&rsquo;&eacute;quipements hors d&rsquo;usage<br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets de cantine / restaurant d&rsquo;entreprise <br />- Quantit&eacute; totale de d&eacute;chets hors boues humides</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.12>
