    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1134>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Ecart agrégats déchets commerce 2016"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/S.13.3.Ecart_agregat_dech16_com.ods> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Cette enqu&ecirc;te th&eacute;matique ne concerne que les d&eacute;chets non dangereux. Les donn&eacute;es sur les d&eacute;chets dangereux sont obtenues par l'exploitation des d&eacute;clarations administratives annuelles obligatoires en mati&egrave;re de d&eacute;chets dangereux remplies par les entreprises&nbsp;(Base de donn&eacute;es du r&eacute;pertoire des &eacute;missions polluantes&nbsp;: BDREP).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>See the document</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Law n&deg; 51-711 of 7 June 1951 on obligations, co-ordination and confidentiality in respect of statistics. Available from <a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a><br /><br />Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L. 213-3 of the French Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires endorsed as provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to private and family life and, in general, to private acts and conduct can not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after examining the opinion of the Statistical Confidentiality Committee and relating to a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, be the subject of any communication by the depositary service before the expiry of a period of seventy-five years following the date of completion of the survey or a period of twenty-five years from the death of the person concerned, whichever is the shorter.<br />A Statistical Confidentiality Committee is set up. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to the confidentiality of statistics. It expresses its opinion on requests for the communication of individual data collected pursuant to this law. The committee is chaired by a State Councillor, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes in particular representatives of the French National Assembly and Senate. The composition and operating methods of the committee are set by decree of the Council of State. Recipients of the data communications resulting from Ministerial decisions made after consulting the Statistical Confidentiality Committee agree to not communicate these data to anyone. Any violation of the provisions of this paragraph is punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Penal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey waste in industrial establishments in trade 2012 and 2016 can be comparated, except the potential changes in the wordings of questions. The evolution of adjustment methods can affect at the margins some evolutions.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Premi&egrave;re, Insee R&eacute;sultats</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.1.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.7>
                    "02 87 69 61 70"@fr , "02 87 69 61 70"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.11.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.11.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The most fields of broadcast are :<br /><br />Sector&nbsp;&nbsp;:<br />- 1&nbsp;: Interm&eacute;diaires du commerce de gros, commerce de gros de produits agricoles bruts et d&rsquo;animaux vivants, commerce de gros non sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- 2&nbsp;: Commerce de gros de produits alimentaires, de boissons et de tabac&nbsp;;<br />- 3&nbsp;: Commerce de gros de biens domestiques et d&rsquo;&eacute;quipements de l&rsquo;information et de la communication&nbsp;;<br />- 4&nbsp;: Commerce de gros d&rsquo;autres &eacute;quipements industriels&nbsp;;<br />- 5&nbsp;: Autres commerces de gros sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 6&nbsp;: Commerce de d&eacute;tail en magasin non sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- 7&nbsp;: Autres commerces de d&eacute;tail.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />Number of employees&nbsp;&nbsp;:<br />- 3 - 20 to 49 employees;<br />- 4 - 50 to 99 employees;<br />- 5 - 100 to 249 employees;<br />- 6 - 250 to 499 employees;<br />- 7 - 500 to 999 employees;<br />- 8 - 1000 to 1999 employees;<br />- 9 - 2000 employees and more.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.16/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The median (rectified) response time is 30 minutes. <br /><br />The label committee also ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on respondents, In addition, other decisions were made to limit the burden on respondents:&nbsp; <br />- negatively coordinated with other surveys<br />- electronic collection<br />- possibility to answer the questions about the quantity of waste in cubic meter (or number of pallets) if the value in tons is unknown.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>5000 unit&eacute;s</p>"@fr , "<p>5000 units</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey provides different kind of data:<br />&nbsp; <br />- the first part requires background information relating to the scope of the survey (activity, numbers);<br /><br />- the second part requires qualitative information on waste management and the importance of environmental concerns for the establishment. This provides qualitative insight into the figures required in the third part&nbsp;;<br /><br />- the third part requires tonnages according to the type of waste, as well as information on its collection and its processing.&nbsp;It is broken down into three sub-sections on organic non-hazardous waste, mixed non-hazardous and unsorted waste, and non-hazardous sorted waste.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.18.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Voir le document</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1135> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1133>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Calculs de précisions pour l'enquête sur les déchets dans le commerce de 2016"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/S.13.1Calculsprecisiondech16_com.xls> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/734>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice explicative des questionnaires 2016 des enquêtes sur la production de déchets non dangereux dans l'industrie et dans le commerce"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Notice_questionnaires_2016_dechets_non_dgrx.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.13.3.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>&nbsp;Le fichier suivant r&eacute;capitule les &eacute;carts sur les agr&eacute;gats venant du redressement (y compris apurement) pour les principales variables de diffusion.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1134> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.13.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.13.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.13.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The frame of the survey is the Statistical business register&nbsp; (Sirus)<br />The sampling method consists in a stratification by division of the French activity nomenclature and by local unit size.<br />The survey is exhaustive for establishments with 250 or more employees (approximately 1,600 establishments).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quality sheet is described in accordance with the European standard of Single integrated metadata structure (SIMS).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>This thematic survey concerns only non-hazardous waste. Data on hazardous waste are produced by the operation of mandatory annual administrative declarations for hazardous waste fulfilled by firms (French pollutant emission database: BDREP).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Regarding Internet collection, the collection site is completely secure and the standards in terms of managing access codes to the survey are strict. For companies choosing to use paper, the data entry is ensured by the managers, in strict respect of the confidentiality of the data collected.<br />Before the dissemination of the data the secrecy is applied. For enterprise data: no results are published for less than three enterprises or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be released if no company or institution contributes more than 85% of that result. Thus the so-called primary secret corresponds to the boxes meeting the above criterion. The secondary secret removes other boxes so that the data cannot be retrieved by subtraction with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.10.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de sondage est le Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus). <br />La m&eacute;thode d'&eacute;chantillonnage consiste en une stratification par secteur d'activit&eacute; et taille d'unit&eacute; locale.<br />L'enqu&ecirc;te est exhaustive pour les &eacute;tablissements de 250 salari&eacute;s et plus (791 &eacute;tablissements).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur la production de déchets non dangereux dans le commerce 2016"@fr , "Quality report: Survey on non-hazardous waste in wholesale and retail trade 2016"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1374> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux domaines de diffusion sont les suivants&nbsp;:<br /><br />Le secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute;&nbsp;est&nbsp; d&eacute;taill&eacute; selon les modalit&eacute;s suivantes&nbsp;:<br />- 1&nbsp;: Interm&eacute;diaires du commerce de gros, commerce de gros de produits agricoles bruts et d&rsquo;animaux vivants, commerce de gros non sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- 2&nbsp;: Commerce de gros de produits alimentaires, de boissons et de tabac&nbsp;;<br />- 3&nbsp;: Commerce de gros de biens domestiques et d&rsquo;&eacute;quipements de l&rsquo;information et de la communication&nbsp;;<br />- 4&nbsp;: Commerce de gros d&rsquo;autres &eacute;quipements industriels&nbsp;;<br />- 5&nbsp;: Autres commerces de gros sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 6&nbsp;: Commerce de d&eacute;tail en magasin non sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- 7&nbsp;: Autres commerces de d&eacute;tail.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />Tranche d&rsquo;effectif salari&eacute;&nbsp;:<br />- 3&nbsp;: De 20 &agrave; 49 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 4&nbsp;: De 50 &agrave; 99 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 5&nbsp;: De 100 &agrave; 249 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 6&nbsp;: De 250 &agrave; 499 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 7&nbsp;: De 500 &agrave; 999 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 8&nbsp;: De 1000 &agrave; 1999 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 9&nbsp;: 2000 salari&eacute;s ou plus.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les enqu&ecirc;tes D&eacute;chets sur le commerce en 2012 et 2016 peuvent &ecirc;tre compar&eacute;es, modulo les changements &eacute;ventuels de formulation des questions. L'&eacute;volution des m&eacute;thodes de redressement peut affecter &agrave; la marge certaines &eacute;volutions.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The most indicators broadcast are the quantity of gather wastes together : <br />- Total quantity of organic waste <br />- Total quantity of mixed waste <br />- Total quantity of glass waste <br />- Total quantity of metal waste <br />- Total quantity of plastic waste <br />- Total quantity of paper and paperboard waste <br />- Total quantity of cloth and leather waste <br />- Total quantity of rubber waste <br />- Total quantity of wood waste <br />- Total quantity of mineral waste <br />- Total quantity of out of service equipment <br />- Total quantity of canteen waste / company restaurant<br />- Total quantity of waste except humid slurry </p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.18.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.18.5/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.18.5/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1870> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/I.18.10>
