    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1870/S.13.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Precision calculations are calculated on the main variables broadcast (the quantities of waste by combined categories).<br />The precision indicators (coefficient of variation, 95% confidence interval) take into account errors due to sampling, total non-response correction and calibration, but not the error related to partial non-response correction.<br />The results of the calculations are in the file \"S.13.1. Calculs_precision_dech16_com.xls\".</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
