            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey covers the french establishments of 20 employees or more, with NAF code belonging to the divisions 46 and 47&nbsp; and 4 month of activity in 2016.</p>"@en ;
