<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1799> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1799/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The 2005 law IRL was calculated as the weighted sum of indices representative of consumer price trends (CPI excluding tobacco and rent), the cost of maintenance and improvement work borne by landlords (IPEA) and the cost-of-construction index (ICC).<br /><br />2005 law IRL = 60% mIPCL + 20% mIPEA + 20% mICC.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/855> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1799/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'IRL loi 2005 &eacute;tait calcul&eacute; comme la somme pond&eacute;r&eacute;e d'indices repr&eacute;sentatifs de l'&eacute;volution des prix &agrave; la consommation (IPC hors tabac et hors loyers), du co&ucirc;t des travaux d'entretien et d'am&eacute;lioration du logement &agrave; la charge des bailleurs (IPEA), ainsi que de l'indice du co&ucirc;t de la construction (ICC).<br /><br />IRL loi 2005 = 60 % mIPCL + 20 % mIPEA + 20 % mICC.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/22> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/854> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1799/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-02-24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1799> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1799/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1799> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1799>
