    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/484>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Méthodologie de l'enquête communautaire sur l'innovation / CIS 2010"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2013-02-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Methodologie_CIS_2010.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.11.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.18.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The previous waves of this survey were conducted by the Industrial studies and statistics Service (Sessi) of the Ministry for Industry, which in January 2009 became the Centre for industrial statistics at INSEE. Since CIS2010, the survey is managed by Insee.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/67>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Insee méthodes n° 105"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Innovation : de l'idée à la performance - 8ème séminaire de la Direction des Statistiques d'Entreprises"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/7269> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.18.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les pr&eacute;c&eacute;dentes vagues de cette enqu&ecirc;te &eacute;taient r&eacute;alis&eacute;es par le Service des &eacute;tudes et des statistiques industrielles (Sessi) du minist&egrave;re en charge de l'industrie qui devient en 2009 le P&ocirc;le statistiques industrielles de l'Insee. &Agrave; partir de CIS 2010, l'enqu&ecirc;te est g&eacute;r&eacute;e par la Direction des statistiques d'entreprise de l'Insee.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The main topics covered in the survey are as follows:</p>\n<p>-frequency of innovation by innovation type (products, processes, organisational, marketing): number of enterprises that have introduced such innovations during the period 2008 to 2010;</p>\n<p>-degree of innovation: turnover share (2010) from product or service innovations introduced between 2008 and 2010 : products or&nbsp;services that are new to the market, products or services that are new to the enterprise only;</p>\n<p>-expenditure associated with product and process innovation activities according to a simple nomenclature: expenditure on research and development</p>\n<p>- R&amp;D (internal/external), innovation-related equipment expenditure (excl. R&amp;D); acquisition of external knowledge-related expenditure.</p>\n<p>-other aspects of the innovation process concerning product and process innovations (qualitative questions only): public funding, sources of information and forms of cooperation to develop innovations, objectives of achieved innovations;</p>\n<p>-frequency and objectives of marketing and organisational innovations;</p>\n<p>-factors hampering product or process innovation activities ;</p>\n<p>-creativity and skills obtained from internal or external sources (software development, Web design etc.)</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, 92 541 Montrouge</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, 92 541 Montrouge</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/483>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Qualité de l'enquête relative à l'exercice  2010"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2013-03-26"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Fiche_qualite_CIS_2010.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Community innovation survey 2010"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête communautaire sur l'innovation 2010"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1197> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Cette enqu&ecirc;te, conduite de fa&ccedil;on harmonis&eacute;e au niveau europ&eacute;en selon un r&egrave;glement relatif aux statistiques d'innovation, couvre&nbsp;les activit&eacute;s suivantes (divisions de la NAF r&eacute;v. 2)&nbsp;:<br />- industrie extractive (divisions 05 &agrave; 09),<br />- industrie manufacturi&egrave;re (divisions 10 &agrave; 33),<br />- production et distribution d'&eacute;lectricit&eacute;, de gaz, de vapeur et d'air conditionn&eacute; (division 35),<br />- production et distribution d'eau, assainissement, gestion des d&eacute;chets et d&eacute;pollution (divisions 36 &agrave; 39),<br />- la construction (divisions 41 &agrave; 43),<br />- commerce de gros, &agrave; l'exception des automobiles et des motocycles (division 46),<br />- transports et entreposage (divisions 49 &agrave; 53),<br />- &eacute;dition (division 58),<br />- production de films cin&eacute;matographiques, de vid&eacute;o et de programme de t&eacute;l&eacute;vision ; enregistrement sonore et &eacute;dition musicale / programme et diffusion (divisions 59 et 60),<br />- t&eacute;l&eacute;communications (division 61),<br />- programmation, conseil et autres activit&eacute;s informatiques (division 62),<br />- services d'information (division 63),<br />- activit&eacute;s financi&egrave;res et d'assurance (division 64 &agrave; 66),<br />- activit&eacute;s immobili&egrave;res (division 68),<br />- activit&eacute;s juridiques et comptables (division 69),<br />- activit&eacute;s des si&egrave;ges sociaux ; conseil de gestion (division 70),<br />- activit&eacute;s d'architectures et d'ing&eacute;nierie ; activit&eacute;s de contr&ocirc;le et analyses (division 71),<br />- recherche-d&eacute;veloppement scientifique (division 72),<br />- publicit&eacute; et &eacute;tudes de march&eacute; (division 73),<br />- autres activit&eacute;s sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;es, scientifiques et techniques (division 74),<br />- activit&eacute;s de location et location-bail (division 77),<br />- activit&eacute;s li&eacute;es &agrave; l'emploi (division 78),<br />- activit&eacute;s des agences de voyages, voyagistes, services de r&eacute;servation et activit&eacute;s connexes (division 79),<br />- enqu&ecirc;tes et s&eacute;curit&eacute;s (division 80),<br />- services relatifs aux b&acirc;timents et am&eacute;nagement paysager (division 81).</p>\n<p>Certaines activit&eacute;s ont &eacute;t&eacute; exclues du champ&nbsp;pour cette enqu&ecirc;te par rapport &agrave; l'&eacute;dition pr&eacute;c&eacute;dente&nbsp;: &laquo;&nbsp;H&eacute;bergement et restauration&nbsp;&raquo; (divisions 55 et 56 de la NAF), &laquo;&nbsp;Commerce et r&eacute;paration d'automobiles et de motocycles&nbsp;&raquo; (division 45) et enfin &laquo;&nbsp;Commerce de d&eacute;tail, &agrave; l'exception des automobiles et des motocycles&nbsp;&raquo; (division 47).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is biennial and covers three years (2008, 2009 and 2010 for CIS2010).<br />It takes place between June and December.<br />It is carried out via the Internet, with the possibility of replying by paper on request. Companies receive a letter with the survey cover letter containing the internet link and the username and password to complete the survey online.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/485> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>This survey is harmonised at European level in accordance with regulations covering innovation statistics; it covers the following activities (divisions in NAF rev. 2):<br />-Mining and quarrying (divisions 05 to 09);<br />-Manufacturing (divisions 10 to 33);<br />-Electricity, gas, steam and air conditioning supply (division 35);<br />-Water supply; sewerage, waste management and remediation (divisions 36 to 39);<br />-Construction (divisions 41 to 43);<br />-Wholesale trade, excluding cars and motorcycles (division 46);<br />-Transportation and storage (divisions 49 to 53);<br />-Publishing (division 58);<br />-Motion picture, video and television programme production; sound recording and music publishing / programming and broadcasting activities (divisions 59 and 60);<br />-Telecommunications (division 61);<br />-Computer programming, consultancy and related activities (division 62);<br />-Information services activities (division 63);<br />-Financial service activities, except insurance and pension funding (division 64 to 66);<br />-Real estate activities (division 68);<br />-Legal and accounting activities (division 69);<br />-Activities of head offices; management consultancy activities (division 70);<br />-Architectural and engineering activities; technical testing and analysis (division 71);<br />-Scientific research and development (division 72);<br />-Advertising and market research (division 73);<br />-Other specialised scientific and technical activities (division 74);<br />-Rental and leasing activities (division 77);<br />-Employment activities (division 78);<br />-Travel agency, tour operator and other reservation service and related activities (division 79);<br />-Security and investigation activities (division 80);<br />-Services to buildings and landscape activities (division 81).</p>\n<p>Some activites that were included for the last edition CIS were excluded from the field for this edition: &ldquo;Accomodation and food service activities&rdquo; (divisions 55 and 56 of the NAF), &ldquo;Wholesale and retail trade and repair of motor vehicles and motorcycles&rdquo; (division 45) and &ldquo;Retail trade, except of motor vehicles and motorcycles&rdquo; (division 47).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.1.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.4>
                    "<p>Chef de la division Enqu&ecirc;tes th&eacute;matiques et &eacute;tudes transversales (ETET)</p>"@fr , "<p>Head of the Thematic Surveys and Cross-Sectional Studies Section</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2011X087EC"@fr , "2011X087EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.10.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1556> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1556/I.20/texte> ;
