            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.12.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.12.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.12.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1967> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1247>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "BPE 2019 Géolocalisation"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/BPE2019_geolocalisation.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1967> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.12.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le comit&eacute; des utilisateurs a pour mission de dresser le bilan des utilisations de la BPE, de recueillir les besoins des utilisateurs internes et externes &agrave; l&rsquo;Insee (internautes, acteurs publics, etc.), de d&eacute;crire et prioriser les &eacute;volutions attendues.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Il se r&eacute;unit une fois par an. Il est constitu&eacute; de repr&eacute;sentants de l&rsquo;Insee, d&rsquo;un repr&eacute;sentant de la F&eacute;d&eacute;ration nationale des agences d&rsquo;urbanisme et d&rsquo;un repr&eacute;sentant de l&rsquo;Agence nationale de la coh&eacute;sion des territoires.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.17.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>INSEE revises the values ​​of its statistics so that they reflect reality as accurately as possible and to ensure their relevance and reliability. It uses well-established, standardized and planned procedures according to international standards. It announces revisions simultaneously with their diffusion or in advance according to a protocol adapted to the source of the revisions, their size and the sensitivity of the statistics published. All the explanations necessary to understand these revisions accompany the diffusion of the relevant statistical sources on the Insee.fr site.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1241>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "BPE 2019 enseignement xy"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/contenu_bpe19_enseignement_xy.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Une publication nationale compl&eacute;t&eacute;e par des publications r&eacute;gionales a accompagn&eacute; la parution du premier mill&eacute;sime de la BPE en &eacute;volution en septembre 2018 : Insee Focus n&deg; 125 - &laquo; En cinq ans, davantage de services &agrave; la population dans les grandes villes&nbsp;&raquo;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3545985\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3545985</a></p>\n<p>Une publication nationale a &eacute;t&eacute; publi&eacute;e en mai 2018 : Insee Focus n&deg; 113 - &laquo; Dans les communes les moins dot&eacute;es en services, artisans du b&acirc;timent et restaurants sont les plus pr&eacute;sents &raquo;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3614441\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3614441</a></p>\n<p>Chaque ann&eacute;e, de nombreuses publications r&eacute;gionales utilisant la BPE sont publi&eacute;es sur des th&eacute;matiques diverses et, la plupart du temps, en partenariat avec des acteurs publics r&eacute;gionaux.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.5/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.5/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1967> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1967> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1239>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "BPE 2019 sport et loisirs"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/contenu_bpe19_sport_loisir.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La BPE a pour vocation de couvrir le maximum de services et &eacute;quipements accessibles &agrave; la population, qu&rsquo;ils soient marchands ou non.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.14.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La photographie des &eacute;quipements pr&eacute;sents sur le territoire fran&ccedil;ais au 1er janvier est diffus&eacute;e 18 mois apr&egrave;s la date de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.14.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The photograph of the equipment present on French territory on January, 1st is published 18 months after the reference date.&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-F001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1967> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Plus de 2,5 millions d'&eacute;quipements sont r&eacute;pertori&eacute;s dans la BPE.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>G&eacute;ographie</p>\n<p>La Base permanente des &eacute;quipements est disponible sur l'ensemble du territoire fran&ccedil;ais, y compris les d&eacute;partements d&rsquo;outre-mer. La r&eacute;f&eacute;rence g&eacute;ographique de la base est le Code officiel g&eacute;ographique (COG) des communes au 1er janvier de l&rsquo;ann&eacute;e de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Dans les communes &agrave; arrondissements (Paris, Lyon et Marseille), l'arrondissement a &eacute;t&eacute; retenu comme niveau communal pour localiser les &eacute;quipements.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Les adresses des &eacute;quipements contenus dans la BPE font l&rsquo;objet d&rsquo;un g&eacute;or&eacute;f&eacute;rencement pour fournir, le cas &eacute;ch&eacute;ant, l'appartenance de l&rsquo;&eacute;quipement &agrave; des zonages infra-communaux (Iris).&nbsp;</p>\n<p>G&eacute;olocalisation des &eacute;quipements</p>\n<p>Depuis la BPE 2013, des travaux de g&eacute;olocalisation des &eacute;quipements sont &eacute;galement r&eacute;alis&eacute;s.</p>\n<p>La g&eacute;olocalisation consiste &agrave; affecter des coordonn&eacute;es g&eacute;ographiques (x,y) &agrave; une adresse qui se mat&eacute;rialise alors par un point. La g&eacute;olocalisation permet de s'affranchir des zonages pr&eacute;existants (communes ou Iris). Elle permet ainsi des &eacute;tudes spatiales ou territoriales plus fines, avec des donn&eacute;es ind&eacute;pendantes de zonages pr&eacute;d&eacute;finis.</p>\n<p>Les syst&egrave;mes de projection utilis&eacute;s par l'Insee pour l'affectation des coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) sont le Lambert-93 (RGF93) pour la France m&eacute;tropolitaine et l&rsquo;UTM (Universal tranverse Mercator) pour les d&eacute;partements d&rsquo;outre-mer (UTM40sud pour la R&eacute;union, UTM20nord pour la Martinique et la Guadeloupe, et UTM22nord pour la Guyane). Quel que soit le syst&egrave;me utilis&eacute;, il ne s'agit pas de coordonn&eacute;es GPS.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&rarr; Pour une information plus d&eacute;taill&eacute;e sur les syst&egrave;mes de projection, consulter le site internet de l'IGN.</p>\n<p>La g&eacute;olocalisation r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par l'Insee repose sur un r&eacute;f&eacute;rentiel b&acirc;ti sur les informations contenues :</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; dans le r&eacute;pertoire d'adresses (R&eacute;pertoire d'immeubles localis&eacute;s - RIL) utilis&eacute; pour le recensement de la population, essentiellement pour les communes de 10 000 habitants ou plus ;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; dans les fichiers fiscaux (r&eacute;f&eacute;rentiels d'adresses &laquo; cadastraux &raquo;) pour les communes de moins de 10 000 habitants.</p>\n<p>Le processus automatique d'appariement des adresses contenues dans la BPE avec ce r&eacute;f&eacute;rentiel constitue la premi&egrave;re &eacute;tape des travaux de g&eacute;olocalisation des donn&eacute;es. Dans un second temps, des traitements manuels (ou, en dernier recours, des imputations) sont effectu&eacute;s sur les adresses pour lesquelles le traitement automatique n&rsquo;a pas abouti ou a fourni des r&eacute;sultats insuffisamment satisfaisants.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ainsi, les coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) mises &agrave; disposition pour chaque &eacute;quipement sont accompagn&eacute;es d&rsquo;un indicateur de qualit&eacute; qui peut prendre les modalit&eacute;s suivantes :</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; bonne : l'&eacute;cart des coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) fournies avec la r&eacute;alit&eacute; du terrain est inf&eacute;rieur &agrave; 100 m ;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; acceptable : l'&eacute;cart maximum des coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) fournies avec la r&eacute;alit&eacute; du terrain est compris entre 100 m et 500 m ;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; mauvaise : l'&eacute;cart maximum des coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) fournies avec la r&eacute;alit&eacute; du terrain est sup&eacute;rieur &agrave; 500 m et des imputations al&eacute;atoires ont pu &ecirc;tre effectu&eacute;es ;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; non g&eacute;olocalis&eacute; : les coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) ne sont pas disponibles car les travaux de g&eacute;olocalisation n&rsquo;ont pas abouti pour l&rsquo;&eacute;quipement ;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; type_&eacute;quipement_non_g&eacute;olocalis&eacute;_cette_ann&eacute;e : les coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) ne sont pas disponibles pour l&rsquo;&eacute;quipement consid&eacute;r&eacute; car il appartient &agrave; une cat&eacute;gorie qui n&rsquo;a pas fait l&rsquo;objet de travaux de g&eacute;olocalisation ou pour laquelle les travaux de g&eacute;olocalisation n&rsquo;ont pas abouti &agrave; une qualit&eacute; suffisante.</p>\n<p>Concernant les seuils de qualit&eacute;, l'Insee ne garantit pas un respect total de ceux-ci : les &eacute;carts &agrave; la r&eacute;alit&eacute; peuvent &ecirc;tre plus importants dans un certain nombre de cas, et &agrave; l'inverse, se r&eacute;v&eacute;ler de meilleure qualit&eacute; que la documentation ne l'indique.</p>\n<p>Au final, les domaines d'&eacute;quipements pour lesquels des donn&eacute;es g&eacute;olocalis&eacute;es sont diffus&eacute;es correspondent &agrave; ceux pour lesquels la qualit&eacute; du traitement est bonne ou acceptable pour plus de 85 % des &eacute;quipements qui les composent, que ces &eacute;quipements aient fait l&rsquo;objet de reprises manuelles ou uniquement d&rsquo;un traitement automatique.</p>\n<p>Par ailleurs, certains producteurs de donn&eacute;es alimentant la BPE r&eacute;alisent la g&eacute;olocalisation des donn&eacute;es qu&rsquo;ils fournissent. Si, apr&egrave;s expertise, leur g&eacute;olocalisation est jug&eacute;e de bonne qualit&eacute;, les coordonn&eacute;es (x,y) des &eacute;quipements concern&eacute;s sont inject&eacute;es directement dans la BPE sans retraitement par l'Insee autre que, le cas &eacute;ch&eacute;ant, la conversion dans les syst&egrave;mes de projection utilis&eacute;s pour la BPE.&nbsp;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1247> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.7.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Dans le cadre de la diffusion grand public (insee.fr), les variables relatives &agrave; la raison sociale et l&rsquo;adresse des &eacute;quipements ne sont pas fournies.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1246>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "BPE 2019 qualité des informations"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/BPE2019_qualite_des_informations.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1967> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.10.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A national publication supplemented by regional publications accompanied the publication of the first vintage of the evolution BPE in September 2018 : Insee Focus n &deg; 125 - \"In five years, more services to the population in large cities\"&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3545985\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3545985</a></p>\n<p>A national publication was published in May 2018: Insee Focus n &deg; 113 - \"In the municipalities with the least services, buliding craftsmen and restaurants are the most present\"&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3614441\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3614441</a></p>\n<p>Each year, numerous regional publications using BPE are published on various themes and, most of the time, in partnership with regional public actors.&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1240>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "BPE 2019 ensemble xy"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Contenu_bpe19_ensemble_xy.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1967> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.17.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;Insee r&eacute;vise les valeurs de ses statistiques pour qu&rsquo;elles refl&egrave;tent la r&eacute;alit&eacute; de la mani&egrave;re la plus exacte possible et pour garantir leur pertinence et leur fiabilit&eacute;. Il a recours &agrave; des proc&eacute;dures bien &eacute;tablies, normalis&eacute;es et planifi&eacute;es suivant les standards internationaux. Il annonce les r&eacute;visions simultan&eacute;ment &agrave; leur diffusion ou &agrave; l&rsquo;avance selon un protocole adapt&eacute; &agrave; la source des r&eacute;visions, &agrave; leur ampleur et &agrave; la sensibilit&eacute; des statistiques publi&eacute;es. Toutes les explications n&eacute;cessaires &agrave; la compr&eacute;hension de ces r&eacute;visions accompagnent la diffusion des sources statistiques concern&eacute;es sur le site Insee.fr.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Deux mill&eacute;simes de la BPE ne sont pas imm&eacute;diatement comparables. En effet, estimer dans les comparaisons temporelles ce qui rel&egrave;ve d'un changement de nomenclature, d'un changement de source, d'un changement de qualit&eacute; dans la source ou enfin d'une &eacute;volution r&eacute;elle des services et &eacute;quipements accessibles sur le terrain s'av&egrave;re particuli&egrave;rement complexe.</p>\n<p>N&eacute;anmoins, afin de r&eacute;pondre aux besoins des utilisateurs de la BPE, des expertises sont men&eacute;es afin de d&eacute;terminer les conditions dans lesquelles il est possible d&rsquo;utiliser la BPE en &eacute;volution. Ainsi, chaque ann&eacute;e, une base BPE en &eacute;volution est diffus&eacute;e. Elle porte sur deux ann&eacute;es espac&eacute;es d&rsquo;un pas quinquennal et s&rsquo;effectue en g&eacute;ographie de l&rsquo;ann&eacute;e la plus r&eacute;cente. Ainsi, la BPE en &eacute;volution 2014-2019 est en g&eacute;ographie 2019.</p>\n<p>La diffusion de cette base en &eacute;volution concerne un nombre restreint de types d&rsquo;&eacute;quipement, jug&eacute;s, sur la p&eacute;riode concern&eacute;e, les plus stables du point de vue de leur d&eacute;finition, de leur contour, de leur construction, etc. Elle exclut les types d&rsquo;&eacute;quipement relevant de l&rsquo;&Eacute;ducation nationale (dans le domaine de l&rsquo;enseignement, seuls les &eacute;quipements relevant de l&rsquo;enseignement agricole sont diffus&eacute;s en &eacute;volution). Ainsi, la BPE en &eacute;volution 2014-2019 porte sur 114 types d&rsquo;&eacute;quipement. Suite aux expertises men&eacute;es par le P&ocirc;le BPE, chaque type d&rsquo;&eacute;quipement est caract&eacute;ris&eacute; par le statut &laquo; sans r&eacute;serve &raquo; ou &laquo; avec r&eacute;serve &raquo;, relatif &agrave; son utilisation en &eacute;volution.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1244> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1245> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.18.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>BPE is supplied by :</p>\n<p>- 6 major repertories : Adeli, Finess and RPPS (Department of Solidarity and Health), Ramsese (Department for Education and Youth), Sirene (Insee) and RES (Department for Sports) ;</p>\n<p>- 16 administrative files: Gendarmerie (Home Office), Hotel and Camping (Insee), Paris Police Prefecture, Agricultural education (Department for Agriculture and Food), Justice (Ministry of Justice), La Poste, Artcena, P&ocirc;le Emploi, DGAC (General Directorate of Civil Aviation), SNCF, CNC (National Cinema Center), Culture (Ministry of Culture), Gas Stations (data.gouv.fr &ndash; Department of Economy and Finance), Cnaf (data.caf.fr) and since 2019, the file of public services houses (MSAP), source CGET (Commission for territorial equality, which became on 01/01/20 the National Agency for territorial cohesion).</p>\n<p>In alphabetical order :&nbsp;</p>\n<p>ADELI (automation of paramedical lists - source: ministry responsible for health)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Adeli repertory contains data on paramedical professionals (audioprosthetist, nurse, speech therapist, orthoptist, occupational therapist, psychomotor therapist, manipulator in medical electroradiology) for which they are required to register. They appear there as assets held on January 1st of the reference year. The paramedical staff are retained in the BPE on the criteria of profession, professional situation and economic activity (liberal profession only).</p>\n<p>ARTCENA (source: Artcena)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The national center for circus, street and theater arts (Artcena) provides the list of theaters, circus centers and street arts managed by Artcena where a theater performance can take place. They can be labeled (national and private theaters, national and convention stages, companies with places of reception, national and regional dramatic companies, circus centers, choreographic centers) or not.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>CAMPING (outdoor hotel survey &ndash; source : Insee)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The park of campsites corresponds to the list of campsites or natural areas which have at least 10 pitches, at least one of which is a passage, from which the sample of the INSEE outdoor accommodation survey is drawn.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>CGET (General commission for territorial equality)</p>\n<p>The list of public service houses(MSAP) lists the structures delivering a local offer to all audiences in a single place on many themes of daily life : employment, retirement, family, social, health, housing, energy, postal services, access to law, etc.</p>\n<p>CNAF (source: national family allowance fund)</p>\n<p>The list of establishments for the reception of young children corresponds to the structures authorized to receive on a non-permanent basis, children under the age of 6 and receiving a Caf fund (collective or parental nursery, daycare center, nursery-garden). Due to the Caf management rules, the data from this source is delayed by one year compared to other BPE sources:&nbsp; the 2019 vintage therefore corresponds to the data on 01/01/2018 and not to those on 01/01/2019.</p>\n<p>CNC (source: national cinema center)</p>\n<p>The file of cinemas gathers the places of projection having an authorization of exercise within the meaning of the code of the cinematographic industry and an administrative authorization, and having sent at least a slip of receipts in the year. Data are available for Metropolitan France and the overseas area, except Mayotte.</p>\n<p>CULTURE (source: ministry of culture)</p>\n<p>The file produced by the Ministry of Culture contains :</p>\n<p>the list of museums, labeled Mus&eacute;e de France and belonging to the State or to a non-profit public or private legal person, the conservation and presentation of which is of public interest to the public ;</p>\n<p>the list of approved conservatories, classified into three categories: conservatory with municipal or inter-municipal influence (CRC), departmental influence (CRD), regional influence (CRC).</p>\n<p>Data are available throughout France except the outsea d&eacute;partment of Mayotte.</p>\n<p>Since 2019, the list of libraries lists alle the access points to books (medi library, library, reading point, reading deposit, etc.) under the responsibility of local authorities (public libraries of departmental, municipal, intermunicipal and municipal status classified, central or annex).</p>\n<p>DGAC (source: General Directorate of Civil Aviation)</p>\n<p>The list provided contains the airports with more than 1,000 year-round passengers on commercial flights departing or arriving from the airport excluding transit during year n&ndash;1. These data are collected on behalf of INSEE by the General Commission for Sustainable Development, Data and Statistical Studies Service.</p>\n<p>AGRICULTURAL EDUCATION (source: General Directorate for Education and Research - DGER - of the Department for Agriculture and Food)</p>\n<p>The DGER collects agricultural educational establishments. The rules for managing this agricultural education file can lead to the registration of several units at the same address with different types of equipment in the BPE. For example, a high school and the training center and/or the continuing training center it houses will provide 2 (or 3) separate facilities.</p>\n<p>FINESS (national file of health and social establishments - source: Department of Solidarity and Health)</p>\n<p>The management of the Finess repertory is the responsibility of the Directorate of Research, Studies, Evaluation and Statistics (Drees), within the Department of Solidarity and Health. It lists, for the needs of the Department and of health insurance, the structures authorized to install sanitary or social equipment (legal entity) as well as the places in which these equipment are installed and exercise the corresponding care or social service activities (establishment). Each of them is assigned a Finess number. The file contains three categories of public and private sector establishments :</p>\n<p>1- health establishments : hospitals, care and prevention establishments, health establishments (analysis laboratories, pharmacies, blood transfusion establishments, etc.) ;</p>\n<p>2- social establishments: establishments for the elderly, disabled adults and disabled youth, social services contributing to the protection of children, medico-social establishments;</p>\n<p>3- training establishments for health and social workers.</p>\n<p>Equipment from Finess are selected, on behalf of the BPE, according to their category and discipline. The services rendered can thus be multiple at the same address, within the same establishment.</p>\n<p>GENDARMERIE (information system of gendarmerie units - source: Home Office)</p>\n<p>The BPE's data in the field of public security comes, for the gendarmerie part, from an internal management base at the Home office. They are provided on the basis of the service of the national gendarmerie welcoming the public. Autonomous or local territorial brigades are counted.</p>\n<p>HOTEL (hotel survey - source: Insee)</p>\n<p>The hotel fleet corresponds to the list of classified hotels and unclassified tourist hotels with 5 or more bedrooms, from which the sample from the INSEE hotel survey is drawn.</p>\n<p>JUSTICE (justice reference system -SRJ- source: Ministry of Justice)</p>\n<p>The SRJ lists the courts of appeal, high courts, district courts, commercial courts, industrial tribunals, houses of justice and the law, branches of justice and departmental councils for access to the law.</p>\n<p>LA POSTE (source: La Poste)</p>\n<p>La Poste provides the list of:</p>\n<p>- post offices : establishment providing all of La Poste's products and services relating to mail, parcels and financial services ;</p>\n<p>- post relays : private person (eg : a merchant) who has signed an agreement with La Poste to provide a large part of the services relating to mail and parcels, and very limited financial services ;</p>\n<p>- postal agencies: public person (town halls, EPCI) having signed an agreement with La Poste in order to provide a large part of the services concerning mail, parcels and financial services.</p>\n<p>POLE EMPLOI (source: P&ocirc;le emploi)</p>\n<p>P&ocirc;le emploi lists establishments belonging to three different networks:</p>\n<p>- the local network characterized by the presence of a P&ocirc;le emploi advisor continuously or on a planned and regular basis,</p>\n<p>- the specialized network which operates on specific segments of the public,</p>\n<p>- the partnership network, places shared with partners.</p>\n<p>PREFECTURE DE POLICE DE PARIS (source: Paris police headquarters)</p>\n<p>The list of police establishments in the city of Paris gathers the various public reception sites such as police stations, reception and proximity investigation services (SAIP), delegation brigades and proximity surveys (BDEP) and reception and judicial processing services (SATJ). When several different entities are present at the same address, only one item of equipment has been retained.</p>\n<p>RAMSESE (academic and ministerial repertory on the establishments of the education system &ndash; source : Department for Education and Youth)</p>\n<p>Ramsese supplies educational establishments (excluding agricultural education establishments) providing initial general, technical or vocational training, from kindergarten to higher education, whether public or private. It also provides some of their characteristics (presence of canteen, boarding school, pre-elementary class, preparatory class for high schools, membership of a priority education system, school in a teaching group).</p>\n<p>RES (inventory of sports equipment - source: Department for Sports)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The RES lists sports facilities, spaces and practice sites. Only the facilities accessible to the general public, individually or via a public or private structure (association or commercial), for practicing a physical and/or sporting activity are retained. Within the meaning of the RES, a sports facility is a place characterized by an address, where one or more sports facilities are located, with or without a limiting enclosure. In the BPE, equipment of different types can therefore be located at the same address.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>RPPS (shared repertory of health professionals - source: Department of Solidarity and Health)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The shared repertory of health professionals (RPPS) was set up in 2011 in order to pool in a single file the main information on health professionals between the State, health insurance and the councils of the order. With similar registration conditions, it is gradually replacing Adeli. Practitioners registered with the RPPS are retained in the BPE on the same criteria as from Adeli. General practitioners and specialists, dental surgeons, midwives, masseurs-physiotherapists and podiatrists are thus registered with the RPPS.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SIRENE (computerized repertory of companies and establishments - source: Insee)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Sirene registers all companies and their establishments, whatever their legal form and whatever their sector of activity. The service and trade establishments selected in the BPE are mainly based on their APE code (main activity exercised). These are operating and non-subsidiary establishments, economically active on the reference date.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1967/S.1.6>
