                    "<p>Janvier &agrave; avril</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/148> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte, effectu&eacute;e par voie postale, est lanc&eacute;e au premier trimestre de l'ann&eacute;e consid&eacute;r&eacute;e.<br />L'enqu&ecirc;te couvre la France enti&egrave;re (g&eacute;ographie &agrave; la date de la collecte).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/148>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "La méthodologie de l'enquête sur les technologies de l'information et de la communication auprès des entreprises / TIC"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2012-04-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Methodologique_TIC_Entreprises_2012.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The collection, conducted by mail, is launched in the first quarter of the year in question.<br />The survey covers the whole of France (geography at the time of collection).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2009A020EC"@fr , "2009A020EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>La p&eacute;riode de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence est 2009 pour la plupart des questions&nbsp;; le dernier exercice comptable (2008) pour le commerce &eacute;lectronique.</p>"@fr , "<p>The reference period is mainly 2009 except for the characteristics referring to the previous accounting year (turnover, websales).</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s sont : le d&eacute;veloppement des nouvelles technologies et l'intensit&eacute; de leur utilisation au sein de l'entreprise ; les types d'utilisation des TIC (commerce &eacute;lectronique, partage et &eacute;change d'information, plus g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement les relations avec le monde externe &agrave; l'entreprise) ; les obstacles et l'impact de cette diffusion.<br /><br />Chaque ann&eacute;e, certains th&egrave;mes, d&eacute;termin&eacute;s par le r&egrave;glement europ&eacute;en annuel d'application du r&egrave;glement cadre, font l'objet d'un d&eacute;veloppement particulier. En 2009, les th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s sont l&rsquo;&eacute;change de donn&eacute;es informatis&eacute; avec des syst&egrave;mes ext&eacute;rieurs &agrave; l&rsquo;entreprise, le partage &eacute;lectronique d&rsquo;information sur le SCM, le partage automatique de l&rsquo;information au sein de l&rsquo;entreprise, l&rsquo;utilisation des technologies RFID.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te communautaire sur \" l'utilisation des TIC et le commerce &eacute;lectronique \" dans les entreprises est un ensemble d'enqu&ecirc;tes r&eacute;alis&eacute;es par les instituts nationaux de la statistique des pays membres de l'union europ&eacute;enne.<br /><br />Elle s'inscrit dans le r&egrave;glement n&deg; 808/2004 adopt&eacute; en date du 21 avril 2004 dans le cadre de la mise en &oelig;uvre du plan d'action&nbsp;eEurope 2005 consacr&eacute; aux technologies de l'information et de la communication, r&egrave;glement amend&eacute; par le r&egrave;glement europ&eacute;en n&deg; 1006/2009 du 16 septembre 2009. Dans ce cadre, les enqu&ecirc;tes sur les TIC et le commerce &eacute;lectronique dans les entreprises r&eacute;alis&eacute;es par les pays de l'Union europ&eacute;enne suivent une m&eacute;thodologie commune et un m&ecirc;me mod&egrave;le de questionnaire.<br /><br />Chaque ann&eacute;e, un ou plusieurs th&egrave;mes, d&eacute;termin&eacute;s par le r&egrave;glement europ&eacute;en annuel d'application du r&egrave;glement cadre, fait l'objet d'un d&eacute;veloppement particulier.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/159>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire 2009 de l'enquête sur les technologies de l'information et de la communication et le commerce électronique (auprèsdes entreprises) / TIC"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2009-01-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/tic09_quest2009.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The topics covered are: the development of new technologies and the intensity of their use in business; the types of use of ICT&nbsp;(electronic commerce, sharing and exchanging of information and, more generally, relations with the world outside the business); the obstacles and impacts of this dissemination.<br /><br />Each year, some topics, determined by the annual European regulation for the implementation of the framework regulation, are developed in particular. In 2009, the topics covered are computerized data exchange with systems outside the company, electronic information sharing on the SCM, automatic information sharing within the company, the use of RFID technologies.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sampling base is the SIRENE register (Computer system for the National Register of Enterprises and their Establishments).<br /><br />The sample is stratified by business sector and by size. Depending on the survey year, approximately 12,500 businesses are surveyed.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The following categories of the NACE Rev. 2 : sections C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J, L, N, divisions 69 to 74, groups 65.1, 65.2, 95.1, classes 64.19, 64.92, 66.12, 66.19.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/160>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice explicative du questionnaire 2009 de l'enquête TIC (auprès des entreprises)"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2009-01-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/tic09_notice2009.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2017-01-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>12,500</p>"@en , "<p>12 500</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The EC survey on the \"use of ICT and electronic commerce\" in business is a set of surveys conducted by the national institutes of statistics of the member countries of the European Union.<br /><br />It complies with regulation n&deg;808/2004 adopted on April 21, 2004&nbsp;as part of the implementation of the 2005 eEurope action plan devoted to information and communication technologies: this regulation was amended by European regulation n&deg; 1006/2009 of September 16, 2009. Accordingly, the surveys on ICT and electronic commerce in business conducted by the countries of the European Union follow a common methodology and the same model of questionnaire.<br /><br />Each year, one or more topics, determined by the annual European regulation for&nbsp;the implementation of the framework regulation, are developed in particular.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>January to April</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/159> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/160> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1737/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sample is made of legal units with 10 employees or more.<br /><br />The scope covers businesses with ten employees or more belonging to the following sectors of NACE rev. 2: manufacturing industry (section C), production and distribution of electricity, gas, steam and conditioned air (section D), production and distribution of water, sewerage, waste management and cleanup (section E), the building industry (section F), trade, repair of automobiles and motorcycles (section G), transport and warehousing (section H), accommodation and catering (section I), information and communication (section J), real-estate activities (section L), specialist scientific and technical activities, excluding veterinary activities (divisions 69 to 74), administrative service and support activities (section N),&nbsp;repair of computers and communications equipment (group 95.1), other monetary intermediations and other distributions of credit&nbsp;(classes 64.19 and 64.92), insurance and re-insurance (groups 65.1 and 65.2), auxiliary financial service activities, excluding&nbsp;insurance, pension funds and financial market administration (classes 66.12 and 66.19).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1737>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Information and Communication Technologies Survey in business 2009"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur les technologies de l'information et de la communication dans les entreprises 2009"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1069> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1858> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.12.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.12.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.12.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.12.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1858> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.10.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Premi&egrave;re, Insee R&eacute;sultats</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The topics covered are: the development of new technologies and the intensity of their use in business; the types of use of ICT&nbsp;(electronic commerce, sharing and exchanging of information and, more generally, relations with the world outside the business); the obstacles and impacts of this dissemination.</p>\n<p>Each year, some topics, determined by the annual European regulation for the implementation of the framework regulation, are developed in particular. In 2018: cloud computing, big data analysis, 3D printing, use of robotics and e-invoicing.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "Legal unit enterprise"@en , "Unités légales"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1858> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>12,500</p>"@en , "<p>12 500</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1858> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2018A022EC"@fr , "2018A022EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1858> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The following categories of the NACE Rev. 2 : sections C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J, L, N, divisions 69 to 74, group 95.1.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>La p&eacute;riode de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence est 2018 pour la plupart des questions&nbsp;; le dernier exercice comptable (2017) pour le commerce &eacute;lectronique</p>"@fr , "<p>The reference period is mainly 2018 except for the characteristics referring to the previous accounting year (turnover, websales).</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1858> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.12.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Un comit&eacute; de concertation, compos&eacute; des experts et repr&eacute;sentants des politiques publiques concern&eacute;es par les questions de technologie de l&rsquo;information, de la communication et de commerce &eacute;lectronique (SOeS, SSP, DGE, CCIP, ARCEP, SGMAP, T&eacute;l&eacute;com Paris Tech&hellip;) ainsi que des repr&eacute;sentants d&rsquo;organisations professionnelles, ou de syndicats de salari&eacute;s (FEVAD, Syntec Num&eacute;rique, Medef, CCIP, CPME, CGT, FO&hellip;) s'est r&eacute;uni pour participer &agrave; la conception du questionnaire.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Premi&egrave;re, Insee R&eacute;sultats</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/918> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/920> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/921> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/919> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>To get closer with concepts used in the European survey, since the survey ICT 2011, the size of the questioned units is not any&nbsp;more measured in number of employees, but in number of occupied persons: the non-salaried persons are included in staff. The survey ICT concerns the companies of at least 10 occupied persons, - what includes in particular the units using 9 employees and whose manager is not salaried - the previous survey on those of at least 10 employees. One of the consequences of this modification on the results is an increase of the influence of the smallest companies.<br /><br />Since the ICT 2011 survey, the scope has covered businesses with ten employees or more belonging to the following sectors of NACE rev. 2: manufacturing industry (section C), production and distribution of electricity, gas, steam and conditioned air (section D), production and distribution of water, sewerage, waste management and cleanup (section E), the building industry (section F), trade, repair of automobiles and motorcycles (section G), transport and warehousing (section H), accommodation and catering (section I), information and communication (section J), real-estate activities (section L), specialist scientific and technical activities, excluding veterinary activities (divisions 69 to 74), administrative service and support activities (section N),&nbsp;repair of computers and communications equipment (group 95.1).<br /><br />Since the ICT 2011 survey, the scope doesn't covered financial and insurance societies. The following sectors are excluded :<br />- other monetary intermediations and other distributions of credit (classes 64.19 and 64.92),<br />- insurance and re-insurance (groups 65.1 and 65.2),<br />- auxiliary financial service activities, excluding insurance, pension funds and financial market administration (classes 66.12 and 66.19).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/921>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice explicative du questionnaire 2018 de l'enquête expérimentale sur les technologies de l’information et de la communication et le commerce électronique auprès des entreprises (suréchantillon)"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2018-05-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/TIC_surechantillon_experimental__Notice.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1858> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1858> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A consultation committee met to take an active part in the questionnaire&rsquo;s design. Its member are experts and representatives of public policies interested in ICT and e-commerce questions (SOeS, SSP, DGE, CCIP, ARCEP, SGMAP, T&eacute;l&eacute;com Paris Tech&hellip;), as well as representatives for syndicates of businesses and trade unions (FEVAD, Syntec Num&eacute;rique, Medef, CCIP, CPME, CGT, FO&hellip;).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sampling base is the Sirus register (Identification system for the Statistical Units in the Register).<br /><br />The sample is stratified by business sector and by size and, since 2012, by turnover. Depending on the survey year, approximately 12,500 businesses are surveyed.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/919>
