                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête mensuelle de conjoncture dans les services 2008"@fr , "Quality report: Monthly outlook survey in services 2008"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1164> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/444>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Indicateur de climat des affaires et de retournement conjoncturel – Tous secteurs"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2017-04-25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/MET_ENQ_CONJ_CLIMAT_AFF_FR_2017.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/53>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Économie et Statistique n° 395-396"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Enquêtes de conjoncture"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/23337> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The monthly outlook survey in services aims to transcribe the opinion of entrepreneurs on their recent activity and business prospects.<br /><br />This opinion is tracked by monitoring turnover and activity-related variables such as prices, demand, operating profit and changes to the workforce.<br /><br />The entrepreneurs also provide an opinion on their cash flow and their recruitment difficulties, their general feeling of the overall situation of their company and any factors that might be restricting their activity.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/444> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/394> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Survey of a sample of 4,500 enterprises in services and road haulage of goods.<br /><br />All road haulage companies having annual turnover in excess of &euro;30 million are surveyed systematically.<br /><br />For other service enterprises, this threshold is &euro;45 million.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The monthly outlook survey in services is part of the harmonised European Union programme of business and consumer surveys to which the 27 Member States of the European Union contribute. As such, the questionnaires, classifications and processing methods are largely harmonised in the national institutes of the countries belonging to the system. The wording of the questions is designed in such a way as to facilitate quick answers (most of the questions are qualitative with three possible answers in the form \"up, down, same\", or \"higher than normal, normal, lower than normal\")."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/52>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Économie et Statistique n° 359-360"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Analyse conjoncturelle : entre statistique et économie"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/22923> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/33>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Site internet de la Commission européenne, page en anglais"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Le système européen harmonisé des enquêtes de conjoncture de la Commission européenne"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <http://ec.europa.eu/economy_finance/db_indicators/surveys/method_guides/index_en.htm> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.11.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Until 2007, the survey was carried out each month except in August. Since 2008 it has been carried out every month.<br /><br />Data collection is by post and online over a period stretching from the end of the month prior to the month of the survey to the date of publication of the survey, i.e. 4 working days before the end of the current month.<br /><br />The results of the survey are sent to the European Commission 4 working days before the end of the month.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/33> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/52> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/53> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te mensuelle de conjoncture dans les services a pour objet de transcrire l'opinion des chefs d'entreprise sur leur activit&eacute; r&eacute;cente et sur leurs perspectives d'activit&eacute;.<br /><br />Cette opinion est retrac&eacute;e au moyen du suivi du chiffre d'affaires et de variables qui sont li&eacute;es &agrave; l'activit&eacute;, telles que les prix, la demande, les r&eacute;sultats d'exploitation ou l'&eacute;volution des effectifs.<br /><br />Les chefs d'entreprise fournissent &eacute;galement une opinion sur leur tr&eacute;sorerie et sur leurs difficult&eacute;s de recrutement, leur sentiment g&eacute;n&eacute;ral sur la situation globale de leur entreprise et les facteurs &eacute;ventuels limitant son activit&eacute;.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/E> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1616> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1616/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Enqu&ecirc;te par sondage aupr&egrave;s de 4&nbsp;500 entreprises des services et du transport routier de marchandises<br /><br />Toutes les entreprises du transport routier de marchandises dont le chiffre d'affaires annuel est sup&eacute;rieur &agrave; 30 millions d'euros sont interrog&eacute;es de mani&egrave;re syst&eacute;matique.<br /><br />Pour les autres entreprises des services, ce seuil est port&eacute; &agrave; 45 millions d'euros.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1628> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.5/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.5/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Law n&deg;&nbsp;51-711 of 7 June 1951 on obligations, co-ordination and confidentiality in respect of statistics. Available from <a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a></p>\n<p>Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L.&nbsp;213-3 of the French Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires endorsed as provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to private and family life and, in general, to private acts and conduct can not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after examining the opinion of the Statistical Confidentiality Committee and relating to a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, be the subject of any communication by the depositary service before the expiry of a period of seventy-five years following the date of completion of the survey or a period of twenty-five years from the death of the person concerned, whichever is the shorter.<br />A Statistical Confidentiality Committee is set up. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to the confidentiality of statistics. It expresses its opinion on requests for the communication of individual data collected pursuant to this law. The committee is chaired by a State Councillor, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes in particular representatives of the French National Assembly and Senate. The composition and operating methods of the committee are set by decree of the Council of State. Recipients of the data communications resulting from Ministerial decisions made after consulting the Statistical Confidentiality Committee agree to not communicate these data to anyone. Any violation of the provisions of this paragraph is punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Penal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sampling frame is the Sirus directory (system of identification to directory of statistical units).<br />The sampling method is a stratified plan by the nomenclature of activities (NTE) dedicated to energy consumption, workforce bands, and region.<br />Allocations are optimised on the NTE x workforce bands, and on net energy consumption, taking into account the average dispersion per stratum over the last 3 years. The allowances are exhaustive above the threshold of 250 employees, big consumers of energy and for strata of less than 10 units.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>Les achats ou consommations d&rsquo;&eacute;nergie sont ceux correspondant &agrave; l&rsquo;ensemble des factures re&ccedil;ues en 2016.<br />Les informations concernant la certification de l'&eacute;tablissement se r&eacute;f&egrave;rent &agrave; sa situation en 2016.<br />Les autres questions (pr&eacute;sence d&rsquo;une pompe &agrave; chaleur, activit&eacute; industrielle de production, activit&eacute; sur site client) sont relatives &agrave; la situation de l'entreprise au moment de r&eacute;pondre &agrave; l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr , "<p>Energy purchases or consumption are those corresponding to all invoices received in 2016.<br />The information concerning the certification of the establishment refers to its situation in 2016.<br />The other questions (presence of a heat pump, industrial production activity, activity on customer site) relate to the&nbsp; establishment&rsquo;s situation at the time of responding to the survey.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Establishments belong to sections B and C (division 05 to 33), to group 383 (recovery), excluding: subclasses 1013B, 1071B, 1071C, 1071D (commercial crafts), 2013A and 2446Z; excluding divisions 05, 06 and 19; excluding group 091.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "L’unité d’interrogation est l’établissement, identifié par son numéro SIRET."@fr , "The interrogation unit is the establishment, identified by its SIRET number."@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The scope of the survey is the same every year.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.11.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique&nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon <br />- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte <br />- apurement <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale <br />- calage <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle <br />- le questionnaire a &eacute;t&eacute; test&eacute; en 2013 aupr&egrave;s de 97 &eacute;tablissements dans le cadre du dernier passage de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te devant le comit&eacute; du label.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2017A041EC"@fr , "2017A041EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le champ de l'enqu&ecirc;te est constant d&rsquo;une ann&eacute;e sur l&rsquo;autre.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Activity (NACE rev.2 divisions)<br />07-Mining of metal ores <br />08-Other mining and quarring <br />09-Mining support service activity <br />10-Manufacture of food products <br />11-Manufacturing of beverages <br />12-Manufacture of tobacco products <br />13-Manufacture of textiles <br />14-Manufacture of wearing apparel <br />15-Manufacture of leather and related products <br />16-Manufacture of wood and of products of wood and cork, except furniture; manufacture of articles of straw and painting materials <br />17-Manufacture of paper and paperproduct <br />18-Printing and reproduction of recorded media <br />19-Manufacture of coke and refined petroleum produtcs <br />20-Manufacture of chemical products <br />21-Manufacture of basic pharmaceutical products and pharmaceutical preparations <br />22-Manufacture of rubber and plastic products <br />23-Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products <br />24-Manufacture of basic metals <br />25-Manufacture of fabricated metal products, except machinery and equipment <br />26-Manufacturing of computer, electronic and optical products <br />27-Manufacture of electrical equipment <br />28-Manufacture of machinery and equipment n.e.c. <br />29-Manufacture of motor vehicles, trallers and semi-trallers <br />30-Manufacture of other transport equipment <br />31-Manufacture of furniture <br />32-Other manufacturing <br />33-Repair and installation of machinery and equipment <br />38-Waste collection, treatment and disposal activities; materials recovery<br />TOTAL<br /><br />Number of employees<br />less than 50 employees<br />50 to 99 employees<br />100 to 249 employees<br />250 to 499 employees<br />500 employees and more<br />TOTAL<br /><br />Region<br />11-&Icirc;le-de-France&nbsp; <br />24-Centre-Val de Loire<br />27-Bourgogne-Franche-Comt&eacute; <br />28-Normandie<br />32-Hauts-de-France<br />44-Grand Est<br />52-Pays de la Loire<br />53-Bretagne<br />75-Nouvelle-Aquitaine<br />76-Occitanie<br />84-Auvergne-Rh&ocirc;ne-Alpes<br />93-Paca et Corse <br />97-D&eacute;partements d&rsquo;outre-mer ENSEMBLE<br />TOTAL</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For dissemination, in addition to publications, there are also data quality indicators.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.13.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La part de hors champ dans l'&eacute;chantillon est de 2,1&nbsp;%.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/371>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice explicative 2016 de l'enquête sur les consommations d'énergie dans l'industrie / EACEI"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2016-12-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/DOC_EACEI_notice_2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is subject to an internal database archiving procedure.<br />Individual files are made available to users outside Insee via the Secure Data Access Centre (CASD), after being reviewed by the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.17.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pas de r&eacute;vision pr&eacute;vue sur les donn&eacute;es de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey shows a declining response rate: 80.4% (88.8% in the previous edition due to the additional sample surveyed in 2016). The latter implied a higher sampling rate in small groups, where the response rate is always lower.</p>\n<p>Before any exploitation, it is also useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and confidence intervals provided in the survey quality indicators.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A consultative committee met every year. It is composed, in addition to the two producer services, by experts and representatives of the public policies concerned with energy issues, representatives of professional organizations, employee unions and the energy sector.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/L> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'Insee Focus (<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3310452\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3310452</a>) et l'Insee R&eacute;sultats (<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3364874\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3364874</a>) sont disponibles sur le site insee.fr.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.13.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.13.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.13.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The theme addressed is the different energies used by the establishments, in terms of purchases (volume, value) and use by the establishment. The main energies observed are:<br />- electricity;<br />- steam and other heat transfer fluids;<br />- natural gas&nbsp; and other gases;<br />- coal, lignite, lean coal, coal coke, petroleum coke, butane, propane;<br />- heavy fuel oil, heating oil and other petroleum products;<br />- black liquor, wood;<br />- special renewable and non-renewable fuels.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.10.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quality sheet is described in accordance with the European standard of Single integrated metadata structure (SIMS).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Activit&eacute; (divisions de la NAF r&eacute;v.2)<br />07-Extraction de minerais m&eacute;talliques<br />08-Autres industries extractives<br />09-Services de soutien aux industries extractives<br />10-Industries alimentaires<br />11-Fabrication de boissons<br />12-Fabrication de produits &agrave; base de tabac<br />13-Fabrication de textiles<br />14-Industrie de l'habillement<br />15-Industrie du cuir et de la chaussure<br />16-Travail du bois et fabrication d'articles en bois et en li&egrave;ge, &agrave; l'exception des meubles&nbsp;; fabrication d'articles en vannerie et sparterie<br />17-Industrie du papier et du carton<br />18-Imprimerie et reproduction d'enregistrements<br />19-Cok&eacute;faction et raffinage<br />20-Industrie chimique<br />21-Industrie pharmaceutique<br />22-Fabrication de produits en caoutchouc et en plastique<br />23-Fabrication d'autres produits min&eacute;raux non m&eacute;talliques<br />24-M&eacute;tallurgie<br />25-Fabrication de produits m&eacute;talliques, &agrave; l'exception des machines et des &eacute;quipements<br />26-Fabrication de produits informatiques, &eacute;lectroniques et optiques<br />27-Fabrication d'&eacute;quipements &eacute;lectriques<br />28-Fabrication de machines et &eacute;quipements n.c.a.<br />29-Industrie automobile<br />30-Fabrication d'autres mat&eacute;riels de transport<br />31-Fabrication de meubles<br />32-Autres industries manufacturi&egrave;res<br />33-R&eacute;paration et installation de machines et d'&eacute;quipements<br />38-Collecte, traitement et &eacute;limination des d&eacute;chets&nbsp;; r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration<br />ENSEMBLE<br /><br />Tranche d'effectifs<br />moins de 50 salari&eacute;s<br />de 50 &agrave; 99 salari&eacute;s<br />de 100 &agrave; 249 salari&eacute;s<br />de 250 &agrave; 499 salari&eacute;s<br />500 salari&eacute;s et plus<br />ENSEMBLE<br /><br />R&eacute;gion<br />11-&Icirc;le-de-France<br />24-Centre-Val de Loire<br />27-Bourgogne-Franche-Comt&eacute;<br />28-Normandie<br />32-Hauts-de-France<br />44-Grand Est<br />52-Pays de la Loire<br />53-Bretagne<br />75-Nouvelle-Aquitaine<br />76-Occitanie<br />84-Auvergne-Rh&ocirc;ne-Alpes<br />93-Paca et Corse<br />97-D&eacute;partements d&rsquo;outre-mer<br />ENSEMBLE</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.17.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.17.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.17.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.17.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The data from the EACEI 2016 survey can be partly supplemented by ECEI-PE 2014 by being vigilant as to the differences in scope: ECEI-PE, in addition to the one-year lag, surveys establishments with 1 to 19 employees and focuses only on a limited number of energies.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur les consommations d'énergie dans l'industrie 2016"@fr , "Quality report: Annual survey on industrial energy consumption 2016"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1289> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte d&rsquo;EACEI 2016 a &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par internet et, &eacute;ventuellement, par voie postale (&agrave; la demande de l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.1.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.4>
                    "<p>Chef de la division ETET</p>"@fr , "<p>Head of the ETET Division</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/370>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire 2016 de l'enquête sur les consommations d'énergie dans l'industrie / EACEI"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2016-12-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/DOC_EACEI_quest_2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.16/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The label committee ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on respondents.<br />In addition, other decisions were made to limit the burden on respondents:&nbsp; <br />- the EACEI 2016 sample is the same as this of 2015, because of the EACEI 2015 extension;<br />- the part of the EACEI 2016 sample is negatively coordinated with the thematics enterprises surveys;<br />- collection is done electronically;<br />- the sample of the extension collected at the end of the year (second wave) was not intended to be interviewed by a panel and was therefore drawn independently of the numbers of the previous surveys.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1005>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    " Description des données EACEI 2016"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2018-12-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/EACEI_2016_DD.ods> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.7.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Loi n&deg; 51-711 du 7 juin 1951 sur l'obligation, la coordination et le secret en mati&egrave;re de statistiques. Disponible &agrave; l'adresse <a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a></p>\n<p>L'article 6 concerne le secret statistique&nbsp;: Sous r&eacute;serve des dispositions des articles 40, 56, 76, 97 et 99 du code de proc&eacute;dure p&eacute;nale et de celles de l'article L.&nbsp;213-3 du code du patrimoine, les renseignements individuels figurant dans les questionnaires rev&ecirc;tus du visa pr&eacute;vu &agrave; l'article 2 de la pr&eacute;sente loi et ayant trait &agrave; la vie personnelle et familiale et, d'une mani&egrave;re g&eacute;n&eacute;rale, aux faits et comportements d'ordre priv&eacute; ne peuvent, sauf d&eacute;cision de l'administration des archives, prise apr&egrave;s avis du comit&eacute; du secret statistique et relative &agrave; une demande effectu&eacute;e &agrave; des fins de statistique publique ou de recherche scientifique ou historique, faire l'objet d'aucune communication de la part du service d&eacute;positaire avant l'expiration d'un d&eacute;lai de soixante-quinze ans suivant la date de r&eacute;alisation de l'enqu&ecirc;te ou d'un d&eacute;lai de vingt-cinq ans &agrave; compter de la date du d&eacute;c&egrave;s de l'int&eacute;ress&eacute;, si ce dernier d&eacute;lai est plus bref. <br />Il est institu&eacute; un comit&eacute; du secret statistique. Ce comit&eacute; est appel&eacute; &agrave; se prononcer sur toute question relative au secret en mati&egrave;re de statistiques. Il donne son avis sur les demandes de communication de donn&eacute;es individuelles collect&eacute;es en application de la pr&eacute;sente loi. Le comit&eacute; est pr&eacute;sid&eacute; par un conseiller d&rsquo;&Eacute;tat, d&eacute;sign&eacute; par le vice-pr&eacute;sident du Conseil d'&Eacute;tat. Il comprend notamment des repr&eacute;sentants de l'Assembl&eacute;e nationale et du S&eacute;nat. La composition et les modalit&eacute;s de fonctionnement du comit&eacute; sont fix&eacute;es par d&eacute;cret en Conseil d'&Eacute;tat. Les b&eacute;n&eacute;ficiaires des communications de donn&eacute;es r&eacute;sultant des d&eacute;cisions minist&eacute;rielles prises apr&egrave;s avis du comit&eacute; du secret statistique s'engagent &agrave; ne communiquer ces donn&eacute;es &agrave; quiconque. Toute infraction aux dispositions de cet alin&eacute;a est punie des peines pr&eacute;vues &agrave; l'article 226-13 du code p&eacute;nal.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.2>
