            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Employment estimates by the place in the workplace at the end of the year.  The level of employment takes account of people holding multiple jobs by selecting the person in his or her main job."@en ;
