                    "01 87 69 61 70"@fr , "01 87 69 61 70"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.10.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee R&eacute;sultats on insee.fr&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Eurostat indicators on&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"Indicateurs Eurostat sur http:/ec.europa.eu/eurostat/data/database\">http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/data/database</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Data collection is carried out via the Internet and possibly by post (at the request of the company).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> , <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Before any exploitation, it is useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and the confidence intervals provided in the quality indicators of the survey.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Variables with high partial non-response rates should be interpreted with caution, since a non-negligible part of their responses has been imputed.&nbsp; &nbsp;These include the following variables (from 5% to 31% partial non-response, with variables listed by decreasing partial non-response rate) :&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>EXPDESIGN, EXPDPI, EXPSFTW, EXEXPPCT, RMACX, RSERVX, REMPX, EXPMKT, EXPTRAIN, ROTRX, TURNIN, TURNMAR, EXPMAC, TURNNEW, RRDINX, EXAEXP, RRDEXX, and some variables on the type of cooperation partners for innovation activities.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1255> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.10.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee R&eacute;sultats sur Insee.fr&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Indicateurs Eurostat sur&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"Indicateurs Eurostat sur http:/ec.europa.eu/eurostat/data/database\">http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/data/database</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.11.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.11.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.11.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La fronti&egrave;re entre les innovations technologiques et non technologiques est de plus en plus tenue. D&egrave;s lors, la 4&egrave;me &eacute;dition du manuel d&rsquo;Oslo (octobre 2018) ne retient plus que les deux types d&rsquo;innovation&nbsp;suivants&nbsp;:</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">l&rsquo;innovation de produits</span>&nbsp;: il s&rsquo;agit de&nbsp; l&rsquo;introduction sur le march&eacute; d&rsquo;un bien ou d&rsquo;un service nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute; par rapport aux produits pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment &eacute;labor&eacute;s par l&rsquo;entreprise. Elle inclut les changements significatifs de design et les biens ou services num&eacute;riques. Elle exclut la revente en l&rsquo;&eacute;tat de nouveaux biens ou services et les changements de nature esth&eacute;tique ;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">l&rsquo;innovation de proc&eacute;d&eacute;s</span>&nbsp;: il s&rsquo;agit de la mise en &oelig;uvre dans l&rsquo;entreprise d&rsquo;un proc&eacute;d&eacute; nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute; par rapport aux proc&eacute;d&eacute;s pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment employ&eacute;s par l&rsquo;entreprise. Elle concerne la production et les m&eacute;thodes de d&eacute;veloppement, la logistique et la distribution, le syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;information et de communication, les t&acirc;ches administratives et la comptabilit&eacute;, l&rsquo;organisation des proc&eacute;dures, la gestion des relations avec les fournisseurs, l&rsquo;organisation du travail, les processus de d&eacute;cision, les ressources humaines, le marketing, l&rsquo;emballage, la tarification et le service apr&egrave;s-vente.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br /><br />Dans la 3&egrave; &eacute;dition du manuel d&rsquo;Oslo, donc pour les enqu&ecirc;tes CIS de 2008 &agrave; 2016, 4 types d&rsquo;innovation &eacute;taient distingu&eacute;es&nbsp;:</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">les innovations de produits</span>, soit l&rsquo;introduction sur le march&eacute; d&rsquo;un bien ou service nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute; par rapport aux produits pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment &eacute;labor&eacute;s par l&rsquo;entreprise au regard de ses caract&eacute;ristiques essentielles, de sa convivialit&eacute; (facilit&eacute; d&rsquo;usage), ses composants (ou son utilisation) et des &eacute;l&eacute;ments int&eacute;gr&eacute;s&nbsp;;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">les innovation de proc&eacute;d&eacute;s</span>, soit la mise en &oelig;uvre d&rsquo;un proc&eacute;d&eacute; de production, d&rsquo;une m&eacute;thode de distribution ou d&rsquo;une activit&eacute; de soutien ou support nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute;. Les innovations n&rsquo;ayant trait qu&rsquo;&agrave; l&rsquo;organisation ou au marketing &eacute;taient exclues&nbsp;;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">l&rsquo;innovation d&rsquo;organisation</span>&nbsp;: il s&rsquo;agit d&rsquo;un nouveau mode de fonctionnement de l&rsquo;entreprise (y compris la gestion des connaissances), une nouvelle m&eacute;thode d&rsquo;organisation du travail ou de ses relations externes qui n&rsquo;&eacute;taient pas utilis&eacute;s pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment dans l&rsquo;entreprise&nbsp;;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">l&rsquo;innovation de marketing</span>&nbsp;: elle correspond &agrave; la mise en &oelig;uvre de concepts nouveaux ou de strat&eacute;gies de vente nouvelles qui diff&egrave;rent significativement des m&eacute;thodes de vente existant dans l&rsquo;entreprise et qui n&rsquo;avaient pas &eacute;t&eacute; utilis&eacute;s auparavant. Elle inclut les changements dans le design, l&rsquo;emballage ou la pr&eacute;sentation d&rsquo;un bien ou d&rsquo;une prestation de services, son positionnement, sa promotion ou son prix s&rsquo;ils ont un impact significatif.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The main areas of dissemination are the activity sector of the company described according to the Statistical Classification of Economic Activities in the European Community (NACE Rev. 2) and the size of the enterprise.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different steps of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- tests carried out prior to collection, with 60 companies</p>\n<p>- stratified sample selection&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- reminders and checks of data being collected by collectors</p>\n<p>- clearance&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- adjustment of total non-response&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- shimming&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- adjustment for partial non-response&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- winsorisation</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'&eacute;chantillon est tir&eacute; dans une base de sondage construite &agrave; partir du Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus) selon un plan de sondage al&eacute;atoire simple stratifi&eacute; selon l&rsquo;activit&eacute;, la tranche d&rsquo;effectifs et la r&eacute;gion lorsque cela &eacute;tait possible. Le calcul des allocations combine une allocation de Neyman sur le taux d&rsquo;unit&eacute;s innovantes et une allocation proportionnelle sur le nombre d&rsquo;unit&eacute;s innovantes, ce qui permet d&rsquo;une part d&rsquo;&ecirc;tre pr&eacute;cis sur la variable centrale de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te (le taux d&rsquo;innovation) et &eacute;galement d&rsquo;interroger un nombre raisonnable d&rsquo;unit&eacute;s innovantes afin d&rsquo;assurer une pr&eacute;cision satisfaisante pour les questions ne concernant que ces unit&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par internet et, &eacute;ventuellement, par voie postale (&agrave; la demande de l'entreprise).&nbsp;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The main topics covered in the CIS2018 survey are as follows:<br />- Strategy;<br />- Co-creation (active participation of the user in the development of a product) and customization (adaptation of a product at the request of users);<br />- Intellectual property rights (patent filing, design registration etc.);<br />- Presence of innovation by type of innovation (products, processes);<br />- Turnover share from product or service innovations introduced between 2016 and 2018;<br />- Expenditure associated with product and process innovation activities;<br />- Public funding (European and national);<br />- Forms of cooperation for the development of innovations;<br />- Factors hampering innovation over the 2016-2018 period.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1254> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.18.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>No seasonal effect</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.18.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pas d'effet saisonnier</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different vintages of the CIS surveys can be compared up to and including CIS2016, modulo possible changes in question wording. The evolution of adjustment methods may affect certain developments at the margin.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>However, a break in the series is to be noted from CIS2018 onwards. Indeed, following the 4th edition of the Oslo manual, only two types of innovation are now defined from CIS2018 (products or processes including organization and marketing), compared to four for CIS2016 (products, processes, organization, marketing), and some questions previously asked only to innovative companies are now asked to all companies. It is therefore necessary to be vigilant on the comparison between CIS2018 and previous surveys.&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.10.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>In addition to publications, data quality indicators are also disseminated.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.7/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.7/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For Internet collection, the collection site is completely secure and the standards for managing survey access codes are strict. For companies that choose to use paper, the data entry is carried out by the managers, with strict respect for the confidentiality of the data collected.<br />Before the data is released, confidentiality is applied. For company data: no results are published for less than three companies or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be disclosed if no company or establishment contributes more than 85% of that result. Primary deletions correspond to boxes that do not meet the above criteria. Secondary secrecy removes other boxes so that the data cannot be retrieved by subtraction with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.13.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Des calculs de pr&eacute;cision sont effectu&eacute;s sur l'ensemble des variables.</p>\n<p>Les indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision (&eacute;cart-type ou coefficient de variation, intervalle de confiance &agrave; 95 %) prennent en compte les erreurs dues &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage, &agrave; la correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale, au calage et &agrave; la winsorisation, mais pas l&rsquo;erreur li&eacute;e &agrave; la correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The boundary between technological and non-technological innovations is increasingly being held. As a result, the 4th edition of the Oslo Manual (October 2018) now includes only the following two types of innovation:</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">product innovation</span>: the introduction on the market of a new or significantly improved good or service compared to the products previously developed by the company. It includes significant design changes and digital goods or services, and excludes the resale in the same condition as new goods or services and changes of an aesthetic nature;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">process innovation</span>: the implementation in the company of a new or significantly improved process compared to the processes previously used by the company. It concerns production and development methods, logistics and distribution, information and communication system, administrative tasks and accounting, organisation of procedures, management of relations with suppliers, work organisation, decision-making processes, human resources, marketing, packaging, pricing and after-sales service.</p>\n<p>In the 3rd edition of the Oslo Manual, i. e. for CIS surveys from 2008 to 2016, 4 types of innovation were distinguished:</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">product innovations</span>, i.e. the introduction on the market of a new or significantly improved good or service compared to the products previously developed by the company in terms of its essential characteristics, its user-friendliness (ease of use), its components (or its use) and the integrated elements;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">process innovation</span>, i.e. the implementation of a new or significantly improved production process, distribution method or support activity or support. Innovations related only to organization or marketing were excluded;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">organisational innovation</span>: a new way of operating the company (including knowledge management), a new way of organising work or its external relations that was not previously used in the company;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Marketing innovation</span>: this refers to the implementation of new concepts or new sales strategies that differ significantly from existing sales methods in the company and that have not been used before. It includes changes in the design, packaging or presentation of a good or service, its positioning, promotion or price if they have a significant impact.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.11.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Avant toute exploitation, il est utile d&rsquo;appr&eacute;cier la qualit&eacute; des variables au travers de leur taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle et des intervalles de confiance fournis dans les indicateurs de qualit&eacute; de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>\n<p>Les variables pr&eacute;sentant des taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle &eacute;lev&eacute;s doivent &ecirc;tre interpr&eacute;t&eacute;es avec pr&eacute;caution, puisqu'une partie non n&eacute;gligeable de leurs r&eacute;ponses a &eacute;t&eacute; imput&eacute;e.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On peut citer notamment les variables suivantes (de 5 % &agrave; 31 % de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle, les variables &eacute;tant list&eacute;es par taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partiel d&eacute;croissant) :&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EXPDESIGN, EXPDPI, EXPSFTW, EXEXPPCT, RMACX, RSERVX, REMPX, EXPMKT, EXPTRAIN, ROTRX, TURNIN, TURNMAR, EXPMAC, TURNNEW, RRDINX, EXAEXP, RRDEXX, et certaines variables sur le type de partenaires de coop&eacute;ration pour les activit&eacute;s d&rsquo;innovation.</p>\n<p>Il est &eacute;galement recommand&eacute; de prendre en compte la pr&eacute;cision des estimations pour ces variables avant de les inclure dans l&rsquo;analyse, en particulier pour une &eacute;tude par domaines de diffusion.&nbsp;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1255> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.18.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.18.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.18.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The companies belong to NACE Rev.2 divisions 05 to 81 (except for 75: Veterinarians). Legal category 7353 (Syndicat intercommunal &agrave; vocation unique (SIVU)) is excluded.</p>\n<p>Within Section K of NAF rev2 (divisions 64, 65 and 66), the scope of mutuals was limited since CIS 2010.&nbsp; For the 2018 CIS, only the local units of certain banks, i.e. legal categories 5195 and 6595, are excluded.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A consultation committee, made up of experts and representatives of public policies concerned with innovation issues, as well as representatives of professional organizations and employee unions, met to help design the questionnaire.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "The interrogation unit is the legal unit, identified by its SIREN number, with the exception of 12 units which are interrogated in profiled companies."@en , "L’unité d’interrogation est l’unité légale, identifiée par son numéro SIREN, à l'exception de 12 unités qui sont interrogées en entreprises profilées."@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>20 150 unit&eacute;s&nbsp;</p>"@fr , "<p>20 150 unit&eacute;s&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2019X062EC"@fr , "2019X062EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La p&eacute;riode de collecte s'est &eacute;tendue du 13 mai 2019 au 6 d&eacute;cembre 2019.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.16/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The median response time is 30 minutes.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The label committee ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on respondents. In addition, other decisions have been taken to limit the burden on respondents, in particular the negative coordination of the sample with samples from other surveys.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux domaines de diffusion sont le secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute; de l&rsquo;entreprise d&eacute;crite selon la Nomenclature statistique des activit&eacute;s &eacute;conomiques dans la Communaut&eacute; europ&eacute;enne (NACE r&eacute;v.2) et la taille de l&rsquo;entreprise.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, 92 541 Montrouge</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, 92 541 Montrouge</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1255>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Qualité de l'enquête relative à l'exercice 2018"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Fiche_qualite_CIS2018.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.10.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.10.5/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.10.5/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1920> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.17.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>No revision planned on survey data</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1920/S.10.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te fait l'objet d'une proc&eacute;dure d'archivage des bases de donn&eacute;es sous GEN.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Les fichiers individuels sont mis &agrave; disposition des utilisateurs ext&eacute;rieurs &agrave; l&rsquo;Insee via le CASD, apr&egrave;s passage au Comit&eacute; du secret.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
}

