                    "2016A026EC"@fr , "2016A026EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/L> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<ul>\n<li>Contr&ocirc;les pendant la phase de collecte&nbsp;: contr&ocirc;les sur la coh&eacute;rence interne et la coh&eacute;rence temporelle sous forme d&rsquo;alerte au moment de la saisie&nbsp;;</li>\n<li>Relances pendant la phase de collecte&nbsp;: relances par courrier exhaustives sur les non-r&eacute;pondants, relances t&eacute;l&eacute;phoniques prioris&eacute;es sur les non-r&eacute;pondants de grande taille&nbsp;;</li>\n<li>Apurement&nbsp;pour assurer la coh&eacute;rence des r&eacute;ponses au sein de chaque questionnaire&nbsp;;</li>\n<li>Calcul d'indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision.</li>\n</ul>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.13.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.13.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.13.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The population is composed of establishments with 20 or more employees, with at least 4 months of activity in 2015, and main activity code ('APET) corresponding to sections B and C (division 05 to 33), to group 383 (materials recovery), <br />excluding: subclasses: 1013B, 1071B, 1071C, 1071D (commercial crafts), 2013A and 2446Z ;<br />excluding divisions 05, 06 and 19;<br />outside group 091.<br /><br />About 14,000 establishments were surveyed, including an extra-sample specific to 2015.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex.</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.16/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For the annual collection (including preparation): 3.5 FTE A, 10.5 FTE B and C. IT resources: 80 days. The postage budget is approximately 17,000 euros, and the telephone budget 2,400 euros.<br />The median (rectified) response time is 35 minutes.<br />The label committee also ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on respondents.<br />In addition, other decisions were made to limit the burden on respondents:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the EACEI sample for \"conventional\" collection (wave 1) is renewed by half compared to that for EACEI 2014;</li>\n<li>the part of the EACEI 2015 sample is negatively coordinated with the following surveys: CPSV18130, EMAGSA15, ECEIPE14, PV14_MONO, PV14_MULTI, ANT14, ANT14_3839, EAP14, CIS14, RPS16_TEST, RPS16, TPE15_R, TPE15_C, EDD14, CHALLENGES, TIC16_R, TIC16_C, ESA14_C, ESA14_R, SINE14_AUTO, SINE14₁;</li>\n<li>collection is done electronically;</li>\n<li>the sample of the extension collected at the end of the year (second wave) was not intended to be interviewed by a panel and was therefore drawn independently of the numbers of the previous surveys.</li>\n</ul>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.13.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The precision indicators (standard deviation, coefficient of variation, 95% confidence interval) take into account errors due to sampling, total non-response correction and calibration, but not the error related to partial non-response correction.<br /><br />The variables used for the EACEI 2015 precision calculations are :<br />BR_QAUP (quantity purchased in electricity)<br />DR_QAUP (quantity purchased in natural gas)<br />JR_QAUP (quantity purchased in butane-propane)<br />LR_QAUP (quantity purchased in heating oil)<br /><br />The indicators are as follows:<br />estimate of total<br />coefficient of variation in percentage = 100 * s / total<br /><br />The results of the calculations are in the file \"Calculs de pr&eacute;cision pour les variables cibles\".</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/901> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.17.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.17.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.17.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.17.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de sondage est le r&eacute;pertoire Sirus (r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques).<br />La m&eacute;thode d'&eacute;chantillonnage est un plan stratifi&eacute; par NTE (Nomenclature de Travail de l'EACEI), tranches d&rsquo;effectif salari&eacute;, et r&eacute;gion.<br />Les allocations sont optimis&eacute;es sur le croisement NTE x Tranches d&rsquo;effectifs, et sur la consommation nette d&rsquo;&eacute;nergie, en prenant en compte la moyenne des dispersions par strate des 3 derni&egrave;res ann&eacute;es. Les allocations sont exhaustives au-del&agrave; du seuil de 250 salari&eacute;s et pour les strates de moins de 10 unit&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.15.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1629/S.15.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1629> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/904>
