    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Contr&ocirc;les pendant la phase de collecte sur la coh&eacute;rence interne des r&eacute;ponses&nbsp;;<br />- Relances pendant la phase de collecte&nbsp;: relances par courrier exhaustives sur les non-r&eacute;pondants, relances t&eacute;l&eacute;phoniques prioris&eacute;es sur les non-r&eacute;pondants de grande taille&nbsp;;<br />- Apurement&nbsp;pour assurer la coh&eacute;rence des r&eacute;ponses au sein de chaque questionnaire&nbsp;;<br />- Winsorisation&nbsp;: contr&ocirc;le de l'influence des unit&eacute;s atypiques&nbsp;;<br />- Calcul d'indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1118>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice du questionnaire de l'enquête sur la production et la gestion des déchets dans le secteur tertiaire en Hauts-de-France"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/notice_questionnaire_dechet_HDF.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The collection period runs from October to November 2019.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "dr59-equipe-isq@insee.fr"@fr , "dr59-equipe-isq@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La population statistique est celle des &eacute;tablissements des Hauts-de-France actifs et exploitants (sauf pour les &eacute;tablissements de la section O des administrations o&ugrave; les non-exploitants sont &eacute;galement inclus) de 1 salari&eacute; ou plus du secteur tertiaire (sections G &agrave; S de la NACE &ndash; R&eacute;v2).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Aucune comparaison g&eacute;ographique des r&eacute;sultats n&rsquo;est possible &agrave; partir de cette enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951 on the obligation, coordination and secrecy of statistics. Available at https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573. <br /><br />Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L. 213-3 of the Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires bearing the visa provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to personal and family life and, in general, to private facts and conduct may not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after consulting the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality and in respect of a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, not to be communicated by the depositary service before the expiry of 75 years from the date of the survey or 25 years from the date of the person's death, whichever is the shorter. <br />A Committee on Statistical Confidentiality is hereby established. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to statistical confidentiality. It shall give its opinion on requests for the disclosure of individual data collected pursuant to this Law. The Committee is chaired by a Councillor of State, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes representatives of the National Assembly and the Senate. The composition and operating procedures of the committee are determined by decree of the Conseil d'&Eacute;tat. Beneficiaries of data communications resulting from ministerial decisions taken after consulting the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality undertake not to communicate such data to anyone. Any infringement of the provisions of this paragraph shall be punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Criminal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "L’unité d’interrogation est l’établissement, identifié par son numéro SIRET."@fr , "The interrogation unit is the establishment, identified by its SIRET number."@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/P> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2019X904RG"@fr , "2019X904RG"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The establishments belong to the following sections of the Nomenclature of Economic Activities in the European Community (Nace rev. 2)&nbsp;: <br />G : trade, repair of motor vehicles and motorcycles<br />H : transport and storage<br />I : accommodation and catering<br />J : Information and communication<br />K&nbsp;: financial and insurance activities<br />L : real estate activities<br />M : specialized, scientific and technical activities<br />N : administrative and support services activities<br />O&nbsp;: Public administration<br />P: teaching<br />Q : Human health and social action<br />R&nbsp;: Arts, entertainment and recreation<br />S : other service activities<br /><br />Number of employees<br />1 : 1 to 9 employees<br />2 : 10 to 49 employees<br />3 : 50 to 199 employees<br />4 : 200 employees or more</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A press release is distributed and posted on insee.fr on the date of publication of the results.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.6.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les comit&eacute;s qui ont donn&eacute; &agrave; l'Insee le droit et la l&eacute;gitimit&eacute; pour collecter ses donn&eacute;es sont&nbsp;:<br />- Le Cnis qui examine chaque nouveau projet, qu&rsquo;il s&rsquo;agisse d&rsquo;une enqu&ecirc;te, d&rsquo;un r&eacute;pertoire ou d&rsquo;une exploitation de fichiers administratifs&hellip; Ces projets sont pr&eacute;sent&eacute;s par toutes les institutions qui contribuent par leurs travaux &agrave; la construction de la statistique publique. La discussion porte notamment sur la finalit&eacute; du projet, sa place dans le syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;information et les conditions pr&eacute;vues de sa diffusion. Il convient de v&eacute;rifier que chaque op&eacute;ration r&eacute;pond &agrave; un besoin d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et ne fait pas double emploi avec les sources d&rsquo;information existantes, en d&rsquo;autres termes de s&rsquo;assurer de son opportunit&eacute;. Il donne un un avis d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute;.<br />- Le comit&eacute; du label, au sein du Cnis, veille &agrave; ce qu&rsquo;il respecte les crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique. Celui-ci s&rsquo;assure que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te r&eacute;pond aux crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique en ce qui concerne la m&eacute;thode de collecte et d&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage (plan de sondage, m&eacute;thode de redressement des donn&eacute;es, traitement des non-r&eacute;ponses garantissant la fiabilit&eacute; des r&eacute;sultats...), de pertinence du questionnement et d&rsquo;adaptation de la diffusion aux objectifs annonc&eacute;s. Il s&rsquo;assure &eacute;galement que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te n&rsquo;entra&icirc;ne pas de charge excessive sur les enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s, qu&rsquo;une concertation a &eacute;t&eacute; men&eacute;e avec les partenaires concern&eacute;s et que les souhaits exprim&eacute;s par le Cnis lors du d&eacute;bat d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute; ont bien &eacute;t&eacute; pris en compte. Il donne un label d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et de qualit&eacute; statistique.<br />Par ailleurs, un comit&eacute; local r&eacute;unissant des repr&eacute;sentants des entreprises et des salari&eacute;s a rendu un avis d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute; local &agrave; cette enqu&ecirc;te r&eacute;gionale.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.12.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Un comit&eacute; de concertation compos&eacute;, outre des trois partenaires financiers, des repr&eacute;sentants des politiques publiques concern&eacute;es par les questions de d&eacute;chets, des repr&eacute;sentants d&rsquo;organisations professionnelles et de syndicats de salari&eacute;s se r&eacute;unit au d&eacute;but et &agrave; la fin du projet.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Four themes are addressed in the survey:<br />- The volume and nature of waste produced <br />- Waste treatment and cost<br />- Obstacles to waste management and prevention<br />- The level of information on existing waste management schemes<br />Two final questions concern:<br />- ISO 14001 certification<br />- The obligation to report releases</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La publication des r&eacute;sultats se fait dans la collection r&eacute;gionale &laquo;&nbsp;Insee Flash&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>The sample includes approximately 2000 establishments.</p>"@en , "<p>L&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon comprend environ 2000 &eacute;tablissements.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.14.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>6 mois</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Checks during the collection phase on the internal consistency of responses<br />- Follow-ups during the collection phase: exhaustive mail-outs on non-respondents, priority telephone follow-ups on large non-respondents<br />- Clearance to ensure consistency of responses within each questionnaire<br />- Winsorisation: control of the influence of atypical units<br />- Calculation of precision indicators</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>With regard to Internet collection, the Coltrane collection site is completely secure and the standards for managing survey access codes are strict and standardised for all surveys undertaken.<br />Before the data is released, confidentiality is applied. For company data: no results are published for less than three companies or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be disclosed if no company or establishment contributes more than 85% of that result. Primary deletions correspond to boxes that do not meet the above criteria. Secondary secrecy removes other boxes so that the data cannot be retrieved by subtraction with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1119> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1118> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.14.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>6 months</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>April 2020 : Publication of the results in an Insee Flash</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.8.3>
                    "<p>The publication and additional data tables are distributed on Insee.fr.</p>"@en , "<p>La diffusion de la publication et de tableaux de donn&eacute;es compl&eacute;mentaires se fait sur Insee.fr.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Survey on waste generation and management in the tertiary sector in Hauts-de-France in 2019"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur la production et la gestion des déchets dans le secteur tertiaire en Hauts-de-France en 2019"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1489> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The database is not available online.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The individual data represent one line per establishment responding to the survey. Most of the variables are qualitative and make it possible to count the establishments that carry out a particular waste prevention or management practice. Some variables are quantitative and are expressed in m&sup3; (volume of waste produced) or in euros (amount spent on waste treatment).<br />The data published in an Insee Flash are percentages by sector of activity and size of institutions.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Quatre th&eacute;matiques sont abord&eacute;es dans l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te&nbsp;:<br />- le volume et la nature des d&eacute;chets produits&nbsp;; <br />- le traitement et le co&ucirc;t des d&eacute;chets&nbsp;;<br />- les freins &agrave; la gestion et la pr&eacute;vention des d&eacute;chets&nbsp;;<br />- le niveau d&rsquo;information sur les dispositifs existants en faveur de la gestion des d&eacute;chets&nbsp;;<br />Deux derni&egrave;res questions portent sur&nbsp;:<br />- la certification ISO 14001&nbsp;;<br />- l&rsquo;obligation de d&eacute;claration des rejets.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>One-time survey</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/Q> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Concernant la collecte internet, le site de collecte Coltrane est enti&egrave;rement s&eacute;curis&eacute; et les normes en termes de gestion des codes d&rsquo;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te sont strictes et standardis&eacute;es pour toutes les enqu&ecirc;tes entreprises.<br />Avant la diffusion des donn&eacute;es le secret est appliqu&eacute;. Pour les donn&eacute;es relatives aux entreprises : on ne publie aucun r&eacute;sultat qui concerne moins de trois entreprises ou &eacute;tablissements. De m&ecirc;me, un r&eacute;sultat ne sera diffus&eacute; que si aucune entreprise ou &eacute;tablissement ne contribue &agrave; plus de 85 % de ce r&eacute;sultat. Les suppression primaire correspondent aux cases ne r&eacute;pondant pas au crit&egrave;re ci-dessus. Le secret secondaire supprime d'autres cases pour que les donn&eacute;es ne puissent pas &ecirc;tre retrouv&eacute;es par addition soustraction avec les marges des tableaux. Le secret statistique est d&eacute;fini dans la loi n&deg; 51-711 du 7 juin 1951.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sample for the Waste Generation and Management survey is drawn from a sampling frame constructed from the Statistical business register Sirus .<br />The sampling method is a simple stratified random sample. The stratification corresponds to the crossover between 13 sections (G to S) of NACE - Rev2 and 4 employee groups (1 to 9, 10 to 49, 50 to 199, 200 and over), with establishments with 200 or more employees being surveyed in an exhaustive way.<br />The number of establishments to be sampled per stra</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La majorit&eacute; des variables sont qualitatives et permettent de d&eacute;nombrer les &eacute;tablissements qui actionnent telle ou telle pratique en mati&egrave;re de pr&eacute;vention ou de gestion des d&eacute;chets. <br />Quelques variables sont quantitatives et s&rsquo;expriment en m&sup3; (volume de d&eacute;chets produits) ou en en euros (montant consacr&eacute; au traitement des d&eacute;chets).<br />Les donn&eacute;es diffus&eacute;es dans un Insee Flash sont des pourcentages par secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute; et tranche de taille des &eacute;tablissements.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/L> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.20/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.20/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La publication des r&eacute;sultats se fait dans la collection r&eacute;gionale &laquo;&nbsp;Insee Flash&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different steps of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:<br />- test of the questionnaire prior to collection<br />- stratified sample selection<br />- reminders and checks of data being collected <br />- clearance <br />- adjustment of total non-response <br />- shimming <br />- adjustment for partial non-response <br />- compliance notice issued by the Label Committee.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.11.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique&nbsp;:<br />- test du questionnaire en amont de la collecte<br />- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon<br />- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte <br />- apurement <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale <br />- calage <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle <br />- avis de conformit&eacute; rendu par le Comit&eacute; du Label.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te &eacute;tant ponctuelle, elle ne permet pas de comparabilit&eacute; des r&eacute;sultats dans le temps.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.10/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.10/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>As the survey is ad hoc, it does not allow comparability of results over time.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The statistical population is that of active and operating Hauts-de-France establishments (except for establishments in Section O of the administrations where non-operators are also included) with 1 or more employees in the tertiary sector (NACE Sections G to S &ndash; Rev2).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.8.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The publication calendar available on Insee.fr.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>No geographical comparison of the results is possible from this survey.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Avril 2020&nbsp;: Publication des r&eacute;sultats dans la collection &laquo;&nbsp; Insee Flash&nbsp;&raquo;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is subject to an internal database archiving procedure.<br />The individual files of the survey are made available to users outside INSEE via the Secure Data Access Centre (CASD), after passing through the Secret Committee.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de donn&eacute;es n&rsquo;est pas disponible en ligne.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Total non-response is adjusted by reweighting the responding units after calculating homogeneous response groups and partial non-response using hot-deck methods. <br />Units with a partial non-response rate above a certain threshold (often 80%) are referred to as non-respondents. Some so-called \"non-substitutable\" units may be treated separately, because of their atypical behaviour and the influence they may have on the results. <br />The calculation of confidence intervals of the results will also be performed.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Voir le document&nbsp;: &laquo;&nbsp; M&eacute;thodes et pratique des enqu&ecirc;tes entreprises.pdf&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/891> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>In addition to the three financial partners, a consultation committee composed of representatives of public policies concerned with waste issues, representatives of professional organizations and employee unions meets at the beginning and end of the project.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>2019</p>"@fr , "<p>2019</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'&eacute;chantillon de l'enqu&ecirc;te Production et gestion des d&eacute;chets est tir&eacute; dans une base de sondage construite &agrave; partir du Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus).<br />La m&eacute;thode d'&eacute;chantillonnage est un sondage al&eacute;atoire simple stratifi&eacute;. La stratification correspond au croisement entre 13 sections (G &agrave; S) de la NACE &ndash; R&eacute;v2 et 4 tranches d&rsquo;effectif en nombre de salari&eacute;s (1 &agrave; 9, 10 &agrave; 49, 50 &agrave; 199, 200 et plus), les &eacute;tablissements de 200 salari&eacute;s et plus &eacute;tant interrog&eacute;s de mani&egrave;re exhaustive.<br />Le nombre d&rsquo;&eacute;tablissements &agrave; &eacute;chantillonner par strate provient d&rsquo;une allocation proportionnelle au nombre de salari&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Enqu&ecirc;te ponctuelle</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.11.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.11.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quality sheet is described in accordance with the European standard of Single integrated metadata structure (SIMS).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.8.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.8.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les &eacute;tablissements appartiennent aux sections suivantes de la nomenclature des activit&eacute;s &eacute;conomiques dans la Communaut&eacute; Europ&eacute;enne (Nace r&eacute;v.2) <br />G&nbsp;: commerce, r&eacute;paration d&rsquo;automobiles et de motocycles&nbsp;;<br />H&nbsp;: transports et entreposage&nbsp;;<br />I&nbsp;: h&eacute;bergement et restauration&nbsp;;<br />J&nbsp;: Information et communication&nbsp;;<br />K&nbsp;: activit&eacute;s financi&egrave;res et d&rsquo;assurances&nbsp;;<br />L&nbsp;: activit&eacute;s immobili&egrave;res&nbsp;;<br />M&nbsp;: activit&eacute;s sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;es, scientifiques et techniques&nbsp;;<br />N&nbsp;: activit&eacute;s de services administratifs et de soutien&nbsp;;<br />O&nbsp;: administration publique&nbsp;;<br />P&nbsp;: enseignement&nbsp;;<br />Q&nbsp;: sant&eacute; humaine et action sociale&nbsp;;<br />R&nbsp;: arts, spectacles et activit&eacute;s r&eacute;cr&eacute;atives&nbsp;;<br />S&nbsp;:&nbsp;autres activit&eacute;s de services.<br /><br />Les tranches d&rsquo;effectifs salari&eacute;s sont&nbsp;:<br />1&nbsp;: 1 &agrave; 9 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />2&nbsp;: 10 &agrave; 49 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />3&nbsp;: 50 &agrave; 199 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />4&nbsp;: 200 salari&eacute;s ou plus.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Compared to the national survey on waste production, this survey covers all sectors of activity in the tertiary sector, whereas the national survey only covers the trade sector. In addition, it develops the issues of waste prevention and possible actions to reduce and better manage waste. On the other hand, the detail of the waste produced is less precise than in the national survey.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.15.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/I.20/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Publications Hauts-de-France&nbsp;: https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques?debut=0&amp;categorie=2&amp;geo=COMPRD-1+REG-32&amp;idfacette=3<br />Ademe&nbsp;: https://www.ademe.fr/</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.7.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1933> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>&nbsp;See the document &laquo;&nbsp;M&eacute;thodes et pratique des enqu&ecirc;tes entreprises.pdf&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/891> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.14.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.14.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.14.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1933/S.14.1/text> ;
