            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Establishments belong to sections B and C (division 05 to 33), to group 383 (recovery),<br />excluding: subclasses 1013B, 1071B, 1071C, 1071D (commercial crafts), 2013A and 2446Z;<br />excluding divisions 05, 06 and 19;<br />excluding group 091.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/L> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.1.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.4>
                    "<p>Chef de la division ETET</p>"@fr , "<p>Head of the ETET Division</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Activity (NACE rev.2 divisions)<br />07-Mining of metal ores <br />08-Other mining and quarring <br />09-Mining support service activity <br />10-Manufacture of food products <br />11-Manufacturing of beverages <br />12-Manufacture of tobacco products <br />13-Manufacture of textiles <br />14-Manufacture of wearing apparel <br />15-Manufacture of leather and related products <br />16-Manufacture of wood and of products of wood and cork, except furniture; manufacture of articles of straw and painting materials <br />17-Manufacture of paper and paperproduct <br />18-Printing and reproduction of recorded media <br />19-Manufacture of coke and refined petroleum produtcs <br />20-Manufacture of chemical products <br />21-Manufacture of basic pharmaceutical products and pharmaceutical preparations <br />22-Manufacture of rubber and plastic products <br />23-Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products <br />24-Manufacture of basic metals <br />25-Manufacture of fabricated metal products, except machinery and equipment <br />26-Manufacturing of computer, electronic and optical products <br />27-Manufacture of electrical equipment <br />28-Manufacture of machinery and equipment n.e.c. <br />29-Manufacture of motor vehicles, trallers and semi-trallers <br />30-Manufacture of other transport equipment <br />31-Manufacture of furniture <br />32-Other manufacturing <br />33-Repair and installation of machinery and equipment <br />38-Waste collection, treatment and disposal activities; materials recovery<br />TOTAL<br /><br />Number of employees<br />less than 50 employees<br />50 to 99 employees<br />100 to 249 employees<br />250 to 499 employees<br />500 employees and more<br />TOTAL<br /><br />Region<br />11-&Icirc;le-de-France&nbsp; <br />24-Centre-Val de Loire<br />27-Bourgogne-Franche-Comt&eacute; <br />28-Normandie<br />32-Hauts-de-France<br />44-Grand Est<br />52-Pays de la Loire<br />53-Bretagne<br />75-Nouvelle-Aquitaine<br />76-Occitanie<br />84-Auvergne-Rh&ocirc;ne-Alpes<br />93-Paca et Corse <br />97-D&eacute;partements d&rsquo;outre-mer<br />TOTAL</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pas de r&eacute;vision pr&eacute;vue sur les donn&eacute;es de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is subject to an internal database archiving procedure.<br />Individual files are made available to users outside Insee via the Secure Data Access Centre (CASD), after being reviewed by the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Checks during the collection phase: checks on internal coherence and temporal coherence in the form of an alert at the time of data entry;<br />- Follow-ups during the collection phase: exhaustive reminders by mail on non-respondents, priority telephone reminders on large non-respondents;<br />- Data cleaning to ensure consistency of answers within each questionnaire;<br />- Calculation of precision indicators.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.17.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La s&eacute;rie comprend des quantit&eacute;s consomm&eacute;es par type d'&eacute;nergie, les co&ucirc;ts aff&eacute;rents, et la r&eacute;partition par usage de chaque &eacute;nergie utilis&eacute;e ainsi que des donn&eacute;es de cadrage sur les &eacute;tablissements enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Focus (<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3310452\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3310452</a>) and Insee Resultats (<a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3364874\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/3364874</a>) are available on the insee.fr site.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>EACEI 2017 was collected via the internet and possibly by post (at the request of the establishment).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Focus, Insee R&eacute;sultats</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le th&egrave;me abord&eacute; est celui des diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;nergies employ&eacute;es par les &eacute;tablissements, en termes d&rsquo;achats (en volume, en valeur) et d&rsquo;usage par l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement. Les principales &eacute;nergies observ&eacute;es sont&nbsp;:<br />- l&rsquo;&eacute;lectricit&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- la vapeur et les autres fluides caloporteurs ;<br />- le gaz naturel&nbsp;et les autres gaz ;<br />- la houille , le lignite ou charbon pauvre, le coke de houille, le coke de p&eacute;trole et le butane- propane&nbsp;;<br />- le fioul lourd, le fioul domestique et les autres produits p&eacute;troliers ;<br />- la liqueur noire, le bois ;<br />- l&rsquo;hydrog&egrave;ne&nbsp;;<br />- les autres combustibles renouvelables ou non.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey responds to the request of the International Energy Agency (IEA) for information on the subject of energy consumption and to Community Regulation 58/97 on structural business statistics which lays down additional obligations in this area.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour la diffusion,&nbsp;en plus des publications, il y a &eacute;galement&nbsp;des indicateurs de qualit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.15.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.15.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.7.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.7.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.7.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different stages of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- stratified sampling<br />- reminders and controls of data being collected <br />- data cleaning<br />- correction of overall non-response <br />- calibration<br />- correction of partial non-response<br />- the questionnaire was tested in 2013 upstream of the collection, with 97 establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2017-10-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> , <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The theme addressed is the different energies used by the establishments, in terms of purchases (volume, value) and use by the establishment. The main energies observed are:<br />- electricity;<br />- steam and other heat transfer fluids;<br />- natural gas&nbsp; and other gases;<br />- coal, lignite, lean coal, coal coke, petroleum coke, butane, propane;<br />- heavy fuel oil, heating oil and other petroleum products;<br />- black liquor, wood;<br />- special renewable and non-renewable fuels.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.19/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.19/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@fr , "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sampling frame is the Sirus directory (system of identification to directory of statistical units).<br />The sampling method is a stratified plan by the nomenclature of activities (NTE) dedicated to energy consumption, workforce bands, and region.<br />Allocations are optimised on the NTE x workforce bands, and on net energy consumption, taking into account the average dispersion per stratum over the last 3 years. The allowances are exhaustive above the threshold of 250 employees, big consumers of energy and for strata of less than 10 units.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon comprend environ 8&nbsp;500 &eacute;tablissements.</p>"@fr , "<p>&nbsp;The sample includes approximately 8,500 establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The scope of the survey is the same every year.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>Ann&eacute;e 2017</p>"@fr , "<p>Year 2017</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.17.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For dissemination, in addition to publications, there are also data quality indicators.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.11.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique&nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon <br />- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte <br />- apurement <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale <br />- calage <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle <br />- le questionnaire a &eacute;t&eacute; test&eacute; en 2013 aupr&egrave;s de 97 &eacute;tablissements dans le cadre du dernier passage de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te devant le comit&eacute; du label.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le champ de l'enqu&ecirc;te est constant d&rsquo;une ann&eacute;e sur l&rsquo;autre.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.10.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.7.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.7.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.7.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The population is composed by establishments with 20 or more employees, with at least 4 months of activity in 2017, and main activity code (APET) corresponding to sections B and C (division 05 to 33), to group 383 (materials recovery), <br />excluding: subclasses: 1013B, 1071B, 1071C, 1071D (commercial crafts), 2013A and 2446Z;<br />excluding divisions 05, 06 and 19;<br />outside group 091.</p>\n<p>The sample includes approximately 8,500 establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.7/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/I.18.7/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/898>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Notice explicative 2017 de l'enquête sur les consommations d'énergie dans l'industrie / EACEI"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/EACEI2017_notice.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.6.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.6.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.6.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.6.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E430> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1865> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A consultative committee met every year. It is composed, in addition to the two producer services, by experts and representatives of the public policies concerned with energy issues, representatives of professional organizations, employee unions and the energy sector.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.16/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le comit&eacute; du label s&rsquo;assure que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te n&rsquo;entra&icirc;ne pas de charge excessive sur les enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s.<br />De plus, d'autres d&eacute;cisions ont &eacute;t&eacute; prises afin de limiter la charge des r&eacute;pondants&nbsp;:&nbsp; <br />- l&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon de l&rsquo;EACEI 2017 est renouvel&eacute; par moiti&eacute; par rapport &agrave; celui de l&rsquo;EACEI 2016&nbsp;;<br />- la partie de l&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon EACEI 2017 tir&eacute;e cette ann&eacute;e est coordonn&eacute;e n&eacute;gativement avec les autres enqu&ecirc;tes th&eacute;matiques aupr&egrave;s des entreprises&nbsp;;<br />- la collecte se fait par voie &eacute;lectronique.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.17.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pas de r&eacute;vision pr&eacute;vue sur les donn&eacute;es de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1865/S.13.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.1>
