                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058, 92541 MONTROUGE CEDEX FRANCE</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058, 92541 MONTROUGE CEDEX FRANCE</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey responds to the European Regulation on structural business statistics (EC N&deg;251/2009) of 11 March 2009, requesting environmental protection expenditure broken down by environmental domain, activity and size of enterprise.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Contr&ocirc;les pendant la phase de collecte<br />- Relances pendant la phase de collecte&nbsp;: relances par courrier exhaustives sur les non-r&eacute;pondants, relances t&eacute;l&eacute;phoniques prioris&eacute;es sur les non-r&eacute;pondants de grande taille<br />- Apurement&nbsp;pour assurer la coh&eacute;rence des r&eacute;ponses au sein de chaque questionnaire<br />- Winsorisation&nbsp;: contr&ocirc;le de l'influence des unit&eacute;s atypiques<br />- Calcul d'indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.13.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The precision indicators (standard deviation, coefficient of variation, 95% confidence interval) take into account errors due to sampling, total non-response correction and calibration, but not the error related to partial non-response correction.</p>\n<p>The variables used for the Antipol 2017 precision calculations are:<br />- TOT_ETUDE (total amount of studies to protect the environment)<br />- TI (total amount of specific investments)<br />- I2 (amount of integrated environmental protection investments)<br />- TOT_INVEST (amount of total investments)</p>\n<p>For quantitative variables in volume, the indicators are as follows:<br />total<br />Coefficient of variation (CV) in percent =&nbsp;100 * s / total<br />95% confidence interval (CI) = [total +/- 1.96 s].</p>\n<p>Note: sometimes the lower bound of the confidence interval is negative. This means that the normal approximation used in the confidence interval formula (factor 1.96) is not valid. In this case, the unweighted total observed on the sample was used as the lower bound value, and therefore the confidence interval is no longer centred around the estimator value.</p>\n<p>The results of the calculations are in the file \"Calculs de precision 2017\"(fr).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1114> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.5/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.8.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.8.3>
                    "<p>Les donn&eacute;es sont publi&eacute;es annuellement dans les collections &laquo;&nbsp;Insee Focus&nbsp;&raquo;, &laquo;&nbsp;Insee R&eacute;sultats&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@fr , "<p>The data are published annually in the collections \"Insee Focus\", \"Insee Results\".</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de sondage est le Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus).<br />La m&eacute;thode d'&eacute;chantillonnage est un plan stratifi&eacute; par secteur d'activit&eacute;, taille d'unit&eacute; et localisation (depuis l'ann&eacute;e de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence 2014). Les allocations sont optimis&eacute;es sur les montants des &eacute;tudes et des investissements des enqu&ecirc;tes pr&eacute;c&eacute;dentes (allocations de Neyman). Elles sont exhaustives au-del&agrave; d'un certain seuil.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>- les montants d'&eacute;tudes et d'investissements sont ceux r&eacute;alis&eacute;s au cours du dernier exercice comptable clos en 2017<br />- l'effectif de l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement est celui au 31/12/2017<br />- les informations concernant le classement/la certification de l'&eacute;tablissement concernent l'ann&eacute;e 2017 (INSTCLAS, AUTORIS, ISO, ENVOIE, AUT_CERTIF, EFF_ENV, SERV1)<br />- le reste des donn&eacute;es qualitatives &ndash; Informations g&eacute;n&eacute;rales du cadre A &ndash; porte sur la situation de l'entreprise au moment de r&eacute;pondre &agrave; l'enqu&ecirc;te (juin &agrave; octobre 2018)</p>"@fr , "<p>- the amounts of studies and investments are those carried out during the last financial year ended in 2017<br />- the staff of the establishment is that at 31/12/2017<br />- the information concerning the classification/certification of the establishment concern the year 2017 (INSTCLAS, AUTORIS, ISO, ENVOIE, AUT_CERTIF, EFF_ENV, SERV1)<br />- the rest of the qualitative data &ndash;General information of framework A&ndash; relates to the situation of the company at the time of answering the survey (June to October 2018)</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/913>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
