    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Il s'agit des &eacute;tablissements industriels de 20 salari&eacute;s et plus, appartenant aux sections B, C, D de la NAF r&eacute;v.2.</p>\n<p>L'&eacute;chantillon est de l'ordre de 11&nbsp;000 unit&eacute;s (r&eacute;partis en 9&nbsp;000 sur le champ hors IAA et scieries, 2&nbsp;000 sur le champ IAA et scieries).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Activity: divisions of the French activity nomenclature (NAF rev.2 divisions-detailed at group level for LPNs)<br />05 to 09.19-Extraction Coking and refining<br />101-Processing and preserving of meat and preparation of meat products<br />102-Processing and preserving of fish, crustaceans and molluscs<br />103-Processing and preserving of fruit and vegetables<br />104-Manufacture of vegetable and animal oils and fats<br />105-Manufacture of dairy products<br />106-Grain processing; manufacture of starch products<br />107-Manufacture of bakery and pasta products<br />108-Manufacture of other food products<br />109-Manufacture of animal feed<br />110-Manufacture of beverages<br />120-Manufacture of tobacco products<br />13-Manufacture of textiles<br />14-Clothing industry<br />15-Leather and Footwear Industry<br />16-Woodworking and manufacture of articles of wood and cork, except furniture; manufacture of articles of straw and plaiting materials<br />17-Paper and paperboard industry<br />18-Printing and reproduction of recordings<br />20-Chemical industry<br />21-Pharmaceutical industry<br />22-Manufacture of rubber and plastic products<br />23-Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products<br />24-Metallurgy<br />25-Manufacture of metal products, except machinery and equipment<br />26-Manufacturing of computer, electronic and optical products<br />27-Manufacture of electrical equipment<br />28-Manufacture of machinery and equipment n c a<br />29-Automotive industry<br />30-Manufacture of other transport equipment<br />31-Furniture manufacturing<br />32-Other manufacturing industries<br />33-Repair and installation of machinery and equipment<br />35-Production and distribution of electricity, gas, steam and air conditioning</p>\n<p>Number of employees:<br />20 to 49 employees<br />50 to 99 employees<br />100 to 249 employees<br />250 to 499 employees<br />500 to 999 employees<br />1000 employees and more<br /><br />Regions:<br />&Icirc;le-de-France<br />Centre-Val de Loire<br />Bourgogne-Franche-Comt&eacute;<br />Normandie<br />Hauts-de-France<br />Grand Est<br />Pays de la Loire<br />Bretagne<br />Nouvelle-Aquitaine<br />Occitanie<br />Auvergne-Rh&ocirc;ne-Alpes<br />Provence-Alpes-C&ocirc;te d&rsquo;Azur<br />Corse<br />Overseas regions</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Concernant la collecte internet, le site de collecte est enti&egrave;rement s&eacute;curis&eacute; et les normes en termes de gestion des codes d&rsquo;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te sont strictes. Pour les entreprises choisissant d&rsquo;utiliser le support papier, la saisie est assur&eacute;e par les gestionnaires, dans le strict respect de la confidentialit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es r&eacute;colt&eacute;es.<br />Avant la diffusion des donn&eacute;es le secret est appliqu&eacute;. Pour les donn&eacute;es relatives aux entreprises&nbsp;: on ne publie aucun r&eacute;sultat qui concerne moins de trois entreprises ou &eacute;tablissements. De m&ecirc;me, un r&eacute;sultat ne sera diffus&eacute; que si aucune entreprise ou &eacute;tablissement ne contribue &agrave; plus de 85&nbsp;% de ce r&eacute;sultat. Ainsi le secret dit primaire correspond aux cases r&eacute;pondant au crit&egrave;re ci-dessus. Le secret secondaire supprime d'autres cases pour que les donn&eacute;es ne puissent pas &ecirc;tre retrouv&eacute;es par addition soustraction avec les marge des tableaux. Le secret statistique est d&eacute;fini dans la loi n&deg;&nbsp;51-711 du 7 juin 1951.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour la diffusion,&nbsp;en plus des publications, il y a &eacute;galement&nbsp;des indicateurs de qualit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>M&eacute;thodologie de l'enqu&ecirc;te annuelle sur les investissements prot&eacute;geant l'environnement dans les industries agro-alimentaire (IAA) Site internet du minist&egrave;re de l'agriculture<br /><a href=\"http://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/enquetes/environnement/depenses-pour-proteger-l\"> http://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/enquetes/environnement/depenses-pour-proteger-l</a></p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2019-06-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The themes focus on investments (hardware entirely dedicated to environmental protection, purchases of production facilities more efficient in terms of environmental issues...), studies (regulatory or investment-related) and current expenditure (collected every 3 years), destined for environmental protection.</p>\n<p>This expenditure is allocated according to the areas concerned:<br />- Waste water<br />- Air protection<br />- Limiting greenhouse gas emissions<br />- Wastes<br />- Noises and vibrations<br />- Soils; ground and surface water<br />- Sites, landscapes and biodiversity<br />- Other fields</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.5/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.5/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier DUSSUD</p>"@fr , "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier DUSSUD</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1112> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The frame is the Statistical business register (Sirus).<br />The sampling method is stratification by industry, unit size and location (since the reference year 2014). The allocations are optimized on the amounts of research and investment in previous surveys (Neyman allocation). They are completeness beyond a certain threshold.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Regarding Internet collection, the collection site is completely secure and the standards in terms of managing access codes to the survey are strict. For companies choosing to use paper, the data entry is ensured by the managers, in strict respect of the confidentiality of the data collected.<br />Before the dissemination of the data the secrecy is applied. For enterprise data: no results are published for less than three enterprises or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be released if no company or institution contributes more than 85% of that result. Thus the so-called primary secret corresponds to the boxes meeting the above criterion. The secondary secret removes other boxes so that the data cannot be retrieved by subtraction with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>Ann&eacute;e 2017</p>"@fr , "<p>Year 2017</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.6.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les comit&eacute;s qui ont donn&eacute; &agrave; l'Insee le droit et la l&eacute;gitimit&eacute; pour collecter ses donn&eacute;es sont&nbsp;:<br />- Le Cnis qui examine chaque nouveau projet, qu&rsquo;il s&rsquo;agisse d&rsquo;une enqu&ecirc;te, d&rsquo;un r&eacute;pertoire ou d&rsquo;une exploitation de fichiers administratifs&hellip; Ces projets sont pr&eacute;sent&eacute;s par toutes les institutions qui contribuent par leurs travaux &agrave; la construction de la statistique publique. La discussion porte notamment sur la finalit&eacute; du projet, sa place dans le syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;information et les conditions pr&eacute;vues de sa diffusion. Il convient de v&eacute;rifier que chaque op&eacute;ration r&eacute;pond &agrave; un besoin d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et ne fait pas double emploi avec les sources d&rsquo;information existantes, en d&rsquo;autres termes de s&rsquo;assurer de son opportunit&eacute;. Il donne un un avis d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute;.<br />- Le comit&eacute; du label, au sein du Cnis, veille &agrave; ce qu&rsquo;il respecte les crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique. Celui-ci s&rsquo;assure que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te r&eacute;pond aux crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique en ce qui concerne la m&eacute;thode de collecte et d&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage (plan de sondage, m&eacute;thode de redressement des donn&eacute;es, traitement des non-r&eacute;ponses garantissant la fiabilit&eacute; des r&eacute;sultats...), de pertinence du questionnement et d&rsquo;adaptation de la diffusion aux objectifs annonc&eacute;s. Il s&rsquo;assure &eacute;galement que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te n&rsquo;entra&icirc;ne pas de charge excessive sur les enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s, qu&rsquo;une concertation a &eacute;t&eacute; men&eacute;e avec les partenaires concern&eacute;s et que les souhaits exprim&eacute;s par le Cnis lors du d&eacute;bat d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute; ont bien &eacute;t&eacute; pris en compte. Il donne un label d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et de qualit&eacute; statistique.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique&nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon<br />- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte<br />- apurement<br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale<br />- calage<br />- redressement de la non r&eacute;ponse partielle<br />- winsorisation (contr&ocirc;le de l'influence des unit&eacute;s atypiques)<br />- le questionnaire a &eacute;t&eacute; test&eacute; (au 4e trimestre 2012) dans le cadre du passage de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te devant le comit&eacute; du label d&eacute;but 2013</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le champ de l'enqu&ecirc;te a &eacute;t&eacute; restreint par rapport &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;dition 2014 qui incluait en plus les unit&eacute;s l&eacute;gales des divisions 38 (Collecte, traitement et &eacute;limination des d&eacute;chets&nbsp;; r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration) et 39 (D&eacute;pollution et autres services de gestion des d&eacute;chets).<br />L'&eacute;volution du plan de sondage (abandon du secteur de la gestion des d&eacute;chets) et des m&eacute;thodes de redressement peuvent aussi affecter certaines &eacute;volutions.<br />&Agrave; noter que les donn&eacute;es du secteur de la gestion des d&eacute;chets (divisions 38 et 39) &eacute;taient diffus&eacute;es &agrave; part. <br />Pas de diff&eacute;rence avec 2015, ni avec 2016 hormis l&rsquo;absence du volet d&eacute;penses.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The establishments belong to divisions 05 to 35 of NAF rev.&nbsp;2.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>11,000 units</p>"@en , "<p>11&nbsp;000 unit&eacute;s</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is subject to an internal database archiving procedure. Individual files are made available to users outside Insee via the Secure Data Access Centre (CASD), after being reviewed by the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Checks during the collection phase: checks on internal coherence and temporal coherence in the form of an alert at the time of data entry<br />- Follow-ups during the collection phase: exhaustive reminders by mail on non-respondents, priority telephone reminders on large non-respondents<br />- Data cleaning to ensure consistency of answers within each questionnaire<br />- Calculation of precision indicators</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.6.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.6.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.6.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.6.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.20/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E430> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Focus and Insee Resultats will be available on the insee.fr site.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s portent sur les investissements (mat&eacute;riels enti&egrave;rement d&eacute;di&eacute;s &agrave; la protection de l'environnement, achats d'&eacute;quipements de production plus performants en mati&egrave;re environnementale...), les &eacute;tudes (en vue d'un investissement ou r&eacute;glementaires) et les d&eacute;penses courantes (collect&eacute;es tous les 3 ans) destin&eacute;es &agrave; prot&eacute;ger l'environnement.</p>\n<p>Ces d&eacute;penses sont r&eacute;parties selon les domaines concern&eacute;s&nbsp;:<br />- eaux us&eacute;es&nbsp;;<br />- protection de l'air&nbsp;;<br />- limitation des gaz &agrave; effet de serre&nbsp;;<br />- d&eacute;chets&nbsp;;<br />- bruits et vibrations&nbsp;;<br />- sols et eaux souterraines et de surface&nbsp;;<br />- sites, paysages et biodiversit&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- autres domaines.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Internet with the possibility of using postal means upon demand.</p>\n<p>Units of measure:<br />- The workforce of the establishment is requested on 31/12/2017 (EFF_ETAB), number of FTE dedicated to environnment (EFF_ENV): number of occupied people<br />- Studies and investments for environmental protection: thousands of euros<br />- The shares (PART_ACHAT, PART_ENVIR) and breakdown (IE, ID, IA, IG, IB, IS, IP, IR et TOT_PCT): percentage (%)</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.19/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.19/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey shows a slight increase in response rate: 86.8% (81.8% in the previous edition that included current expenditure).</p>\n<p>Before any exploitation, it is also useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and the confidence intervals provided in the survey quality indicators.</p>\n<p>This year, the partial non-response rate is weak. The variable I2 (share of integrated investments to protect the environment) stands at 6.6%.</p>\n<p>This variable should therefore be analysed with caution, as a significant proportion of the responses have therefore been imputed.</p>\n<p>The other variables all have a partial non-response rate of less than 6%.</p>\n<p>In terms of precision, the main numerical variables have the following coefficients of variation:<br />Total amount of studies to protect the environment (TOT_ETUDE): 3.4%<br />Total amount of specific investments (IT): 3.4%.<br />Amount of integrated environmental protection investments (I2): 3.5%.<br />Amount of total investments (TI+I2): 2,9%.</p>\n<p>Accuracy degrades when one focuses on finer diffusion domains. In particular, the following sectors of activity have a coefficient of variation exceeding 20% and should be analysed with caution:<br /><br />For (TOT_ETUDE)<br />Clothing industry<br />Repair and installation of machinery and equipment<br />Printing and reproduction of recordings<br />Manufacture of electrical equipment</p>\n<p>For (TI) <br />Clothing industry<br />Electricity, gas, steam and air conditioning generation and distribution<br />Repair and installation of machinery and equipment<br />Leather and Footwear Industry<br />Other manufacturing industries<br />Manufacture of electrical equipment</p>\n<p>For variable TI, the overseas region (97) is in the same case.</p>\n<p>For (I2)<br />Leather and Footwear Industry<br />Printing and reproduction of recordings<br />Clothing industry<br />Furniture manufacturing<br />Woodworking and manufacture of articles of wood and cork, except furniture; manufacture of articles of straw and plaiting materials</p>\n<p>For variable I2, the overseas regions (97) and Corse (94) are in the same case.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/L> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>These are industrial establishments with 20 or more employees, belonging to sections B, C, D of NAF rev.2.</p>\n<p>The sample is in the order of 11,000 units (divided into 9,000 on the field excluding LPN and sawmills, 2,000 on the field LPN and sawmills).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different stages of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:<br />- stratified sample selection<br />- reminders and checks of data being collected<br />- clearance<br />- adjustment for total non-response<br />- shimming<br />- adjustment for partial non-response<br />- winsorisation&nbsp; (control of the influence of atypical units)<br />- the questionnaire was tested (in the 4th quarter 2012) as part of the survey's appearance before the label committee in early 2013</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'Insee Focus et l'Insee R&eacute;sultats sont disponibles sur le site insee.fr.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La m&eacute;thodologie de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te est disponible dans le fichier &laquo;&nbsp;M&eacute;thodes et pratique des enqu&ecirc;tes entreprises &raquo;.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/891> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey methodology is available in \"Methods and Practice of Business Surveys\" (fr).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
