                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.10/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.10/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte d&rsquo;ANTIPOL 2017 a &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par internet et, &eacute;ventuellement, par voie postale (&agrave; la demande de l'entreprise).</p>\n<p>Unit&eacute;s de mesure&nbsp;:<br />- Effectifs au 31/12/2017 (EFF_ETAB), Nombre d'ETP affect&eacute;s &agrave; l'environnement (EFF_ENV)&nbsp;: en nombre de personnes occup&eacute;es<br />- Montants (Etudes et investissements pour prot&eacute;ger l&rsquo;investissement)&nbsp;: en kilo-euros<br />- Part des achats de services (PART_ACHAT), des investissements pour l&rsquo;environnement (I3, PART_ENVIR) et ventilation des investissements int&eacute;gr&eacute;s (IE, ID, IA, IG, IB, IS, IP, IR et TOT_PCT)&nbsp;: en pourcentage (%)</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The scope of the survey was narrowed compared to the 2014 edition which also included the legal units of divisions 38 (Waste collection, treatment and disposal; recovery) and 39 (Pollution control and other waste management services).<br />Note that data for the waste management sector (divisions 38 and 39) were disseminated separately.<br />No difference with 2015 and 2016 (except the lack of current expenditure interrogation).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.15.2>
