    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1864/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1864> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1864/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1864> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1864/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Since 2013, overseas establishments (except Mayotte) are included in the survey.</p>\n<p>Based on reference data for 2010, the survey covers the enterprises with at least 10 employees within the sectors of activity in NACE rev. 2 as follows : Sections B to N, O except state public service, P except the French Education Department and Q to S.</p>\n<p>In 2008 and 2009, Section O was not covered at all.</p>\n<p>For data up to and including 2007, the survey covers sectors of activity from sections C to K, M, N and O in NACE rev. 1.1</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1864>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Labour cost and structure of earnings annual survey 2015"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur le coût de la main-d'œuvre et la structure des salaires 2015"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1416> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1973> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.1.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.7>
                    "01 87 69 61 70"@fr , "01 87 69 61 70"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The population is composed by establishments with 20 or more employees, with at least 4 months of activity in 2020, and main activity code ('APET) corresponding to sections B and C (division 05 to 33), to group 383 (materials recovery), <br />excluding: subclasses: 1013B, 1071B, 1071C, 1071D (commercial crafts), 2013A and 2446Z ;<br />excluding divisions 05, 06 and 19;<br />outside group 091.<br /><br />&nbsp;The sample includes approximately 8500 establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le th&egrave;me abord&eacute; est celui des diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;nergies employ&eacute;es par les &eacute;tablissements, en termes d&rsquo;achats (en volume, en valeur) et d&rsquo;usage par l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement. Les principales &eacute;nergies observ&eacute;es sont&nbsp;:<br />- l&rsquo;&eacute;lectricit&eacute; ;<br />- la vapeur et les autres fluides caloporteurs ;<br />- le gaz naturel&nbsp;et les autres gaz ;<br />- la houille , le lignite ou charbon pauvre, le coke de houille, le coke de p&eacute;trole et le butane- propane ;<br />- le fioul lourd, le fioul domestique et les autres produits p&eacute;troliers ;<br />- la liqueur noire, le bois ;<br />- l&rsquo;hydrog&egrave;ne&nbsp;;<br />- les autres combustibles renouvelables ou non.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>EACEI 2020 is collected via the internet and possibly by post (at the request of the establishment).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La s&eacute;rie de donn&eacute;es comprend des quantit&eacute;s consomm&eacute;es par type d'&eacute;nergie (en volume&nbsp;:&nbsp; (kW, MWh, tonnes, litres, Nm&sup3;), les co&ucirc;ts aff&eacute;rents (k&euro;), et la r&eacute;partition par usage de chaque &eacute;nergie utilis&eacute;e ainsi que des donn&eacute;es de cadrage sur les &eacute;tablissements enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.15.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les donn&eacute;es de l'enqu&ecirc;te EACEI 2020 peuvent &ecirc;tre en partie compl&eacute;t&eacute;es par l&rsquo;Enqu&ecirc;te sur les consommations d'&eacute;nergie et les investissements antipollution dans les petits &eacute;tablissements de moins de 20 salari&eacute;s (ECEI-PE) de 2014 en &eacute;tant vigilant quant aux diff&eacute;rences de champ&nbsp;: ECEI-PE, outre le d&eacute;calage de l&rsquo;ann&eacute;e de collecte, enqu&ecirc;te les &eacute;tablissements de 1 &agrave; 19 salari&eacute;s et ne s&rsquo;attache qu&rsquo;&agrave; un nombre restreint d&rsquo;&eacute;nergies.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different stages of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- stratified sampling<br />- reminders and controls of data being collected <br />- data cleaning<br />- correction of&nbsp; overall non-response <br />- calibration<br />- correction of partial non-response<br />- the questionnaire was tested in 2013 upstream of the collection, with 97 establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.5/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.5/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The serie includes quantities consumed by type of energy (kW, MWh, tonnes, litres, Nm&sup3;), related costs (k&euro;), and the breakdown by use of each energy, as well as contextual data on the surveyed establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.15.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The data from the EACEI 2020 survey can be partially supplemented by the Survey of Energy Consumption and Pollution Investments in Small Establishments with Less than 20 Employees (ECEI-PE) 2014 by being vigilant about differences in scope: ECEI-PE, in addition to the four-years lag, surveys establishments with 1 to 19 employees and only focuses on a limited number of energies.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The observed and surveyed unit is the establishment because it is the closest to the expense and better located unit. Since the observation year 2009, the survey is conducted by internet (a paper questionnaire can be sent on request). More than 80% of the surveyed establishments do respond.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The scope of the survey is the same every year.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La p&eacute;riode de collecte s'&eacute;tend de janvier &agrave;&nbsp;mai 2021.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For dissemination, in addition to publications, there are also data quality indicators.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te fait l'objet d'une proc&eacute;dure d'archivage interne des bases de donn&eacute;es.<br />Les fichiers individuels de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te sont mis &agrave; disposition des utilisateurs ext&eacute;rieurs &agrave; l&rsquo;Insee via le Centre d&rsquo;acc&egrave;s s&eacute;curis&eacute; des donn&eacute;es (CASD), apr&egrave;s passage au Comit&eacute; du secret.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon comprend environ 8 500 &eacute;tablissements.</p>"@fr , "<p>The sample includes approximately 8 500 establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.15.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.15.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.15.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "The interrogation unit is the establishment, identified by its SIRET number."@en , "L’unité d’interrogation est l’établissement, identifié par son numéro Siret."@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les contr&ocirc;les r&eacute;alis&eacute;s garantissant la qualit&eacute; des r&eacute;sultats statistiques sont les suivants&nbsp;:<br />- Contr&ocirc;les pendant la phase de collecte&nbsp;: contr&ocirc;les sur la coh&eacute;rence interne et la coh&eacute;rence temporelle sous forme d&rsquo;alerte au moment de la saisie&nbsp;;<br />- Relances pendant la phase de collecte&nbsp;: relances par courrier exhaustives sur les non-r&eacute;pondants, relances t&eacute;l&eacute;phoniques prioris&eacute;es sur les non-r&eacute;pondants de grande taille&nbsp;;<br />- Apurement&nbsp;pour assurer la coh&eacute;rence des r&eacute;ponses au sein de chaque questionnaire&nbsp;;<br />- Calcul d'indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A consultative committee met every year. It is composed, in addition to the two producer services, by experts and representatives of the public policies concerned with energy issues, representatives&nbsp; of professional organizations, employee unions and the energy sector.<br />The survey responds to the request of the International Energy Agency (IEA) for information on the subject of energy consumption and to Community Regulation 58/97 on structural business statistics which lays down additional obligations in this area.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/L> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2021A010EC"@fr , "2021A010EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.10.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quality sheet is described according to the European standard of the Single integrated metadata structure (SIMS).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Activit&eacute; (divisions de la nomenclature d&rsquo;activit&eacute; fran&ccedil;aise (NAF r&eacute;v.2)&nbsp;:<br />07-Extraction de minerais m&eacute;talliques<br />08-Autres industries extractives<br />09-Services de soutien aux industries extractives<br />10-Industries alimentaires<br />11-Fabrication de boissons<br />12-Fabrication de produits &agrave; base de tabac<br />13-Fabrication de textiles<br />14-Industrie de l'habillement<br />15-Industrie du cuir et de la chaussure<br />16-Travail du bois et fabrication d'articles en bois et en li&egrave;ge, &agrave; l'exception des meubles ; fabrication d'articles en vannerie et sparterie<br />17-Industrie du papier et du carton<br />18-Imprimerie et reproduction d'enregistrements<br />19-Cok&eacute;faction et raffinage<br />20-Industrie chimique<br />21-Industrie pharmaceutique<br />22-Fabrication de produits en caoutchouc et en plastique<br />23-Fabrication d'autres produits min&eacute;raux non m&eacute;talliques<br />24-M&eacute;tallurgie<br />25-Fabrication de produits m&eacute;talliques, &agrave; l'exception des machines et des &eacute;quipements<br />26-Fabrication de produits informatiques, &eacute;lectroniques et optiques<br />27-Fabrication d'&eacute;quipements &eacute;lectriques<br />28-Fabrication de machines et &eacute;quipements n.c.a.<br />29-Industrie automobile<br />30-Fabrication d'autres mat&eacute;riels de transport<br />31-Fabrication de meubles<br />32-Autres industries manufacturi&egrave;res<br />33-R&eacute;paration et installation de machines et d'&eacute;quipements<br />38-Collecte, traitement et &eacute;limination des d&eacute;chets ; r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration de mat&eacute;riaux<br />ENSEMBLE<br /><br />Tranche d'effectifs&nbsp; salari&eacute;s:<br />moins de 50 salari&eacute;s<br />de 50 &agrave; 99 salari&eacute;s<br />de 100 &agrave; 249 salari&eacute;s<br />de 250 &agrave; 499 salari&eacute;s<br />500 salari&eacute;s et plus<br />ENSEMBLE<br /><br />R&eacute;gion&nbsp;:<br />11-&Icirc;le-de-France<br />24-Centre-Val de Loire<br />27-Bourgogne-Franche-Comt&eacute;<br />28-Normandie<br />32-Hauts-de-France<br />44-Grand Est<br />52-Pays de la Loire<br />53-Bretagne<br />75-Nouvelle-Aquitaine<br />76-Occitanie<br />84-Auvergne-Rh&ocirc;ne-Alpes<br />93-Paca et Corse<br />97-D&eacute;partements d&rsquo;outre-mer<br />ENSEMBLE</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.6.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey responds to the European Regulation on structural business statistics (EC N&deg;251/2009) of 11 March 2009, requesting environmental protection expenditure broken down by environmental domain, activity and size of enterprise.&nbsp; <br /><br />The committees that have given Insee the right and legitimacy to collect its data are:<br />- The CNIS, which examines each new project, whether it is a survey, a directory or the exploitation of administrative files ... These projects are presented by all the institutions that contribute by their work to producing public statistics. The discussion focuses in particular on the purpose of the project, its place in the information system and the conditions anticipated for its dissemination. Each operation must be examined to ensure it is in the general interest and does not duplicate existing sources of information, in other words to ensure that it is suitable. It provides an opinion on suitability.<br />- The quality label committee, within the CNIS, ensures that it meets the criteria of statistical quality. The committee checks that the survey meets the statistical quality criteria in so far as concerns the collection and sampling method (survey design, data correction method, handling of non-responses guaranteeing the reliability of results..), relevance of the questions and adaptation of the distribution to the objectives announced. It also checks that the survey does not place an excessive burden on the respondents, that consultations have been held with the partners concerned and that any wishes expressed by the CNIS during the debate on suitability were taken into account. It gives a quality label of general interest and statistical quality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>Energy purchases or consumption are those corresponding to all invoices received in 2020.<br />The information concerning the certification of the establishment refers to its situation in 2020.<br />The other questions (presence of a heat pump, industrial production activity, activity on customer site) relate to the&nbsp; establishment&rsquo;s situation at the time of responding to the survey.</p>"@en , "<p>Les achats ou consommations d&rsquo;&eacute;nergie sont ceux correspondant &agrave; l&rsquo;ensemble des factures re&ccedil;ues en 2020.<br />Les informations concernant la certification de l'&eacute;tablissement se r&eacute;f&egrave;rent &agrave; sa situation en 2020.<br />Les autres questions (pr&eacute;sence d&rsquo;une pompe &agrave; chaleur, activit&eacute; industrielle de production, activit&eacute; sur site client) sont relatives &agrave; la situation de l'entreprise au moment de r&eacute;pondre &agrave; l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1973> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/S.7.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Loi n&deg; 51-711 du 7 juin 1951 sur l'obligation, la coordination et le secret en mati&egrave;re de statistiques. Disponible &agrave; l'adresse <a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a>.<br /><br />L'article 6 concerne le secret statistique&nbsp;: Sous r&eacute;serve des dispositions des articles 40,&nbsp; 56, 76,&nbsp; 97 et 99 du code de proc&eacute;dure p&eacute;nale et de celles de l'article L. 213-3 du code du patrimoine, les renseignements individuels figurant dans les questionnaires rev&ecirc;tus du visa pr&eacute;vu &agrave; l'article 2 de la pr&eacute;sente loi et ayant trait &agrave; la vie personnelle et familiale et, d'une mani&egrave;re g&eacute;n&eacute;rale, aux faits et comportements d'ordre priv&eacute; ne peuvent, sauf d&eacute;cision de l'administration des archives, prise apr&egrave;s avis du comit&eacute; du secret statistique et relative &agrave; une demande effectu&eacute;e &agrave; des fins de statistique publique ou de recherche scientifique ou historique, faire l'objet d'aucune communication de la part du service d&eacute;positaire avant l'expiration d'un d&eacute;lai de soixante-quinze ans suivant la date de r&eacute;alisation de l'enqu&ecirc;te ou d'un d&eacute;lai de vingt-cinq ans &agrave; compter de la date du d&eacute;c&egrave;s de l'int&eacute;ress&eacute;, si ce dernier d&eacute;lai est plus bref. <br />Il est institu&eacute; un comit&eacute; du secret statistique. Ce comit&eacute; est appel&eacute; &agrave; se prononcer sur toute question relative au secret en mati&egrave;re de statistiques. Il donne son avis sur les demandes de communication de donn&eacute;es individuelles collect&eacute;es en application de la pr&eacute;sente loi. Le comit&eacute; est pr&eacute;sid&eacute; par un conseiller d&rsquo;&Eacute;tat, d&eacute;sign&eacute; par le vice-pr&eacute;sident du Conseil d'&Eacute;tat. Il comprend notamment des repr&eacute;sentants de l'Assembl&eacute;e nationale et du S&eacute;nat. La composition et les modalit&eacute;s de fonctionnement du comit&eacute; sont fix&eacute;es par d&eacute;cret en Conseil d'&Eacute;tat. Les b&eacute;n&eacute;ficiaires des communications de donn&eacute;es r&eacute;sultant des d&eacute;cisions minist&eacute;rielles prises apr&egrave;s avis du comit&eacute; du secret statistique s'engagent &agrave; ne communiquer ces donn&eacute;es &agrave; quiconque. Toute infraction aux dispositions de cet alin&eacute;a est punie des peines pr&eacute;vues &agrave; l'article 226-13 du code p&eacute;nal.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1973/I.18.10>
