            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/enq_victimation_ecostat426.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1745> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te a lieu chaque ann&eacute;e de janvier &agrave; mars. Le mode de collecte utilis&eacute; est un questionnaire administr&eacute; par les enqu&ecirc;teurs&nbsp;de l'Insee sous un mode de collecte assist&eacute;e par ordinateur (Capi) et, pour les questions sensibles, selon un protocole adapt&eacute; permettant de garantir une compl&egrave;te confidentialit&eacute; des r&eacute;ponses de la personne enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;e.</p>\n<p>Des associations d'aide aux victimes ont apport&eacute; leur exp&eacute;rience quant &agrave; la formulation de ces questions sensibles et au protocole d'enqu&ecirc;te. Afin que des personnes d'origine &eacute;trang&egrave;re puissent r&eacute;pondre, les questions sont traduites en arabe, en portugais, en turc ou en allemand, les quatre langues les plus parl&eacute;es en France par les non-francophones.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'&eacute;chantillon est compos&eacute; de 22 800 logements&nbsp;(soit environ 15 500 m&eacute;nages r&eacute;pondants). Il comprend en 2016&nbsp;une extension sur les quartiers prioritaires. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Sont interrog&eacute;es les personnes de 14 ans ou plus au 1er janvier de l'ann&eacute;e d'enqu&ecirc;te (une seule personne par m&eacute;nage).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.11.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1745> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1745> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-04-07"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1745> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.11.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/137> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/H> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1745> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>So-called \"ordinary\" households, i.e. excluding households living in collective households (hostels, prisons, hospitals, etc.) and living in mobile accommodation (boatmen, the homeless, etc.)</p>\n<p>An individual aged 14 or over (on January 1 of the survey year) is selected from each household (Kish individual). In order to be able to respond to self-administrated questionnaire, the Kish individual must be 18 or over on the day of the survey and aged&nbsp;less than 75 on January 1 of the survey year.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1745/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/territoireFrancais/franceMetropolitaine> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1745> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1866> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Coût, construction"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/E> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/753>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Various indices for construction (old base)"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "en" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/MET_ID_2010_INDEX_DIVERS_CONSTRUCTION_ANCIENNE_BASE_GB.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Conceptually, the statistical unit observed on its costs is a branch or sub-branch of activity of French construction companies&nbsp;or construction related companies.</p>\n<p>See associated documents.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Conceptuellement, l'unit&eacute; observ&eacute;e sur ses co&ucirc;ts est une branche ou sous-branche d'activit&eacute; des entreprises fran&ccedil;aises de construction ou li&eacute;s &agrave; la construction.</p>\n<p>Voir tableau dans la rubrique \"Documents associ&eacute;s\".</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/I.18.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Different from one index to another (monthly, quarterly, annually rhythm)</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.10.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.10.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les index divers de la construction sont diffus&eacute;s au cours du troisi&egrave;me mois suivant le mois sous revue, sur le site l&rsquo;Insee,&nbsp;dans l&rsquo;onglet &laquo;&nbsp;Base des s&eacute;ries et indices chronologiques&nbsp;&raquo;, rubrique &laquo;&nbsp;Aide &agrave; la navigation&nbsp;&raquo;, sous-rubrique &laquo;&nbsp;Construction&nbsp;&raquo;, sous-sous rubrique &laquo;&nbsp;Index b&acirc;timent, travaux publics et divers de la construction&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>\n<p>Ils sont aussi publi&eacute;s au Journal Officiel.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/I.18.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/I.18.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les autres indices et index sont des indices de co&ucirc;ts des diff&eacute;rentes activit&eacute;s du secteur de la construction et de l'am&eacute;nagement paysager, appr&eacute;hend&eacute;s &agrave; partir de 6 postes dans une d&eacute;marche de comptabilit&eacute; analytique : &laquo;&nbsp;co&ucirc;t du travail&nbsp;&raquo; jadis appel&eacute; &laquo;&nbsp;salaires et charges&nbsp;&raquo;, &laquo;&nbsp;mat&eacute;riaux&nbsp;&raquo;, &laquo;&nbsp;mat&eacute;riel&nbsp;&raquo;, &laquo;&nbsp;&eacute;nergie&nbsp;&raquo;, &laquo;&nbsp;transport&nbsp;&raquo;, &laquo;&nbsp;frais divers&nbsp;&raquo;, analogue &agrave; l'approche &laquo;&nbsp;KLEMST&nbsp;&raquo; des &eacute;conomistes de la productivit&eacute; (K&nbsp;=&nbsp;capital pour &laquo;&nbsp;mat&eacute;riel&nbsp;&raquo;, L&nbsp;=&nbsp;labour pour &laquo;&nbsp;travail&nbsp;&raquo;, E&nbsp;=&nbsp;energy pour &laquo;&nbsp;&eacute;nergie&nbsp;&raquo;, M&nbsp;=&nbsp;materials pour &laquo;&nbsp;mat&eacute;riaux&nbsp;&raquo;, S&nbsp;=&nbsp;services pour &laquo;&nbsp;frais divers&nbsp;&raquo;, T&nbsp;=&nbsp;transport pour &laquo;&nbsp;transport&nbsp;&raquo;).<br />Les postes sont calcul&eacute;s selon une technique d'agr&eacute;gation-cha&icirc;nage de Lowe : le niveau d'indice du poste du mois pr&eacute;c&eacute;dent est multipli&eacute; par la moyenne pond&eacute;r&eacute;e des &eacute;volutions de prix des indices &eacute;l&eacute;mentaires composant le poste.<br />(Voir aussi&nbsp; la note m&eacute;thodologique pour une description plus compl&egrave;te)</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/750> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/748> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Various indices for Construction are released during the third month following the month under review, on the Website Insee in the topic \"Search for indices and time series\" under \"Indices an time series browsing help\", under \"Construction\", under \"Building, civil engineering and various indices for construction\".</p>\n<p>They are also published in the Journal Officiel.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/748>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Note méthodologique Correspondance entre anciens et nouveaux index divers de la construction"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2017-10-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Correspondance_anciens_nouveaux_index_divers.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The other indices are cost indices of the various activities in the construction and landscape architecture sectors listed under 6 items according to an approach towards analytical accounting: &ldquo;cost of labour&rdquo; now called &ldquo;wages and charges&rdquo;, &ldquo;materials&rdquo;, &ldquo;equipment&rdquo;, &ldquo;energy&rdquo;, &ldquo;transport&rdquo;, &ldquo;miscellaneous costs&rdquo;, similar to the &ldquo;KLEMST&rdquo; approach used by productivity economists (K = capital for &ldquo;equipment&rdquo;, L = labour for &ldquo;labour&rdquo;, E = energy for &ldquo;energy&rdquo;, M = materials for &ldquo;materials&rdquo;, S = services for &ldquo;miscellaneous costs&rdquo;, T = transport for &ldquo;transport&rdquo;).<br /><br />The items are calculated according to a Lowe's aggregation-chaining technique. The index level of the item in the previous month is multiplied by the weighted mean of the variations in prices of the basic indices composing&nbsp; the item.<br /><br />(For further details, see also methodological note)</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/753> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Costs, construction"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/750>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Note méthodologique Index divers de la construction (ancienne base)"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2017-10-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/MET_ID_2010_INDEX_DIVERS_CONSTRUCTION_ANCIENNE_BASE_FR.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Various indices for Previous Construction Bases (stopped)"@en , "Rapport qualité : Index divers (base antérieure à 2010 - arrêtée)"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/produits/indicateur/p1663> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.19/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.19/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1866> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Variable selon les index (mensuelle, trimestrielle ou annuelle)</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les index divers de la construction ne donnent pas lieu &agrave; une enqu&ecirc;te nouvelle, mais utilisent des statistiques publiques existantes pour constituer les indices &eacute;l&eacute;mentaires.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1866/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The various indices for Construction do not give rise to a new survey, but use existing public statistics, which provide the elementary indices.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1975> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2021X044EC"@fr , "2021X044EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.6.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Au niveau national , les comit&eacute;s qui ont donn&eacute; &agrave; l'Insee le droit et la l&eacute;gitimit&eacute; pour collecter ces donn&eacute;es sont&nbsp;:<br /><br />- le Cnis qui examine chaque nouveau projet, qu&rsquo;il s&rsquo;agisse d&rsquo;une enqu&ecirc;te, d&rsquo;un r&eacute;pertoire ou d&rsquo;une exploitation de fichiers administratifs&hellip; Ces projets sont pr&eacute;sent&eacute;s par toutes les institutions qui contribuent par leurs travaux &agrave; la construction de la statistique publique. La discussion porte notamment sur la finalit&eacute; du projet, sa place dans le syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;information et les conditions pr&eacute;vues de sa diffusion. Il convient de v&eacute;rifier que chaque op&eacute;ration r&eacute;pond &agrave; un besoin d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et ne fait pas double emploi avec les sources d&rsquo;information existantes, en d&rsquo;autres termes de s&rsquo;assurer de son opportunit&eacute;. Il donne un avis d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute;.<br />- le comit&eacute; du label, au sein du Cnis, veille &agrave; ce qu&rsquo;il respecte les crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique. Celui-ci s&rsquo;assure que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te r&eacute;pond aux crit&egrave;res de qualit&eacute; statistique en ce qui concerne la m&eacute;thode de collecte et d&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage (plan de sondage, m&eacute;thode de redressement des donn&eacute;es, traitement des non-r&eacute;ponses garantissant la fiabilit&eacute; des r&eacute;sultats...), de pertinence du questionnement et d&rsquo;adaptation de la diffusion aux objectifs annonc&eacute;s. Il s&rsquo;assure &eacute;galement que l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te n&rsquo;entra&icirc;ne pas de charge excessive sur les enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s, qu&rsquo;une concertation a &eacute;t&eacute; men&eacute;e avec les partenaires concern&eacute;s et que les souhaits exprim&eacute;s par le Cnis lors du d&eacute;bat d&rsquo;opportunit&eacute; ont bien &eacute;t&eacute; pris en compte. Il donne un label d&rsquo;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t g&eacute;n&eacute;ral et de qualit&eacute; statistique.<br /><br />Au niveau europ&eacute;en&nbsp;, l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te CIS r&eacute;pond au r&egrave;glement europ&eacute;en n&deg; 995/2012 du 26 octobre 2012 relatif aux statistiques communautaires de la science&nbsp;et de la technologie.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.6.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>At the national level, the committees that gave INSEE the right and legitimacy to collect this data are:<br /><br />- the CNIS, which examines each new project, whether it is a survey, a directory or an exploitation of administrative files... These projects are presented by all the institutions that contribute through their work to the construction of official statistics. The discussion focuses in particular on the purpose of the project, its place in the information system and the planned conditions for its dissemination. It should be verified that each operation meets a need of general interest and does not duplicate existing sources of information, in other words, to ensure that it is appropriate. He gives a notice of opportunity.<br />- the Label Committee within the CNIS ensures that it meets the statistical quality criteria. The latter ensures that the survey meets statistical quality criteria with regard to the collection and sampling method (sampling design, data adjustment method, treatment of non-responses guaranteeing the reliability of the results, etc.), the relevance of the questioning and the adaptation of the dissemination to the stated objectives. It also ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on the respondents, that consultation has been carried out with the partners concerned and that the wishes expressed by the CNIS during the opportunity debate have been taken into account. It gives a label of general interest and statistical quality.<br /><br />At the European level, CIS survey is coordinated in accordance with the Regulation No 995/2012 in force on Community statistics on science and technology.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex</p>"@en , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier 92541 Montrouge</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te fait l'objet d'une proc&eacute;dure d'archivage des bases de donn&eacute;es sous GEN. <br />Les fichiers individuels sont mis &agrave; disposition des utilisateurs ext&eacute;rieurs &agrave; l&rsquo;Insee via le CASD, apr&egrave;s passage au Comit&eacute; du secret.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.12.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Un comit&eacute; de concertation, compos&eacute; des experts et repr&eacute;sentants des politiques publiques concern&eacute;es par les questions de l&rsquo;innovation, ainsi que des repr&eacute;sentants d&rsquo;organisations professionnelles, ou de syndicats de salari&eacute;s s'est r&eacute;uni pour participer &agrave; la conception du questionnaire.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is the subject of a procedure for archiving databases under GEN.&nbsp; <br />The individual files are made available to users outside INSEE via the CASD, after passing through the Secrecy Committee.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different steps of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production: <br />- stratified sample selection <br />- reminders and checks of data being collected by collectors<br />- clearance <br />- adjustment of total non-response <br />- shimming <br />- adjustment for partial non-response <br />- winsorisation.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The main topics covered in the 2020 CIS survey are as follows: <br />- strategy <br />- co-creation (active participation of the user in the development of a product) and customization (adaptation of a product at the request of users); <br />- intellectual property rights (patent filing, design registration etc.) <br />- presence of innovation by type of innovation (products, processes) <br />- turnover share from product or service innovations introduced between 2018 and 2020&nbsp; <br />- expenditure associated with product and process innovation activities <br />- public funding (European and national) <br />- forms of cooperation for the development of innovations <br />- factors hampering innovation over the 2018-2020 period&nbsp;;<br />- presence of innovations with environmental benefits.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique&nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon&nbsp;;<br />- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte&nbsp;par les gestionnaires ; <br />- apurement&nbsp;; <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale&nbsp;; <br />- calage&nbsp;; <br />- redressement de la non r&eacute;ponse partielle&nbsp;; <br />- winsorisation (contr&ocirc;le de l&rsquo;influence des unit&eacute;s atypiques).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s dans l'enqu&ecirc;te CIS 2020 sont les suivants : <br />- la strat&eacute;gie&nbsp;; <br />- la co-cr&eacute;ation (participation active de l&rsquo;utilisateur dans le d&eacute;veloppement d&rsquo;un produit) et personnalisation&nbsp;(adaptation d&rsquo;un produit sur demande des utilisateurs); <br />- les droits de propri&eacute;t&eacute; intellectuelle (d&eacute;p&ocirc;t de brevet, enregistrement de mod&egrave;le etc.)&nbsp;; <br />- la pr&eacute;sence de l'innovation par type d'innovation (produits, proc&eacute;d&eacute;s)&nbsp;;&nbsp; <br />- la part en chiffre d'affaires des innovations de produits introduites entre 2018 et 2020; <br />- les d&eacute;penses li&eacute;es aux activit&eacute;s d'innovation ; <br />- l&rsquo;existence de financements publics (nationaux, europ&eacute;ens)&nbsp;; <br />- les formes de coop&eacute;ration pour le d&eacute;veloppement des innovations&nbsp;;&nbsp; <br />- les facteurs expliquant l&rsquo;absence d&rsquo;innovation sur la p&eacute;riode 2018-2020&nbsp;;<br />- la pr&eacute;sence d&rsquo;innovations apportant des b&eacute;n&eacute;fices environnementaux.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Data collection is carried out via the Internet and possibly by post (at the request of the company).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.12.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.12.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.12.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.12.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La fronti&egrave;re entre les innovations technologiques et non technologiques est de plus en plus tenue. D&egrave;s lors, la 4&egrave;me &eacute;dition du manuel d&rsquo;Oslo (octobre 2018) ne retient plus que les deux types d&rsquo;innovation&nbsp;suivants :<br /><br />- l&rsquo;innovation de produits&nbsp;: il s&rsquo;agit de&nbsp; l&rsquo;introduction sur le march&eacute; d&rsquo;un bien ou d&rsquo;un service nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute; par rapport aux produits pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment &eacute;labor&eacute;s par l&rsquo;entreprise. Elle inclut&nbsp; les changements significatifs de design et les biens ou services num&eacute;riques. Elle exclut la revente en l&rsquo;&eacute;tat de nouveaux biens ou services et les changements de nature esth&eacute;tique.<br /><br />- l&rsquo;innovation de proc&eacute;d&eacute;s&nbsp;: il s&rsquo;agit de la mise en &oelig;uvre dans l&rsquo;entreprise d&rsquo;un proc&eacute;d&eacute; nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute; par rapport aux proc&eacute;d&eacute;s pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment employ&eacute;s par l&rsquo;entreprise. Elle concerne la production et les m&eacute;thodes de d&eacute;veloppement, la logistique et la distribution, le syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;information et de communication, les t&acirc;ches administratives et la comptabilit&eacute;, l&rsquo;organisation des proc&eacute;dures, la gestion des relations avec les fournisseurs, l&rsquo;organisation du travail, les processus de d&eacute;cision, les ressources humaines, le marketing, l&rsquo;emballage, la tarification et le service apr&egrave;s-vente.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br /><br />Dans la 3&egrave;me &eacute;dition du manuel d&rsquo;Oslo, donc pour les enqu&ecirc;tes CIS de 2008 &agrave; 2016, 4 types d&rsquo;innovation &eacute;taient distingu&eacute;s&nbsp;:<br /><br />- les innovations de produits&nbsp;, soit l&rsquo;introduction sur le march&eacute; d&rsquo;un bien ou service nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute; par rapport aux produits pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment &eacute;labor&eacute;s par l&rsquo;entreprise au regard de ses caract&eacute;ristiques essentielles, de sa convivialit&eacute; (facilit&eacute; d&rsquo;usage), ses composants (ou son utilisation) et des &eacute;l&eacute;ments int&eacute;gr&eacute;s ;<br /><br />- les innovation de proc&eacute;d&eacute;s, soit la mise en &oelig;uvre d&rsquo;un proc&eacute;d&eacute; de production, d&rsquo;une m&eacute;thode de distribution ou d&rsquo;une activit&eacute; de soutien ou support nouveau ou significativement am&eacute;lior&eacute;. Les innovations n&rsquo;ayant trait qu&rsquo;&agrave; l&rsquo;organisation ou au marketing &eacute;taient exclues&nbsp;;<br /><br />- l&rsquo;innovation d&rsquo;organisation&nbsp;: il s&rsquo;agit d&rsquo;un nouveau mode de fonctionnement de l&rsquo;entreprise (y compris la gestion des connaissances), une nouvelle m&eacute;thode d&rsquo;organisation du travail ou de ses relations externes qui n&rsquo;&eacute;taient pas utilis&eacute;s pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment dans l&rsquo;entreprise&nbsp;;<br /><br />- l&rsquo;innovation de marketing&nbsp;: elle correspond &agrave; la mise en &oelig;uvre de concepts nouveaux ou de strat&eacute;gies de vente nouvelles qui diff&egrave;rent significativement des m&eacute;thodes de vente existant dans l&rsquo;entreprise et qui n&rsquo;avaient pas &eacute;t&eacute; utilis&eacute;s auparavant. Elle inclut les changements dans le design, l&rsquo;emballage ou la pr&eacute;sentation d&rsquo;un bien ou d&rsquo;une prestation de services, son positionnement, sa promotion ou son prix s&rsquo;ils ont un impact significatif.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.11.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.11.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.11.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>For Internet collection, the collection site is completely secure and the standards for managing survey access codes are strict. For companies that choose to use paper, the data entry is carried out by the managers, with strict respect for the confidentiality of the data collected.<br />Before the data is released, confidentiality is applied. For company data: no results are published for less than three companies or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be disclosed if no company or establishment contributes more than 85% of that result. Primary deletions correspond to boxes that do not meet the above criteria. Secondary secrecy removes other boxes so that the data cannot be retrieved by subtraction with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different steps of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production: <br />- tests carried out prior to collection<br />- stratified sample selection <br />- reminders and checks of data being collected by collectors<br />- clearance <br />- adjustment of total non-response <br />- shimming <br />- adjustment for partial non-response <br />- winsorisation.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.1.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.4>
                    "<p>Chef de la division ETET</p>"@fr , "<p>Head of the ETET Division</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sample is drawn from a sampling frame constructed from the Sirus inventory using a simple random sampling design stratified by activity, workforce segment and region where possible. The calculation of the allocations combines a Neyman allocation on the rate of innovative enterprises and a proportional allocation on the number of innovative enterprises, which makes it possible on the one hand to be precise on the central variable of the survey (the innovation rate) and also to query a reasonable number of innovative enterprises in order to ensure satisfactory accuracy for questions concerning only these enterprises.<br /><br />As the interrogation unit is modified, an over-sample of legal units is also drawn. These belong to the profiled firms drawn in the main sample. The objective is to compare their answers to the mandatory questions in the Eurostat questionnaire with those given at enterprise level, and to use them if necessary to modify or complete the answer given at enterprise level.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951 on the obligation, coordination and secrecy of statistics. Available at <a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a>.<br /><br />Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L. 213-3 of the Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires bearing the visa provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to personal and family life and, in general, to private facts and conduct may not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after consulting the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality and in respect of a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, not to be communicated by the depositary service before the expiry of 75 years from the date of the survey or 25 years from the date of the person's death, whichever is the shorter.<br />A Committee on Statistical Confidentiality is hereby established. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to statistical confidentiality. It shall give its opinion on requests for the disclosure of individual data collected pursuant to this Law. The committee is chaired by a Councillor of State, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes representatives of the National Assembly and the Senate. The composition and operating procedures of the committee are determined by decree of the Conseil d'Etat. Beneficiaries of data communications resulting from ministerial decisions taken after consulting the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality undertake not to communicate such data to anyone. Any infringement of the provisions of this paragraph shall be punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Criminal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The companies belong to NACE Rev.2 divisions 05 to 81 (except for 75: Veterinarians). Legal category 7353 (Syndicat intercommunal &agrave; vocation unique (SIVU)) is excluded.<br /><br />Within Section K of NAF rev2 (divisions 64, 65 and 66), the scope of mutuals was limited since CIS 2010.&nbsp; Since the 2018 CIS, only the local units of certain banks, i.e. legal categories 5195 and 6595, are excluded.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different vintages of the CIS surveys can be compared up to and including the 2016 CIS, modulo possible changes in question wording. The evolution of adjustment methods may affect certain developments at the margin.&nbsp; <br /><br />However, a break in the series is to be noted from the 2018 CIS onwards. Indeed, following the 4th edition of the Oslo manual, only two types of innovation are now defined from the 2018 CIS (products or processes including organization and marketing), compared to four for the 2016 CIS (products, processes, organization, marketing). Moreover, some questions previously asked only to innovative companies are now asked to all companies. It is therefore necessary to be vigilant on the comparison between the 2020 CIS or the 2018 CIS and previous surveys. <br /><br />In addition, for the 2020 CIS, the interrogation unit is the enterprise (independant or profiled), rather than the legal unit, and certain questions are only asked to companies with 50 or more employees that are not part of the accommodation and catering sector (section I of NACE rev.2).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>In addition to publications, data quality indicators are also disseminated.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rents mill&eacute;simes des enqu&ecirc;tes CIS peuvent &ecirc;tre compar&eacute;s jusqu&rsquo;&agrave; CIS 2016 inclue, modulo les changements &eacute;ventuels de formulation des questions. L'&eacute;volution des m&eacute;thodes de redressement peuvent affecter &agrave; la marge certaines &eacute;volutions.<br /><br />Cependant, une rupture de s&eacute;rie est &agrave; noter &agrave; partir de CIS 2018. En effet, suite &agrave; la 4&egrave;me &eacute;dition du manuel d&rsquo;Oslo, seuls deux types d&rsquo;innovation sont d&eacute;sormais d&eacute;finis depuis CIS 2018 (produits ou proc&eacute;d&eacute;s y compris organisation et marketing), contre quatre pour CIS 2016 (produits, proc&eacute;d&eacute;s, organisation, marketing). Certaines questions, pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment pos&eacute;es aux seules entreprises innovantes sont d&eacute;sormais pos&eacute;es &agrave; toutes les entreprises. Il faut donc &ecirc;tre vigilant sur la comparaison entre CIS 2020 ou CIS 2018 et les enqu&ecirc;tes pr&eacute;c&eacute;dentes. <br /><br />Par ailleurs, pour CIS 2020, l&rsquo;unit&eacute; d&rsquo;interrogation est l&rsquo;entreprise (ind&eacute;pendant ou profil&eacute;e), et non plus l&rsquo;unit&eacute; l&eacute;gale, et certaines questions ne sont pos&eacute;es qu&rsquo;aux entreprises de 50 salari&eacute;s ou plus ne faisant pas partie du secteur de l&rsquo;h&eacute;bergement-restauration.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The main areas of dissemination are the activity sector of the company described according to the Statistical Classification of Economic Activities in the European Community (NACE Rev. 2) and the size of the enterprise.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Premi&egrave;re &ndash; Insee.fr<br />Insee R&eacute;sultats &ndash; Insee.fr <br />&nbsp; <br />Eurostat Statistics explained <br /><a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Main_Page\">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Main_Page</a><br />European Innovation Scoreboard <br /><a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/docsroom/documents/41875\">https://ec.europa.eu/docsroom/documents/41875</a></p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@fr , "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour la diffusion,&nbsp;en plus des publications, il y a &eacute;galement&nbsp;des indicateurs de qualit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.18.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.18.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.18.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête capacité à innover et stratégie 2020"@fr , "Quality report: Community Innovation Survey 2020"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1558> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A consultation committee, made up of experts and representatives of public policies concerned with innovation issues, as well as representatives of professional organizations and employee unions, met to help design the questionnaire.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>2018 to 2020 depending on the questions</p>"@en , "<p>2018 &agrave; 2020 selon les questions</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The boundary between technological and non-technological innovations is increasingly being held. As a result, the 4th edition of the Oslo Manual (October 2018) now includes only the following two types of innovation:<br /><br />- product innovation: the introduction on the market of a new or significantly improved good or service compared to the products previously developed by the company. It includes significant design changes and digital goods or services, and excludes the resale in the same condition as new goods or services and changes of an aesthetic nature.<br /><br />- process innovation: the implementation in the company of a new or significantly improved process compared to the processes previously used by the company. It concerns production and development methods, logistics and distribution, information and communication system, administrative tasks and accounting, organisation of procedures, management of relations with suppliers, work organisation, decision-making processes, human resources, marketing, packaging, pricing and after-sales service.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br /><br />In the 3rd edition of the Oslo Manual, i. e. for CIS surveys from 2008 to 2016, 4 types of innovation were distinguished:<br /><br />- product innovations, i.e. the introduction on the market of a new or significantly improved good or service compared to the products previously developed by the company in terms of its essential characteristics, its user-friendliness (ease of use), its components (or its use) and the integrated elements;<br /><br />- process innovation, i.e. the implementation of a new or significantly improved production process, distribution method or support activity or support. Innovations related only to organization or marketing were excluded;<br /><br />- organisational innovation: a new way of operating the company (including knowledge management), a new way of organising work or its external relations that was not previously used in the company;<br /><br />- marketing innovation: this refers to the implementation of new concepts or new sales strategies that differ significantly from existing sales methods in the company and that have not been used before. It includes changes in the design, packaging or presentation of a good or service, its positioning, promotion or price if they have a significant impact.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux domaines de diffusion sont le secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute; de l&rsquo;entreprise d&eacute;crite selon la Nomenclature statistique des activit&eacute;s &eacute;conomiques dans la Communaut&eacute; europ&eacute;enne (NACE r&eacute;v.2)&nbsp; et la taille de l&rsquo;entreprise.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.5/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.10.5/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1975> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.11.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique&nbsp;: <br />- tests r&eacute;alis&eacute;s en amont de la collecte&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon <br />- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte <br />- apurement <br />- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale <br />- calage <br />- redressement de la non r&eacute;ponse partielle <br />- winsorisation.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.7.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Loi n&deg; 51-711 du 7 juin 1951 sur l'obligation, la coordination et le secret en mati&egrave;re de statistiques. Disponible &agrave; l'adresse <a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a>. <br /><br />L'article 6 concerne le secret statistique. Sous r&eacute;serve des dispositions des articles 40,&nbsp; 56, 76,&nbsp; 97 et 99 du code de proc&eacute;dure p&eacute;nale et de celles de l'article L. 213-3 du code du patrimoine, les renseignements individuels figurant dans les questionnaires rev&ecirc;tus du visa pr&eacute;vu &agrave; l'article 2 de la pr&eacute;sente loi et ayant trait &agrave; la vie personnelle et familiale et, d'une mani&egrave;re g&eacute;n&eacute;rale, aux faits et comportements d'ordre priv&eacute; ne peuvent, sauf d&eacute;cision de l'administration des archives, prise apr&egrave;s avis du comit&eacute; du secret statistique et relative &agrave; une demande effectu&eacute;e &agrave; des fins de statistique publique ou de recherche scientifique ou historique, faire l'objet d'aucune communication de la part du service d&eacute;positaire avant l'expiration d'un d&eacute;lai de soixante-quinze ans suivant la date de r&eacute;alisation de l'enqu&ecirc;te ou d'un d&eacute;lai de vingt-cinq ans &agrave; compter de la date du d&eacute;c&egrave;s de l'int&eacute;ress&eacute;, si ce dernier d&eacute;lai est plus bref. <br />Il est institu&eacute; un comit&eacute; du secret statistique. Ce comit&eacute; est appel&eacute; &agrave; se prononcer sur toute question relative au secret en mati&egrave;re de statistiques. Il donne son avis sur les demandes de communication de donn&eacute;es individuelles collect&eacute;es en application de la pr&eacute;sente loi. Le comit&eacute; est pr&eacute;sid&eacute; par un conseiller d'Etat, d&eacute;sign&eacute; par le vice-pr&eacute;sident du Conseil d'Etat. Il comprend notamment des repr&eacute;sentants de l'Assembl&eacute;e nationale et du S&eacute;nat. La composition et les modalit&eacute;s de fonctionnement du comit&eacute; sont fix&eacute;es par d&eacute;cret en Conseil d'Etat. Les b&eacute;n&eacute;ficiaires des communications de donn&eacute;es r&eacute;sultant des d&eacute;cisions minist&eacute;rielles prises apr&egrave;s avis du comit&eacute; du secret statistique s'engagent &agrave; ne communiquer ces donn&eacute;es &agrave; quiconque. Toute infraction aux dispositions de cet alin&eacute;a est punie des peines pr&eacute;vues &agrave; l'article 226-13 du code p&eacute;nal.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'&eacute;chantillon en entreprise est tir&eacute; dans une base de sondage construite &agrave; partir du r&eacute;pertoire Sirus selon un plan de sondage al&eacute;atoire simple stratifi&eacute; selon l&rsquo;activit&eacute;, la tranche d&rsquo;effectifs, ainsi que la r&eacute;gion, l&rsquo;appartenance &agrave; un groupe et la nationalit&eacute; lorsque cela &eacute;tait possible. Le calcul des allocations combine une allocation de Neyman sur le taux d&rsquo;entreprises innovantes et une allocation proportionnelle sur le nombre d&rsquo;entreprises innovantes, ce qui permet d&rsquo;une part d&rsquo;&ecirc;tre pr&eacute;cis sur la variable centrale de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te (le taux d&rsquo;innovation) et &eacute;galement d&rsquo;interroger un nombre raisonnable d&rsquo;entreprises innovantes afin d&rsquo;assurer une pr&eacute;cision satisfaisante pour les questions ne concernant que ces entreprises.<br /><br />Suite au changement d&rsquo;unit&eacute; d&rsquo;interrogation, un sur-&eacute;chantillon d&rsquo;unit&eacute;s l&eacute;gales est tir&eacute;. Ces derni&egrave;res appartiennent aux entreprises profil&eacute;es tir&eacute;es dans l&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon principal. L&rsquo;objectif est de comparer leurs r&eacute;ponses aux questions obligatoires du questionnaire Eurostat avec celles donn&eacute;es par la t&ecirc;te de groupe, et de les utiliser si besoin pour modifier ou compl&eacute;ter la r&eacute;ponse donn&eacute;e au niveau de l&rsquo;entreprise.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.6.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.6.1>
