    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1720/I.18.12/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>As the scope of the survey in terms of sector is very wide (see &sect; on sector coverage), there are different models of questionnaires, adapted to the different main sectors covered by the survey.</p>"@en ;
