    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier DUSSUD</p>"@fr , "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier DUSSUD</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1964> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.15.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.15.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1964> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1964> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Law n&deg; 51-711 of 7 June 1951 on obligations, co-ordination and confidentiality in respect of statistics. Available from https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573.</p>\n<p>Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L. 213-3 of the French Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires endorsed as provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to private and family life and, in general, to private acts and conduct can not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after examining the opinion of the Statistical Confidentiality Committee and relating to a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, be the subject of any communication by the depositary service before the expiry of a period of seventy-five years following the date of completion of the survey or a period of twenty-five years from the death of the person concerned, whichever is the shorter.</p>\n<p>A Statistical Confidentiality Committee is set up. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to the confidentiality of statistics. It expresses its opinion on requests for the communication of individual data collected pursuant to this law. The committee is chaired by a State Councillor, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes in particular representatives of the French National Assembly and Senate. The composition and operating methods of the committee are set by decree of the Council of State. Recipients of the data communications resulting from Ministerial decisions made after consulting the Statistical Confidentiality Committee agree to not communicate these data to anyone. Any violation of the provisions of this paragraph is punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Penal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>Ann&eacute;e 2019</p>"@fr , "<p>Year 2019</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1964> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/293>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Méthodologie de l'enquête annuelle sur les investissements protégeant l'environnement (dite Antipol)"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2016-08-18"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/MET_ANTIPOL_FR_2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.3.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.3.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1964> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.11.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les diff&eacute;rentes &eacute;tapes de l'enqu&ecirc;te garantissent que le processus r&eacute;pond aux exigences en mati&egrave;re de production statistique :&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- tirage stratifi&eacute; de l'&eacute;chantillon&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- relances et contr&ocirc;les des donn&eacute;es en cours de collecte&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- apurement&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- redressement de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- calage&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- redressement de la non r&eacute;ponse partielle&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- winsorisation (contr&ocirc;le de l'influence des unit&eacute;s atypiques)</p>\n<p>- le questionnaire a &eacute;t&eacute; test&eacute; (au 4e trimestre 2012) dans le cadre du passage de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te devant le comit&eacute; du label d&eacute;but 2013.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The activity of the establishment is described according to the divisions of the French activity nomenclature&nbsp; (NAF rev.2 divisions-(detailed at group level for LPNs)).</p>\n<p>05 to 09.19-Extraction Coking and refining</p>\n<p>101-Processing and preserving of meat and preparation of meat products</p>\n<p>102-Processing and preserving of fish, crustaceans and molluscs</p>\n<p>103-Processing and preserving of fruit and vegetables</p>\n<p>104-Manufacture of vegetable and animal oils and fats</p>\n<p>105-Manufacture of dairy products</p>\n<p>106-Grain processing; manufacture of starch products</p>\n<p>107-Manufacture of bakery and pasta products</p>\n<p>108-Manufacture of other food products</p>\n<p>109-Manufacture of animal feed</p>\n<p>110-Manufacture of beverages</p>\n<p>120-Manufacture of tobacco products</p>\n<p>13-Manufacture of textiles</p>\n<p>14-Clothing industry</p>\n<p>15-Leather and Footwear Industry</p>\n<p>16-Woodworking and manufacture of articles of wood and cork, except furniture; manufacture of articles of straw and plaiting materials</p>\n<p>17-Paper and paperboard industry</p>\n<p>18-Printing and reproduction of recordings</p>\n<p>20-Chemical industry</p>\n<p>21-Pharmaceutical industry</p>\n<p>22-Manufacture of rubber and plastic products</p>\n<p>23-Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products</p>\n<p>24-Metallurgy</p>\n<p>25-Manufacture of metal products, except machinery and equipment</p>\n<p>26-Manufacturing of computer, electronic and optical products</p>\n<p>27-Manufacture of electrical equipment</p>\n<p>28-Manufacture of machinery and equipment n c a</p>\n<p>29-Automotive industry</p>\n<p>30-Manufacture of other transport equipment</p>\n<p>31-Furniture manufacturing</p>\n<p>32-Other manufacturing industries</p>\n<p>33-Repair and installation of machinery and equipment</p>\n<p>35-Production and distribution of electricity, gas, steam and air conditioning</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Number of employees</p>\n<p>20 to 49 employees</p>\n<p>50 to 99 employees</p>\n<p>100 to 249 employees</p>\n<p>250 to 499 employees</p>\n<p>500 to 999 employees</p>\n<p>1000 employees or more</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Regions</p>\n<p>&Icirc;le-de-France</p>\n<p>Centre-Val de Loire</p>\n<p>Bourgogne-Franche-Comt&eacute;</p>\n<p>Normandie</p>\n<p>Hauts-de-France</p>\n<p>Grand Est</p>\n<p>Pays de la Loire</p>\n<p>Bretagne</p>\n<p>Nouvelle-Aquitaine</p>\n<p>Occitanie</p>\n<p>Auvergne-Rh&ocirc;ne-Alpes</p>\n<p>Provence-Alpes-C&ocirc;te d&rsquo;Azur</p>\n<p>Corse</p>\n<p>Overseas regions</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.7.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.7.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/S.7.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1964> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1964/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/L> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1964> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1504> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Déclaration mensuelle des mouvements de main-d'œuvre"@fr , "Quality report: Monthly workforce movement report"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/serie/s1165> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/590> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Rotation de la main-d'&oelig;uvre selon l'activit&eacute; et la taille des &eacute;tablissements.<br /><br />Caract&eacute;ristiques des salari&eacute;s (sexe, &acirc;ge, profession) entrant et sortant des &eacute;tablissements, nature des contrats sign&eacute;s, motif de leur r&eacute;siliation.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/591>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Formulaire de la déclaration mensuelle des mouvements de main-d'œuvre / DMMO"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2005-11-07"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Formulaire_DMMO.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Establishments with at least 50 employees from the private and semi-market public sectors are required to complete an administrative form every year.<br /><br />This declaration concerns the number of employed people at the beginning and the end of the month, broken down according to type.<br /><br />Information is required on every movement in or out in the course of the month: on the individuals (gender, age, etc.), their professional characteristics and characteristics associated with the move (profession according to PCS classification from 1989, nature of entry into the establishment, reason why the employee concerned left, and also the date of this movement).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/590>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "La méthodologie des déclarations mensuelles des mouvements de main d'œuvre / DMMO"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2007-11-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Methodologie_DMMO.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les &eacute;tablissements d'au moins 50 salari&eacute;s des secteurs priv&eacute;s et public semi-concurrentiel sont tenus de remplir mensuellement un formulaire administratif.<br /><br />La d&eacute;claration porte sur le nombre de personnes salari&eacute;es en d&eacute;but et fin de mois, avec une distinction par genre.<br /><br />Pour chaque mouvement d'entr&eacute;e ou de sortie au cours du mois, des informations sont demand&eacute;es : sur les personnes (sexe, &acirc;ge, etc.), leurs caract&eacute;ristiques professionnelles et celles li&eacute;es au mouvement (profession selon la nomenclature PCS &agrave; partir de 1989, nature de l'entr&eacute;e dans l'&eacute;tablissement, motif de sortie du salari&eacute; concern&eacute;, et &eacute;galement date du mouvement).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/591> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Workforce turnover according to activity and size of establishments.</p>\n<p>Characteristics of employees (gender, age, profession) entering and leaving establishments, nature of contracts signed, reason for termination of contract.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1504/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-05-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1504> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1625> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1625> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.11.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/375> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The half-yearly survey of the cash flow situation in industry aims to transcribe the opinion of entrepreneurs on their cash flow and factors explaining changes in that situation, such as: operating profits, prices, sales volumes, wage contributions, financial expenses, investment expenses...</p>\n<p>This survey also provides some items of information on financing terms. Lastly, industrialists indicate their prospects in these areas.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.11.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1625> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/375>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Qualité de l'enquête relative à l'exercice 2008"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2009-03-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Tresorerie_francais_2008.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/S> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1625> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "L'enquête couvre l'industrie manufacturière et les industries extractives; divisions 08 à 33 de la NAF rév. 2 (hors 08.92Z, 09.10Z, 12, 19.10Z, 30.40Z)."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/27>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Site internet de l'OCDE"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Les indicateurs de conjoncture de l'OCDE"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <http://www.oecd.org/fr/france> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1625/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e deux fois par an, en juin et en d&eacute;cembre.</p>\n<p>La collecte s'effectue par voie postale et par internet sur une p&eacute;riode qui s'&eacute;tend de la fin du mois pr&eacute;c&eacute;dant le mois de l'enqu&ecirc;te &agrave; la date de publication de l'enqu&ecirc;te, dans les 10 premiers jours du mois suivant le mois de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
