                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1734> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1734/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1734> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1734/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1734> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1734/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The EC survey on the \"use of ICT and electronic commerce\" in business is a set of surveys conducted by the national institutes of statistics of the member countries of the European Union.<br /><br />It complies with regulation n&deg;808/2004 adopted on April 21, 2004&nbsp;as part of the implementation of the 2005 eEurope action plan devoted to information and communication technologies: this regulation was amended by European regulation n&deg; 1006/2009 of September 16, 2009. Accordingly, the surveys on ICT and electronic commerce in business conducted by the countries of the European Union follow a common methodology and the same model of questionnaire.<br /><br />Each year, one or more topics, determined by the annual European regulation for&nbsp;the implementation of the framework regulation, are developed in particular.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1734/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/148> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1734/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte, effectu&eacute;e par internet depuis 2012 (ou par questionnaire papier sur demande), est lanc&eacute;e au premier trimestre de l'ann&eacute;e consid&eacute;r&eacute;e.<br />L'enqu&ecirc;te couvre la France enti&egrave;re (g&eacute;ographie &agrave; la date de la collecte).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
