    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1516>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Survey on capabilities, help and resources for seniors living in households"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête Capacités, aides et ressources des seniors en ménages"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/serie/s1178> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/drees> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1516> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/563>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "L'enquête Handicap-santé - Volet Institution : Présentation, calcul des poids"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2011-02-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/enq_handicap_volet_institution.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1516> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey CARE m&eacute;nages was conducted by INSEE agents between May and mid October 2015. <br />- the senior part was done face-to-face;<br />- the caregiver component was carried out either face-to-face (when the caregiver was present at the time of the senior interview and agreed to answer) or by telephone.<br /><br />The survey CARE institutions was conduced between Septembre and Decembre 2016. Institution and Senior pars done fadce-to-face, caregiver part done by telephone.<br /><br />The project management of the households survey is carried out by INSEE.<br /><br />The operation is designed in partnership with a design group including:<br />- The Central Agricultural Social Mutual Fund (CCMSA)&nbsp; ;<br />- The National Old Age Insurance Fund (CNAV)&nbsp; ;<br />- The French National Centre for Scientific Research (CNRS)&nbsp; ;<br />- The national solidarity office for autonomy.&nbsp; (CNSA) ;<br />- The Directorate for Social Communication (DGCS) ;<br />- The National Institute for Demographic Studies (INED)&nbsp; ;<br />- National Institute for Health and Medical Research (Inserm);<br />- The Institute for Research and Documentation in Health Economics (Irdes) ;<br />- House of Social Sciences for disability (MSSH);<br />- The University of Paris 1;<br />The National Union of Family Associations (Unaf) has joined this group, which has been transformed into an operating group.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/I.20/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1516> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1516/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Volet seniors<br />- Tronc commun des m&eacute;nages<br />- D&eacute;pendance<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Sant&eacute; (dont mini-module europ&eacute;en et d&eacute;ficiences)<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Recours aux soins et &agrave; l&rsquo;h&eacute;bergement<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Limitations fonctionnelles<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Restrictions d&rsquo;activit&eacute;s<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Accessibilit&eacute;<br />- Aides<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Aides techniques<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Am&eacute;nagements du logement<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Aides humaines<br />&nbsp;&nbsp; - Aides financi&egrave;res<br />- Revenus, Allocations et Prestations<br />- D&eacute;penses r&eacute;guli&egrave;res et contraintes du m&eacute;nage<br />Volet aidants<br />- La relation de l&rsquo;aidant avec l&rsquo;aid&eacute;,<br />- Les aides humaines, financi&egrave;res et mat&eacute;rielles fournies par l&rsquo;aidant,<br />- Les cons&eacute;quences de l&rsquo;aide (sur la sant&eacute;, la vie professionnelle, la vie familiale, les loisirs)<br />- Prestations li&eacute;es &agrave; la perte d&rsquo;autonomie que l&rsquo;aid&eacute; n&rsquo;aurait pas pu renseigner.<br /><br />Le volet &laquo;&nbsp;&eacute;tablissements&nbsp;&raquo; comporte quelques questions g&eacute;n&eacute;rales sur les &eacute;tablissements et permet de tirer au sort les seniors&nbsp;qui seront interrog&eacute;s dans chaque &eacute;tablissement.<br />L&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement transmet &eacute;galement des &laquo;&nbsp;donn&eacute;es de cadrage&nbsp;&raquo; sur les seniors&nbsp;(date d&rsquo;entr&eacute;e dans l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement, GIR, allocations per&ccedil;ues - APA, ASH, APL, ALS).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><br />Le volet &laquo;&nbsp;aidants&nbsp;&raquo; s&rsquo;adresse aux aidants des seniors, qui auront &eacute;t&eacute; d&eacute;clar&eacute;s par les&nbsp;seniors dans le questionnaire &laquo;&nbsp;Seniors&nbsp;&raquo; des volets M&eacute;nages et Institutions. Il porte sur l&rsquo;aide (humaine, morale, financi&egrave;re) apport&eacute;e au senior, et sur ses cons&eacute;quences sur la vie professionnelle ou personnelle de l&rsquo;aidant.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
