                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/P> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Par internet avec possibilit&eacute; d'envoi par courrier sur demande. La collecte se d&eacute;roule de septembre &agrave; d&eacute;cembre (ou janvier).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.18.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>See file</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1142> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The questionnaire includes 3 sections:<br /><br />- the first part requires background information relating to the scope of the survey (activity, numbers);<br /><br />- the second part requires qualitative information on waste management and the importance of environmental concerns for the establishment. This provides qualitative insight into the figures required in the third part&nbsp;;<br /><br />- the third part requires tonnages according to the type of waste, as well as information on its collection and its processing.&nbsp;It is broken down into four sub-sections on non-hazardous slurry and effluent waste,&nbsp; organic wastes, organic non-hazardous waste, mixed non-hazardous and unsorted waste, and non-hazardous sorted waste.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.16/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The median (rectified) response time is 35 minutes. <br /><br />The label committee also ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on respondents, In addition, other decisions were made to limit the burden on respondents:&nbsp; <br />- negatively coordinated with other surveys<br />- electronic collection<br />- possibility to answer the questions about the quantity of waste in cubic meter (or number of pallets) if the value in tons is unknown.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is subject to an internal database archiving procedure.<br />Individual files are made available to users outside Insee via the Secure Data Access Centre (CASD), after being reviewed by the Committee on Statistical Confidentiality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different steps of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production: <br />- Checks and follow-ups during the collection phase<br />- Data cleaning to ensure consistency of answers within each questionnaire<br />- Winsorisation&nbsp;:&nbsp; control of the influence of atypiq units<br />- Calculation of precision indicators</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.19/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.19/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.15.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.15.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "The unit of interrogation is the establishment, identified by its siret number."@en , "L’unité d’interrogation est l’établissement, identifié par son numéro Siret."@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.13.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Des calculs de pr&eacute;cision sont effectu&eacute;s sur les principales variables de diffusion (les quantit&eacute;s de d&eacute;chets par cat&eacute;gories regroup&eacute;es).<br />Les indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision (coefficient de variation, intervalle de confiance &agrave; 95&nbsp;%) prennent en compte les erreurs dues &agrave; l&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage, &agrave; la correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse totale, au calage et &agrave; la winsorisation, mais pas l&rsquo;erreur li&eacute;e &agrave; la correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse partielle.<br />Les r&eacute;sultats des calculs sont pr&eacute;sent&eacute;s dans le fichier :</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1137> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The variables with high partial non-response rate have to be analysed with caution because a significant proportion of the responses have therefore been imputed. Other elements are also to include, as precision of estimators and the fact to cross the variable or not with fields of diffusion.<br /><br />Before any exploitation, it is also useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and the confidence intervals provided in the survey quality indicators.<br /><br />Below the ten variables with the hightest partial non-responses rates (between 20&nbsp;% and 39&nbsp;%)&nbsp;:<br />- Share of packaging in other non-hazardous waste;<br />- Existence of a waste pre-treatment station on site;<br />- Existence of a wastewater treatment plant on site;<br />- Quantity of other non-hazardous waste;<br />- Quantity of waste from used wooden crates and crates;<br />- Quantity of waste from end-of-life equipment;<br />- Quantity of rubber waste;<br />- Dry matter content of sludge;<br />- Quantity of canteen waste;<br />- Quantity of pneumatic waste.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Regarding Internet collection, the collection site is completely secure and the standards in terms of managing access codes to the survey are strict. For companies choosing to use paper, the data entry is ensured by the managers, in strict respect of the confidentiality of the data collected.<br />Before the dissemination of the data the secrecy is applied. For enterprise data: no results are published for less than three enterprises or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be released if no company or institution contributes more than 85% of that result. Thus the so-called primary secret corresponds to the boxes meeting the above criterion. The secondary secret removes other boxes so that the data cannot be retrieved by subtraction with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in Act No. 51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.11.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les variables pr&eacute;sentant des taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle &eacute;lev&eacute;s doivent &ecirc;tre interpr&eacute;t&eacute;es avec pr&eacute;caution, puisqu&rsquo;une partie non n&eacute;gligeable de leurs r&eacute;ponses a &eacute;t&eacute; imput&eacute;e. D&rsquo;autres &eacute;l&eacute;ments sont &eacute;galement &agrave; prendre en compte, tels que la pr&eacute;cision des estimations et le fait de croiser ou pas la variable avec des domaines de diffusion.<br /><br />Avant toute exploitation, il est donc utile d&rsquo;appr&eacute;cier la qualit&eacute; des variables au travers de leur taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle et des intervalles de confiance fournis dans les indicateurs de qualit&eacute; de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te.<br /><br />Ci-dessous, pour ne citer qu&rsquo;elles, les dix variables pr&eacute;sentant les taux de non-r&eacute;ponse partielle les plus &eacute;lev&eacute;s (compris entre 20&nbsp;% et 39&nbsp;%)&nbsp;:<br />- Part de l&rsquo;emballage dans les autres d&eacute;chets non dangereux&nbsp;;<br />- Existence d&rsquo;une station de pr&eacute;-traitement des d&eacute;chets sur site&nbsp;;<br />- Existence d&rsquo;une station d&rsquo;&eacute;puration sur site&nbsp;;<br />- Quantit&eacute; d&rsquo;autres d&eacute;chets non dangereux&nbsp;;<br />- Quantit&eacute; de d&eacute;chets des caisses et cagettes en bois usag&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- Quantit&eacute; de d&eacute;chets des &eacute;quipements hors d&rsquo;usage&nbsp;;<br />- Quantit&eacute; de d&eacute;chets de caoutchouc&nbsp;;<br />- Teneur en mati&egrave;re s&egrave;che des boues&nbsp;;<br />- Quantit&eacute; de d&eacute;chets de cantine&nbsp;;<br />- Quantit&eacute; de d&eacute;chets pneumatique.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2017X082EC"@fr , "2017X082EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> , <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.15.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les donn&eacute;es de l'enqu&ecirc;te D&eacute;chets sur l&rsquo;industrie peuvent &ecirc;tre compl&eacute;t&eacute;es par celles de l'enqu&ecirc;te D&eacute;chets sur le commerce en faisant attention aux diff&eacute;rences de champ (20 salari&eacute;s ou plus pour le commerce).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The most indicators broadcast are the quantity of gather wastes together : <br />- Total quantity of humid slurry&nbsp;: <br />- Total quantity of organic waste&nbsp;:<br />- Total quantity of mixed waste&nbsp;:<br />- Total quantity of glass waste&nbsp;: <br />- Total quantity of metal waste&nbsp;: <br />- Total quantity of plastic waste&nbsp;: <br />- Total quantity of paper and paperboard waste&nbsp;: <br />- Total quantity of cloth and leather waste&nbsp;:<br />- Total quantity of rubber waste :<br />- Total quantity of wood waste&nbsp;: &nbsp;<br />- Total quantity of mineral waste&nbsp;: <br />- Total quantity of out of service equipment&nbsp;:<br />- Total quantity of canteen waste / company restaurant&nbsp;: <br />- Total quantity of waste except humid slurry.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>This themed survey only deals with non-hazardous waste. Data on hazardous waste is obtained by consulting the annual administrative declarations for hazardous waste fulfilled by establishments (database on directory polluting emissions directory: BDREP).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different stages of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />- stratified sample selection <br />- reminders and checks of data being collected <br />- clearance <br />- adjustment for total non-response <br />- shimming <br />- adjustment for partial non-response <br />- control of the influence of atypical units (winsorisation).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.10.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Quality report in SIMS format</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex.</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier,&nbsp; CS 70 058, 92 541 Montrouge Cedex.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les principaux domaines de diffusion sont les suivants&nbsp;:<br /><br />Le&nbsp; secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute; d&eacute;taill&eacute; selon les modalit&eacute;s suivantes &nbsp;:<br />- BZ - Industries extractives&nbsp;;<br />- CA - Fabrication de denr&eacute;es alimentaires, de boissons et de produits &agrave; base de tabac&nbsp;;<br />- CB - Fabrication de textiles, industrie de l&rsquo;habillement, industrie du cuir et de la chaussure&nbsp;;<br />- CC - Travail du bois, industries du papier et imprimerie&nbsp;;<br />- CE - Industrie chimique&nbsp;;<br />- CF - Industrie pharmaceutique&nbsp;;<br />- CG - Fabrication de produits en caoutchouc et en plastique ainsi que d&rsquo;autres produits min&eacute;raux non m&eacute;talliques&nbsp;;<br />- CH - M&eacute;tallurgie et fabrication de produits m&eacute;talliques &agrave; l&rsquo;exception des machines et des &eacute;quipements&nbsp;;<br />- CI - Fabrication de produits informatiques, &eacute;lectroniques et optiques&nbsp;;<br />- CJ - Fabrication d&rsquo;&eacute;quipements &eacute;lectriques&nbsp;;<br />- CK - Fabrication de machines et &eacute;quipements (non class&eacute;s ailleurs)&nbsp;;<br />- CL - Fabrication de mat&eacute;riel de transport&nbsp;;<br />- CM - Autres industries manufacturi&egrave;res, r&eacute;paration et installation de machines et d&rsquo;&eacute;quipements ; cok&eacute;faction et raffinage&nbsp;;<br />- DZ - Production et distribution d&rsquo;&eacute;lectricit&eacute;, de gaz, de vapeur et d&rsquo;air conditionn&eacute;. <br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />Les tranches d&rsquo;effectif salari&eacute;&nbsp;sont les suivantes:<br />- 2 - De 10 &agrave; 19 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 3 - De 20 &agrave; 49 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 4 - De 50 &agrave; 99 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 5 - De 100 &agrave; 249 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 6 - De 250 &agrave; 499 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 7 - De 500 &agrave; 999 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 8 - De 1000 &agrave; 1999 salari&eacute;s&nbsp;;<br />- 9 - 2000 salari&eacute;s ou plus.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.15.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The data of waste in industrial establishment can be completed by those of waste in trade being carefull by the differences of scope (20 or more employees for the second one).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Establishments belong to the nomenclature of french activity (NAF rev.2 sections B, C, D.)</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/I.18.12/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/I.18.12/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte s&rsquo;est d&eacute;roul&eacute;e de septembre 2017 &agrave; janvier 2018.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.11.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.11.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey waste in industrial establishments in&nbsp; 2012 and 2016 can be comparated, except the potential changes in the wordings of questions. The evolution of adjustment methods can affect at the margins some evolutions.<br />Before 2012, the survey waste covers the establishments of 10 employees or more in food industry and those of 20 employees or more in the other industries. Since 2012, the survey waste covers the establishments of 10 employees of more for all industries.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1843/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>- Ann&eacute;e 2016 pour la Partie III sur la production de d&eacute;chets<br />- &Agrave; la date de remplissage du questionnaire pour les autres questions</p>"@fr , "<p>- Year 2016 for part III (production of waste)<br />- Date of the filling in the questionnaire for the other questions</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1843> .
}

