    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1600/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quarterly survey on investment in industry is part of the European system to harmonise European Commission business outlook&nbsp;surveys, and to which the 27 Member States of the European Union contribute.</p>\n<p>Thus questionnaires, classifications and data processing methods have been harmonised to a large extent in the national institutes of the countries that have adopted this system.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
