            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/serie/s1208> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Until June 2012, the sample consisted of the telephone numbers of subscribers listed in the France Telecom directory (18 million subscribers).<br />The following were excluded : households without a telephone, those registered to the &ldquo;red-list&rdquo; (opposed to the dissemination of their phone number) or to the &ldquo;orange-list&rsquo; (anti-canvassing list) and people equipped solely with a GSM telephone (cellular or mobile).<br /><br />From summer 2012, the sample consists of households registered to the French Local Residence Tax (&ldquo;Taxe d'habitation&rdquo;). The households whose phone number appears in the white pages directory are surveyed.<br />This new sampling framework has improved the coverage of the population in particular of the younger members but it remains incomplete because ex-directory numbers can not be selected.<br /><br />The sample comprises three sub-samples :<br /><br />- 1,100 households being surveyed for the first time ;<br /><br />- the households surveyed for the second time ;<br /><br />- the households surveyed for the third and last time (3rd wave).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.20/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/81> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te mensuelle de conjoncture aupr&egrave;s des m&eacute;nages (Camme) figure parmi les 11 enqu&ecirc;tes de conjoncture r&eacute;alis&eacute;es par l'Insee.</p>\n<p>Elle fait ainsi partie du syst&egrave;me europ&eacute;en harmonis&eacute; des enqu&ecirc;tes de conjoncture auquel contribuent les &Eacute;tats membres de l'Union europ&eacute;enne. Les questionnaires et les m&eacute;thodes de traitement sont harmonis&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The Monthly consumer confidence survey (CAMME) is one of the 11 business and consumer surveys carried out by INSEE.</p>\n<p>It is therefore part of the harmonised European Union programme of business and consumer surveys to which the Member States of the European Union contribute. The questionnaires and processing methods are in line with each other.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Until 2007, the survey was conducted each month except August. Since 2008, it has been conducted every month.<br /><br />Households are surveyed in three consecutive months.<br /><br />The survey is conducted by telephone. Fieldwork for the monthly surveys takes place in the first three weeks of each month.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.20/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.20/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Parmi les th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s, on peut citer l'opinion que se font les m&eacute;nages, r&eacute;sidant en m&eacute;tropole, sur :<br /><br />- la conjoncture &eacute;conomique g&eacute;n&eacute;rale de la France (situation &eacute;conomique g&eacute;n&eacute;rale, ch&ocirc;mage, inflation) ;<br />- leur situation financi&egrave;re personnelle ;<br />- leurs intentions en mati&egrave;re d'&eacute;pargne et de consommation.<br /><br />Pour ces diff&eacute;rents th&egrave;mes on demande l'opinion des m&eacute;nages sur l'&eacute;volution pass&eacute;e et l'&eacute;volution future (sur une p&eacute;riode de douze mois avant et apr&egrave;s la date d'interrogation).<br /><br />En outre, l'enqu&ecirc;te Camme est le support de \"micro plateformes\" compos&eacute;es de vingt questions maximum, permettant d'aborder des th&egrave;mes d'actualit&eacute; dans des d&eacute;lais rapides (logement, pratiques environnementales, bien-&ecirc;tre&hellip;). </p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/81>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "European Commission website"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Joint harmonised European Union programme of business and consumer surveys"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "en" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <http://ec.europa.eu/economy_finance/db_indicators/surveys/method_guides/index_en.htm> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.19/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.19/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey collects information on the opinions households have of :<br />- the general economic situation in France (unemployment, inflation) ;<br /><br />- their own financial situation ;<br /><br />- their intentions in terms of saving and expenditure.<br /><br />For each of these points, households are asked their opinions of past&nbsp;and future trends (over a period of twelve months before and after the date they are surveyed).<br /><br />In addition, the CAMME survey is used for complementary modules comprising a maximum of twenty questions and addressing specific topics such as environment, wellness and housing conditions.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/660>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Enquête mensuelle de conjoncture auprès des ménages"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "en" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2014-02-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/methodo_monthly_consumer_confidence_survey_3022014.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Jusqu'en 2007, l'enqu&ecirc;te avait lieu chaque mois sauf au mois d'ao&ucirc;t. Depuis 2008, elle a lieu tous les mois.<br /><br />Les m&eacute;nages sont interrog&eacute;s trois mois de suite.<br /><br />La collecte est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par t&eacute;l&eacute;phone. L'interrogation a lieu au cours des trois premi&egrave;res semaines de chaque mois.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/33>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Site internet de la Commission européenne, page en anglais"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Le système européen harmonisé des enquêtes de conjoncture de la Commission européenne"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <http://ec.europa.eu/economy_finance/db_indicators/surveys/method_guides/index_en.htm> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/H> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>12 &eacute;chantillons mensuels de 1 100 num&eacute;ros de t&eacute;l&eacute;phone constituent ainsi la fraction \"entrante\", chaque unit&eacute; &eacute;tant interrog&eacute;e trois mois cons&eacute;cutifs. <br />Un certain nombre de num&eacute;ros ne seront cependant pas r&eacute;interrog&eacute;s en vagues 2 et 3 : num&eacute;ros impossibles &agrave; joindre, inaptes, refus&hellip; Il faut donc compter environ 1 900 questionnaires renseign&eacute;s par mois.<br /><br />&nbsp;Une op&eacute;ration m&eacute;thodologique, visant &agrave; mesurer l'impact du biais de couverture de la base de sondage, avait &eacute;t&eacute; men&eacute;e en avril&nbsp;2008.<br /><br />Il en r&eacute;sultait que, malgr&eacute; son d&eacute;faut de couverture, l'enqu&ecirc;te fournit des donn&eacute;es de qualit&eacute; suffisante pour les analyses de conjoncture.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/408> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Each new sub-sample is questioned for three consecutive months. <br /><br />However certain households are not surveyed : impossibility to contact them, refusals&hellip; In general about 1,900 questionnaires are completed each month.<br />A methodological operation was carried out in April 2008 to measure the impact of survey base coverage bias. <br /><br />The result was that the survey provides data of sufficient quality for short-term analyses.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/660> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-12-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1602/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/P> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1602> .
}

