    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur les consommations d'énergie dans l'industrie 2019"@fr , "Metadata report 1940"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1496> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La fiche qualit&eacute; est d&eacute;crite selon la norme europ&eacute;enne du Single integrated metadata structure (SIMS).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.12.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Un comit&eacute; de concertation compos&eacute;, outre des deux services producteurs, des experts et repr&eacute;sentants des politiques publiques concern&eacute;es par les questions d&rsquo;&eacute;nergie, des repr&eacute;sentants d&rsquo;organisations professionnelles, de syndicats de salari&eacute;s et du secteur &eacute;nerg&eacute;tique se r&eacute;unit chaque ann&eacute;e.<br />L'enqu&ecirc;te r&eacute;pond &agrave; la demande de l'Agence internationale de l'&eacute;nergie (AIE) qui rassemble l'information sur le sujet des consommations d&rsquo;&eacute;nergie.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les donn&eacute;es sont publi&eacute;es dans les collections 'Insee Focus et l'Insee R&eacute;sultats' et disponibles sur le site insee.fr.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de sondage est le Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus).<br />La m&eacute;thode d'&eacute;chantillonnage est un plan stratifi&eacute; selon la Nomenclature de Travail de l'EACEI (NTE, regroupement de secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute;) , tranches d&rsquo;effectif salari&eacute;, et r&eacute;gion.<br />Les allocations sont optimis&eacute;es sur le croisement NTE x Tranches d&rsquo;effectifs, et sur la consommation nette d&rsquo;&eacute;nergie, en prenant en compte la moyenne des dispersions par strate des 3 derni&egrave;res ann&eacute;es. Les allocations sont exhaustives au-del&agrave; du seuil de 250 salari&eacute;s, pour les &eacute;tablissements fort consommateurs d&rsquo;&eacute;nergies ou consommateurs d&rsquo;&eacute;nergies rares et pour les strates de moins de 10 unit&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey responds to the request of the International Energy Agency (IEA) for information on the subject of energy consumption and to Community Regulation 58/97 on structural business statistics which lays down additional obligations in this area.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2017-10-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Law n&deg; 51-711 of 7 June 1951 on obligations, co-ordination and confidentiality in respect of statistics. Available from</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573\">https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573</a></p>\n<p><br />Article 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L. 213-3 of the French Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires endorsed as provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to private and family life and, in general, to private acts and conduct can not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after examining the opinion of the Statistical Confidentiality Committee and relating to a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, be the subject of any communication by the depositary service before the expiry of a period of seventy-five years following the date of completion of the survey or a period of twenty-five years from the death of the person concerned, whichever is the shorter.<br />A Statistical Confidentiality Committee is set up. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to the confidentiality of statistics. It expresses its opinion on requests for the communication of individual data collected pursuant to this law. The committee is chaired by a State Councillor, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes in particular representatives of the French National Assembly and Senate. The composition and operating methods of the committee are set by decree of the Council of State. Recipients of the data communications resulting from Ministerial decisions made after consulting the Statistical Confidentiality Committee agree to not communicate these data to anyone. Any violation of the provisions of this paragraph is punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Penal Code.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@fr , "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Activity (NACE rev.2 divisions)<br />07-Mining of metal ores <br />08-Other mining and quarring <br />09-Mining support service activity <br />10-Manufacture of food products <br />11-Manufacturing of beverages <br />12-Manufacture of tobacco products <br />13-Manufacture of textiles <br />14-Manufacture of wearing apparel <br />15-Manufacture of leather and related products <br />16-Manufacture of wood and of products of wood and cork, except furniture&nbsp;; manufacture of articles of straw and painting materials <br />17-Manufacture of paper and paperproduct <br />18-Printing and reproduction of recorded media <br />19-Manufacture of coke and refined petroleum produtcs <br />20-Manufacture of chemical products <br />21-Manufacture of basic pharmaceutical products and pharmaceutical preparations <br />22-Manufacture of rubber and plastic products <br />23-Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products <br />24-Manufacture of basic metals <br />25-Manufacture of fabricated metal products, except machinery and equipment <br />26-Manufacturing of computer, electronic and optical products <br />27-Manufacture of electrical equipment <br />28-Manufacture of machinery and equipment n.e.c. <br />29-Manufacture of motor vehicles, trallers and semi-trallers <br />30-Manufacture of other transport equipment <br />31-Manufacture of furniture <br />32-Other manufacturing <br />33-Repair and installation of machinery and equipment<br />36-Water collection, treatment and supply<br />37- Sewerage<br />38-Waste collection, treatment and disposal activities&nbsp;; materials recovery<br />39-Remediation activities and other waste management services<br />TOTAL</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>Ann&eacute;e 2019</p>"@fr , "<p>Year 2019</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sampling frame is the Sirus directory (system of identification to directory of statistical units).<br />The sampling method is a stratified plan by the nomenclature of activities (NTE) dedicated to energy consumption, workforce bands, and region.<br />Allocations are optimised on the NTE x workforce bands, and on net energy consumption, taking into account the average dispersion per stratum over the last 3 years. The allowances are exhaustive above the threshold of 250 employees, big consumers of energy and for strata of less than 10 units.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The theme addressed is the different energies used by the establishments, in terms of purchases (volume, value) and use by the establishment. The main energies observed are:<br />electricity ;<br />steam and other heat transfer fluids ;<br />natural gas&nbsp; and other gases ;<br />coal, lignite, lean coal, coal coke, petroleum coke, butane, propane ;<br />heavy fuel oil, heating oil and other petroleum products ;<br />black liquor, wood ;</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le champ de l'enqu&ecirc;te est constant d&rsquo;une ann&eacute;e sur l&rsquo;autre.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les &eacute;tablissements appartiennent aux sections B et C de la NAF (division 05 &agrave; 33) , au groupe 383 (r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration), hors : sous classes : 1013B, 1071B, 1071C, 1071D (artisanat commercial), 2013A et 2446Z ; hors divisions 05, 06 et 19 ; hors groupe 091.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E430> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Il s'agit des &eacute;tablissements de 20 salari&eacute;s ou plus, ayant au moins 4 mois d&rsquo;activit&eacute; en 2018, et de code d&rsquo;activit&eacute; principale (APET) correspondant aux sections B et C (division 05 &agrave; 33) , au groupe 383 (r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration), <br />hors : sous classes : 1013B, 1071B, 1071C, 1071D (artisanat commercial), 2013A et 2446Z ;<br />hors divisions 05, 06 et 19;<br />hors groupe 091.<br /><br />L'&eacute;chantillon comprend environ 9500 &eacute;tablissements.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.6.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.6.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.6.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.6.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.7.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>In so far as concerns collection via the Internet, the Coltrane collection site is totally secure and the standards in terms of managing survey access codes are strict and standardized for all surveys. For enterprises that choose to use paper, the managers are responsible for the input, and must strictly respect the confidentiality of any data collected.<br />This confidentiality applies before any data is disseminated. For data relating to enterprises - no results are published that relates to less than three enterprises or establishments. Similarly, a result will only be disseminated if no enterprise or institution contributes more than 85% of this result. Primary suppressions correspond to boxes that do not meet the above criteria. Secondary confidentiality removes other boxes so that the data can not be retrieved by adding and subtracting with the margins of the tables. Statistical confidentiality is defined in law n&deg; 51-711 of 7 June 1951.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1148>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire EACEI 2019"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/EACEI2019_questionnaire.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.12.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.12.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.12.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.12.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.7.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Concernant la collecte internet, le site de collecte Coltrane est enti&egrave;rement s&eacute;curis&eacute; et les normes en termes de gestion des codes d&rsquo;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te sont strictes et standardis&eacute;es pour toutes les enqu&ecirc;tes entreprises. Pour les entreprises choisissant d&rsquo;utiliser le support papier, la saisie est assur&eacute;e par les gestionnaires, dans le strict respect de la confidentialit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es r&eacute;colt&eacute;es.<br />Avant la diffusion des donn&eacute;es le secret est appliqu&eacute;. Pour les donn&eacute;es relatives aux entreprises : on ne publie aucun r&eacute;sultat qui concerne moins de trois entreprises ou &eacute;tablissements. De m&ecirc;me, un r&eacute;sultat ne sera diffus&eacute; que si aucune entreprise ou &eacute;tablissement ne contribue &agrave; plus de 85 % de ce r&eacute;sultat. Les suppression primaire correspondent aux cases ne r&eacute;pondant pas au crit&egrave;re ci-dessus. Le secret secondaire supprime d'autres cases pour que les donn&eacute;es ne puissent pas &ecirc;tre retrouv&eacute;es par addition soustraction avec les marges des tableaux. Le secret statistique est d&eacute;fini dans la loi n&deg; 51-711 du 7 juin 1951.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The serie includes quantities consumed by type of energy (kW, MWh, tonnes, litres, Nm&sup3;), related costs (k&euro;), and the breakdown by use of each energy, as well as contextual data on the surveyed establishments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.11.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.11.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.11.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.12/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.12/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/I.18.12/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>See the documents</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1147> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1148> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.7.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.7.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.7.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.7.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1940> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1940/S.10.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour la diffusion,&nbsp;en plus des publications, il y a &eacute;galement&nbsp;des indicateurs de qualit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1952> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.6.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te Emploi s&rsquo;inscrit dans un cadre europ&eacute;en, d&eacute;fini par le r&egrave;glement 577/1998 du Conseil du 9 mars 1998.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.13.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Response rate&nbsp;: 91,9&nbsp;%</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.10.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Un fichier &agrave; destination des chercheurs est accessible par le r&eacute;seau Qu&eacute;telet&nbsp;:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://quetelet.casd.eu/fr/utilisateur/connexion\">https://quetelet.casd.eu/fr/utilisateur/connexion</a></p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.12/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de sondage est une base d&rsquo;adresses. Cette base d&rsquo;adresses est actualis&eacute;e via une enqu&ecirc;te cartographique r&eacute;alis&eacute;e chaque ann&eacute;e sur un cinqui&egrave;me du territoire. Les &icirc;lots mahorais ont &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;partis en 5 groupes de rotation &agrave; partir des donn&eacute;es du recensement de 2012. Ces groupes de rotation sont stratifi&eacute;s selon le groupement g&eacute;ographique de l&rsquo;ensemble des communes et ils sont &eacute;quilibr&eacute;s selon le nombre de logements. <br /><br />Le plan de sondage est stratifi&eacute; selon le type d&rsquo;adresse (mono-logements, petites adresses et grandes adresses). <br />Le tirage de l&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon est &eacute;quilibr&eacute; selon le type de b&acirc;ti (en dur ou autre), selon la localisation g&eacute;ographique et enfin selon une variable de classification des villages (celle-ci &eacute;tant bas&eacute;e sur des crit&egrave;res socio-&eacute;conomiques et d&eacute;mographiques).<br /><br />L&rsquo;&eacute;chantillon est rotatif. Il est renouvel&eacute; au tiers chaque ann&eacute;e. <br /><br />L'&eacute;chantillon est uniform&eacute;ment r&eacute;parti sur les 17 semaines de &laquo;&nbsp;r&eacute;f&eacute;rence&nbsp;&raquo;. <br /><br />Le taux de sondage moyen est de 1/66.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.6.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.6.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.6.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.6.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-F230> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.7/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.7/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le questionnaire de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te Emploi annuelle Mayotte est structur&eacute; autour des th&egrave;mes suivants&nbsp;:<br />- la description du m&eacute;nage et des personnes qui le composent&nbsp;;<br />- le statut d&rsquo;activit&eacute; au sens du BIT&nbsp;;<br />- la description des activit&eacute;s professionnelles (profession, dur&eacute;e du travail, type de contrat&hellip;)&nbsp;;<br />- la description de l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement employeur ou dirig&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- les caract&eacute;ristiques de la recherche d&rsquo;emploi&nbsp;;<br />- le niveau d&rsquo;&eacute;tudes et la participation &agrave; des formations&nbsp;;<br />- la situation un an avant l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te (lieu de r&eacute;sidence, situation par rapport au march&eacute; du travail&hellip;)&nbsp;;<br />- la mobilit&eacute; pass&eacute;e et souhait&eacute;e&nbsp;;<br />- les activit&eacute;s occasionnelles&nbsp;;<br />- les revenus.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.13.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.13.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.13.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.13.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/region/0e9f9adc-742d-4ab7-90bd-30e5aaf7b2ab> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te permet de mesurer les concepts d&rsquo;activit&eacute;, d&rsquo;emploi et de ch&ocirc;mage conform&eacute;ment aux crit&egrave;res &eacute;tablis par le BIT. Elle comporte des questions permettant de d&eacute;crire l'emploi (statut, profession, temps de travail&hellip;.) selon des nomenclatures ou des d&eacute;finitions europ&eacute;ennes.</p>\n<p>Emploi&nbsp; BIT : <a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/definition/c1159\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/definition/c1159</a></p>\n<p>Chomage BIT : <a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/definition/c1129\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/definition/c1129</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/definition/c2018\">https://insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/definition/c2018</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology#EU-LFS_concept_of_labour_force_status\">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology#EU-LFS_concept_of_labour_force_status</a></p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.6.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The LFS is defined by the regulation n&deg; 577/1998 of the Council of 9 march 1998.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.1.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.7>
                    "0187696291"@fr , "0187696291"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The sampling frame is an address database which is updated with an annual cartographic survey on one-fifth of the territory. Mayotte territory blocks have been divided into 5 rotational groups based on 2012 census counts. These rotational groups are stratified by the geographic clustering of all municipalities and are balanced on the number of dwellings and others sociodemographics variables.<br /><br />The sample is stratified on the size of the address (single dwelling, less than ten dwellings, more than ten dwellings). The sample is balanced on the region. For each region, the sample is balanced, proportionnaly of the number of main residences, on some variables from the sample frame.&nbsp; <br /><br />It is a rotative sampling&nbsp;: one third of the sample is refreshed every year.<br />&nbsp;<br />The sample is uniformely distributed among the 17 reference weeks. <br /><br />The average sampling rate is 1/66.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.11>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.11>
                    "<p>Each year, around 3 000 dwellings are surveyed.</p>"@en , "<p>Chaque ann&eacute;e, environ 3 000 logements sont enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;s.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.18.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.18.5/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.18.5/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-F001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Dossier ch&ocirc;mage</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/information/2022025\">https://www.insee.fr/fr/information/2022025 </a></p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.18.5/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The weighting adjustement is done in two steps. <br />The weights are first adjusted by estimating the response probabilities using a logistic regression (with auxiliary variables&nbsp;: type of address, previous non-response status, type of housing, geographical location).<br />Then, a calibration is done on individual margins (disaggregated by gender and age group, diploma, place of birth) and on housing external margins (number of main residences).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The LFS Mayotte questionnaire is structured around the following themes:<br />- a description of the household and its members;<br />- the status of an activity according to the ILO definition;<br />- a detailed description of the current main job (occupation, working time, kind of contract, etc.).<br />- the description of the employing institution<br />- The caracteristics of job search activities<br />- the level of education and participation in training;<br />- the situation one year before the survey (place of residence, labour market situation, etc.);<br />- the past and desired geographic mobility&nbsp;;<br />- casual activities&nbsp;;<br />- incomes.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>A file for researchers is accessible through the Qu&eacute;telet network&nbsp;:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://quetelet.casd.eu/fr/utilisateur/connexion\"> https://quetelet.casd.eu/fr/utilisateur/connexion</a></p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.20/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.20/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.12/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is joined above&nbsp;:</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1172> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.20/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Unemployment file</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.insee.fr/fr/information/2022025\"> https://www.insee.fr/fr/information/2022025 </a><br /><br /></p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>Le statut d&rsquo;activit&eacute; au sens du BIT est mesur&eacute; en r&eacute;f&eacute;rence &agrave; une semaine donn&eacute;e fixe, dite &laquo;&nbsp;semaine de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@fr , "<p>The ILO status of activity is measured according to a fixed week, named reference week.</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.18.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La correction de la non-r&eacute;ponse s&rsquo;effectue en 2 temps. <br />Dans un premier temps, la non-r&eacute;ponse est corrig&eacute;e, au niveau m&eacute;nage, via une mod&eacute;lisation logistique de la r&eacute;ponse (selon le type d&rsquo;adresse, le fait d&rsquo;avoir r&eacute;pondu ou non dans le pass&eacute; &agrave; l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te, le type de b&acirc;ti, la localisation g&eacute;ographique&hellip;).&nbsp;&nbsp; <br />Dans un second temps, un calage sur marge est effectu&eacute; pour contr&ocirc;ler les fluctuations d&rsquo;&eacute;chantillonnage. Les marges sont de niveau individuel (ventilation par sexe, &acirc;ge), r&eacute;partition des individus de 15 ans ou plus selon le lieu de naissance et de niveau logement (nombre de r&eacute;sidences principales).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Voir le lien</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology\">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology</a></p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "Individus"@fr , "Persons"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>See the link</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology\">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology</a></p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.6.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.4>
                    "2017A053EC"@fr , "2017A053EC"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.13.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Taux de r&eacute;ponse&nbsp;: 91,9&nbsp;%</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058 92541 Montrouge cedex</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058 92541 Montrouge cedex</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.17.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les donn&eacute;es ont &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;vis&eacute;es apr&egrave;s le dernier recensement exhaustif de la population. Celui-ci a eu lieu en 2017, ainsi les donn&eacute;es 2013-2017 sont r&eacute;vis&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1172>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire EEM 2017"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/QuestionnaireEEM2017.doc> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey provides a measurement of activity, employment and unemployment according to the ILO definition. It provides a description of the job (status, occupation, working time&hellip;) according to european classifications / definitions.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology#EU-LFS_concept_of_labour_force_status\">https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/EU_labour_force_survey_-_methodology#EU-LFS_concept_of_labour_force_status</a></p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.10.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.10.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.10.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La collecte est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e entre mars et juin. Elle s&rsquo;effectue, sauf exception, dans les 2 semaines et 2 jours apr&egrave;s la fin de la semaine de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.1.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.4>
                    "<p>Chef de la division Emploi</p>"@fr , "<p>Head of Employment Section</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1952> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1952/S.9>
