                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur les investissements dans l'industrie pour protéger l'environnement 2015"@fr , "Quality report: Survey on environmental protection studies and investments 2015"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1297> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.10.5/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Pour la diffusion,&nbsp;en plus des publications, il y a &eacute;galement&nbsp;des indicateurs de qualit&eacute; des donn&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>These are industrial establishments with 20 or more employees, belonging to sections B, C, D of NAF rev.2.</p>\n<p>The sample is in the order of 11 000 units (divided into 9 000 on the field excluding LPN and sawmills, 2 000 on the field LPN and sawmills).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
