            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey on ICT (micro enterprises) concerns entreprises with number of persons employed between 1 and 9, classified in the following NACE rev. 2 aggregates: sections C to J, L,N, divisions 69 to 74, and group 95.1"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
