    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/I.18.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La p&eacute;riode de collecte s'est &eacute;tendue du 20 juin au&nbsp;15 novembre 2017.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1112>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Méthodologie de l'enquête annuelle sur les investissements pour protéger l'environnement (Antipol) 2018"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "0019-05-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/S.18.5.MET_ANTIPOL.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les th&egrave;mes abord&eacute;s portent sur les investissements (mat&eacute;riels enti&egrave;rement d&eacute;di&eacute;s &agrave; la protection de l'environnement, achats d'&eacute;quipements de production plus performants en mati&egrave;re environnementale...), les &eacute;tudes (en vue d'un investissement ou r&eacute;glementaires) et les d&eacute;penses courantes (collect&eacute;es tous les 3 ans) destin&eacute;es &agrave; prot&eacute;ger l'environnement.</p>\n<p>Ces d&eacute;penses sont r&eacute;parties selon les domaines concern&eacute;s&nbsp;:<br />- eaux us&eacute;es&nbsp;;<br />- protection de l'air&nbsp;;<br />- limitation des gaz &agrave; effet de serre&nbsp;;<br />- d&eacute;chets&nbsp;;<br />- bruits et vibrations&nbsp;;<br />- sols et eaux souterraines et de surface&nbsp;;<br />- sites, paysages et biodiversit&eacute;&nbsp;;<br />- autres domaines.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1113> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Internet with the possibility of using postal means upon demand.</p>\n<p>Units of measure:<br />- The workforce of the establishment is requested on 31/12/2016 (EFF_ETAB), number of FTE dedicated to environnment (EFF_ENV): number of occupied people<br />- Studies and investments for environmental protection: thousands of euros<br />- The shares (PART_ACHAT, PART_ENVIR) and breakdown (IE, ID, IA, IG, IB, IS, IP, IR et TOT_PCT)&nbsp;: percentage (%)</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.10.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Insee Focus and Insee Resultats are available on the insee.fr site.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te r&eacute;pond au r&egrave;glement europ&eacute;en relatif aux statistiques structurelles sur les entreprises (CE N&deg;251/2009) du 11 mars 2009, demandant de fournir les d&eacute;penses de protection de l'environnement ventil&eacute;es par domaine environnemental, par activit&eacute; et par taille d'entreprise.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey shows a decrease in response rate: 81.8% (86.3% in the previous edition) because of the interrogation about included current expenditure.</p>\n<p>Before any exploitation, it is also useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and the confidence intervals provided in the survey quality indicators.</p>\n<p>This year, the partial non-response rate is very higt for the variable RED_ASS_EPU. It stands at 22%.<br />This variable should therefore be analysed with caution, as a significant proportion of the responses have therefore been imputed.</p>\n<p>The variables AU_TA and COTIS have a partial non-response rate relatively hight. It stands at 9.1&nbsp;%.</p>\n<p>The other variables all have a partial non-response rate of less than 6%.</p>\n<p>In terms of precision, the main numerical variables have the following coefficients of variation:<br />Total amount of studies to protect the environment (TOT_ETUDE): 3.2%<br />Total amount of specific investments (IT): 2.6%.<br />Amount of integrated environmental protection investments (I2): 6.2%.<br />Amount of operating and maintenance of equipments dedicated to environnment (TD): 2,0%.<br />Amount of current expenditure to protect environment (TOT_DEP_COUR): 1,3%.</p>\n<p>Accuracy degrades when one focuses on finer diffusion domains. In particular, the following sectors of activity have a coefficient of variation exceeding 30% and should be analysed with caution:<br /><br />For (TOT_ETUDE)<br />Manufacture of vegetable and animal oils and fats<br />Grain processing; manufacture of starch products<br />Processing and preserving of fish, crustaceans and molluscs<br />Automotive industry<br />Manufacture of animal feed<br />Leather and Footwear Industry<br />Manufacture of bakery and pasta products</p>\n<p>For (TI) <br />Manufacture of animal feed<br />Processing and preserving of fish, crustaceans and molluscs<br />Manufacture of bakery and pasta products<br />Clothing industry <br />Repair and installation of machinery and equipment<br />Leather and Footwear Industry<br />Manufacture of vegetable and animal oils and fats<br />Woodworking and manufacture of articles of wood and cork, except furniture; manufacture of articles of straw and plaiting materials</p>\n<p>For variable TI, the overseas region (97) is in the same case.</p>\n<p>For (I2)&nbsp; <br />Leather and Footwear Industry&nbsp; <br />Manufacture of animal feed<br />Clothing industry <br />Extraction Coking and refining<br />Grain processing; manufacture of starch products<br />Furniture manufacturing&nbsp; <br />Processing and preserving of fish, crustaceans and molluscs<br />Fabrication de produits informatiques, &eacute;lectroniques et optiques</p>\n<p>For variable I2, the overseas regions (97) and Corse (94) are in the same case.</p>\n<p>For (TD)<br />Leather and Footwear Industry</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1838> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.15.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.15.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1838> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.10.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.10.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.10.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1838> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1838> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.10.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te fait l'objet d'une proc&eacute;dure d'archivage interne des bases de donn&eacute;es. Les fichiers individuels de l&rsquo;enqu&ecirc;te sont mis &agrave; disposition des utilisateurs ext&eacute;rieurs &agrave; l&rsquo;Insee via le Centre d&rsquo;acc&egrave;s s&eacute;curis&eacute; des donn&eacute;es (CASD), apr&egrave;s passage au Comit&eacute; du secret.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base de sondage est le Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus).<br />La m&eacute;thode d'&eacute;chantillonnage est un plan stratifi&eacute; par secteur d'activit&eacute;, taille d'unit&eacute; et localisation (depuis l'ann&eacute;e de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence 2014). Les allocations sont optimis&eacute;es sur les montants des &eacute;tudes et des investissements des enqu&ecirc;tes pr&eacute;c&eacute;dentes (allocations de Neyman) . Elles sont exhaustives au-del&agrave; d'un certain seuil.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> , <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1838> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1838> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The different stages of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:<br />- stratified sample selection<br />- reminders and checks of data being collected<br />- clearance<br />- adjustment for total non-response<br />- shimming<br />- adjustment for partial non-response<br />- winsorisation (control of the influence of atypical units)<br />- the questionnaire was tested (in the 4th quarter 2012) as part of the survey's appearance before the label committee in early 2013.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.6.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The committees that have given Insee the right and legitimacy to collect its data are:<br />- The CNIS, which examines each new project, whether it is a survey, a directory or the exploitation of administrative files ... These projects are presented by all the institutions that contribute by their work to producing public statistics. The discussion focuses in particular on the purpose of the project, its place in the information system and the conditions anticipated for its dissemination. Each operation must be examined to ensure it is in the general interest and does not duplicate existing sources of information, in other words to ensure that it is suitable. It provides an opinion on suitability.<br />- The quality label committee, within the CNIS, ensures that it meets the criteria of statistical quality. The committee checks that the survey meets the statistical quality criteria in so far as concerns the collection and sampling method (survey design, data correction method, handling of non-responses guaranteeing the reliability of results..), relevance of the questions and adaptation of the distribution to the objectives announced. It also checks that the survey does not place an excessive burden on the respondents, that consultations have been held with the partners concerned and that any wishes expressed by the CNIS during the debate on suitability were taken into account. It gives a quality label of general interest and statistical quality.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.10.7/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La fiche qualit&eacute; est d&eacute;crite selon la norme europ&eacute;enne du Single integrated metadata structure (SIMS).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.12.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Un comit&eacute; de concertation se r&eacute;unit tous les ans. Ce comit&eacute; comprend des repr&eacute;sentants d'organisations professionnelles et d'entreprises des secteurs de l'industrie, ainsi que des experts du domaine de l'environnement.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Contr&ocirc;les pendant la phase de collecte<br />- Relances pendant la phase de collecte&nbsp;: relances par courrier exhaustives sur les non-r&eacute;pondants, relances t&eacute;l&eacute;phoniques prioris&eacute;es sur les non-r&eacute;pondants de grande taille<br />- Apurement&nbsp;pour assurer la coh&eacute;rence des r&eacute;ponses au sein de chaque questionnaire<br />- Winsorisation&nbsp;: contr&ocirc;le de l'influence des unit&eacute;s atypiques<br />- Calcul d'indicateurs de pr&eacute;cision</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey methodology is available in \"Methods and Practice of Business Surveys\" (fr).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
