    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The scope of the survey was narrowed compared to the 2014 edition which also included the legal units of divisions 38 (Waste collection, treatment and disposal; recovery) and 39 (Pollution control and other waste management services).<br />Note that data for the waste management sector (divisions 38 and 39) were disseminated separately.<br />No difference with 2015.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1838/S.13.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Differences in the aggregate from the adjustment (including clairance) for the target variables are available in the document \"Effet de redressement 2016\" (fr).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
