                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1561> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/33> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/52> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/53> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/66> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Survey of a sample of 1,500 enterprises with 10 employees or less."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/53>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Économie et Statistique n° 395-396"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Enquêtes de conjoncture"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/23337> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1561> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is conducted each quarter (in January, April, July and October, i.e. the month following the end of each quarter).</p>\n<p>Data collection is by post and online over a period stretching from the end of the month prior to the month of the survey to the end of the month of the survey.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/I.20/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1561> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/52>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Économie et Statistique n° 359-360"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Analyse conjoncturelle : entre statistique et économie"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/22923> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1561> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "La formulation des questions est conçue de manière à faciliter une réponse rapide (la plupart des questions sont qualitatives à trois modalités exprimées sous la forme \"hausse, baisse, stable\", ou \"supérieur à la normale, normal, inférieur à la normale\")."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The wording of the questions is designed in such a way as to facilitate quick answers (most of the questions are qualitative with three possible answers in the form \"up, down, same\", or \"higher than normal, normal, lower than normal\")."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te trimestrielle de conjoncture dans l'artisanat du b&acirc;timent a pour objet de transcrire l'opinion des artisans du secteur sur leur activit&eacute; r&eacute;cente et sur leurs perspectives d'activit&eacute;.</p>\n<p>Cette opinion est retrac&eacute;e au moyen du suivi de l'activit&eacute; et de variables qui lui sont li&eacute;es telles que l'&eacute;volution des effectifs.</p>\n<p>Les chefs d'entreprise fournissent &eacute;galement leur opinion sur leurs investissements et leur tr&eacute;sorerie.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/33>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Site internet de la Commission européenne, page en anglais"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Le système européen harmonisé des enquêtes de conjoncture de la Commission européenne"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <http://ec.europa.eu/economy_finance/db_indicators/surveys/method_guides/index_en.htm> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1561> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quarterly outlook survey in the building trades is conducted among craftspeople working in the construction of individual homes and various buildings, general masonry work, wood framing and roofing, and installation and finishing.</p>\n<p>More precisely, the survey covers the sectors defined by the following NAF Rev.2 codes: 41.2, 43.2, 43.3, 43.9.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/470>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Qualité de l'enquête relative à l'exercice 2013"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2014-08-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/BIL_ENQ_CONJ_ARTISANAT_2013.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1561>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Enquête trimestrielle de conjoncture dans l'artisanat du bâtiment 2013"@fr , "Quality report: Quaterly business outlook survey in the building trades 2013"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1104> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te trimestrielle de conjoncture dans l'artisanat du b&acirc;timent est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e aupr&egrave;s d'artisans travaillant dans la construction de maisons individuelles et de b&acirc;timents divers, les travaux de ma&ccedil;onnerie g&eacute;n&eacute;rale, la r&eacute;alisation de charpentes et de couvertures, les travaux d'installation et de finition.</p>\n<p>Plus pr&eacute;cis&eacute;ment, l'enqu&ecirc;te couvre les secteurs d&eacute;finis par les codes NAF r&eacute;v. 2 suivants : 41.2, 43.2, 43.3, 43.9.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1561/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/Q> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1561> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/66>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>
                    "Insee Méthodes n° 123"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "L'enquête de conjoncture dans l'artisanat du bâtiment : méthodologie"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/7268> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1694> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1694/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- the physical characteristics of the housing stock (size, sanitary facilities, heating, annexes);<br />- the quality of the dwelling: condition of the housing and the building, noise, exposure, location, environment, neighbourhood, security, quality of existing facilities (heating installation), use of clean energy;<br />- the legal measures for occupation of the dwelling (form and origin of ownership, rental legislation, State aid);<br />- difficulties in access to housing, household solvency, the workings of rental relationships;<br />- expenditure associated with housing (rents, rental or joint ownership charges, prices and borrowing for recently purchased dwellings, loan repayments for home ownership, repairs and maintenance) and benefits the occupants receive;<br />- resources received by the different members of the household;<br />- housing assets held by the household;<br />- household residential mobility, the opinion that households have of their housing and their possible desire to change;<br />- unusual accommodation situations for individuals in a household, individual occupancy status ;<br />- the children of the reference person and/or his/her spouse living outside the parental home.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1694/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-05-02"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1694> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/248>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire de l’enquête logement en 2013"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2013-05-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/DOC_ENQ_LOGEMENT_2013_QUEST.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1694/I.18.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Data collection was performed by Capi (computer-assisted data collection) from June 2013 to June 2014.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/247>
