    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/417>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Théorie de l'opinion : Faut-il pondérer les réponses individuelles ?"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2006-12-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/theorie_de_l_opinion2006.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/416> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/418> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/417> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/46> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/33> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/52> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/53> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e tous les trimestres. Elle est effectu&eacute;e en janvier, avril, juillet et octobre, soit le premier mois de chaque trimestre.</p>\n<p>La collecte se fait par voie postale et par internet de la fin du mois pr&eacute;c&eacute;dant le mois de l'enqu&ecirc;te jusqu'&agrave; la fin du mois de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1598> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1598> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1598> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey is conducted every quarter. This is done in January, April, July and October, i.e. the month after the end of each quarter.</p>\n<p>Data collection is by post and via the internet from the end of the month preceding the survey month to the end of the survey month.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quarterly business outlook survey on investment in industry records the opinion of industrialists on trends in the economic&nbsp;climate in investment, in the destination of investment (replacement, modernisation, capacity extension, etc.), trends in production capacity and displacement of facilities, investments abroad, and factors influencing their decision to invest.</p>\n<p>As well as qualitative questions, the survey is unusual in that it also includes quantitative questions. Annual amounts of investment by the company over two years and the current year are collected and also investment distribution according to destination.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.11.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/410> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te trimestrielle sur les investissements dans l'industrie a pour objet de transcrire l'opinion des industriels sur l'&eacute;volution conjoncturelle de l'investissement, la destination de l'investissement (remplacement, modernisation, extension de capacit&eacute;, etc.), l'&eacute;volution de la capacit&eacute; de production et des d&eacute;classements d'&eacute;quipements, les investissements &agrave; l'&eacute;tranger, les facteurs influen&ccedil;ant la d&eacute;cision d'investissement.</p>\n<p>Outre des questions qualitatives, l'enqu&ecirc;te pr&eacute;sente la particularit&eacute; de contenir &eacute;galement des questions quantitatives. Sont ainsi collect&eacute;s les montants annuels d'investissement de l'entreprise relatifs &agrave; deux ann&eacute;es et &agrave; l'ann&eacute;e courante ou encore la r&eacute;partition des investissements selon leur destination.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/416>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Prévoir l'investissement des entreprises : Un indicateur des révisions dans l'enquête de conjoncture sur les investissements dans l'industrie "@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2005-07-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/prevoir_invest_entreprises_G2005_09.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1598/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/E> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1598> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/410>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Qualité de l'enquête relative à l'exercice 2012"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2013-09-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Investissement_francais_2012.pdf> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1551> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1551/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The sample contains 8 093 companies for an overall sampling frame of the scope of about 28 500 companies. The sampling frame contains companies belonging to the French \"SIRENE\" register, located in France (Metropolitan France and overseas departments), active on March 31st 2012, belonging to the non financial market sector, with 50 employees or more on December 31st 2008 and whose main activity corresponds to the sections from B to N (exception section K) from NACE Rév.2. \n \nThen this sampling frame has been matched with the LIFI database (database containing financial links between companies) provided by INSEE in order to collect in particular some information about the type of company (not belonging to a group, subsidiary or a group, head of a group) and the ownership of subsidiaries located in France or abroad. \n \nThe sampling frame is stratified by the activity of the company (71 categories) and the workforce (3 categories: from 50 to 99 employees, from 100 to 249 employees, 250 employees or more): this brings 213 strata in the sampling frame. \n \nThe 4 964 legal units of 250 employees or more taken from the sampling frame are exhaustively surveyed. \n \nConcerning non-exhaustive strata, an allocation proportional to the workforce has been calculated and then slightly modified in order to improve (or to re-balance in some cases) the precision on the more expected fields of dissemination. \n \nIn each stratum, the drawing of the sample has been carried out with the \"systematic drawing\" method applied on the database sorted by \" fine type \" of company for each stratum."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1551/I.18.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.8>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/I> , <http://bauhaus/codes/modeCollecte/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1551> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1551/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey scope covers non-financial companies in the market sector with 50 employees or more at the end 2008, whose sector falls within divisions 05 to 82 (excl. 64 to 66) of NACE rev.2 \nThe European scope is limited to companies of the non-financial market sector with 100 employees or more at the end of 2008"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/493>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire de l'enquête sur les Chaînes d'activité mondiales  / CAM"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2013-10-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/Questionnaire_enquete_CAM.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1551/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Le champ de l'enqu&ecirc;te comprend les soci&eacute;t&eacute;s (unit&eacute;s l&eacute;gales identifi&eacute;es par un num&eacute;ro Siren) actives et exploitantes au 31 mars 2012 :</p>\n<p>- des secteurs principalement marchands, non agricoles et non financiers, soit les sections B &agrave; N hors section K (en&nbsp;nomenclature NACE R&eacute;v 2.) ;</p>\n<p>- et dont l'effectif employ&eacute; &eacute;tait sup&eacute;rieur ou &eacute;gal &agrave; 50 &agrave; la fin de l'ann&eacute;e 2008. Au niveau Europ&eacute;en, le champ est restreint aux soci&eacute;t&eacute;s dont l'effectif employ&eacute; &eacute;tait sup&eacute;rieur ou &eacute;gal &agrave; 100 &agrave; la fin de l'ann&eacute;e 2008.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1551/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/494> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/493> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1551/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2013-10-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1551> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1551/I.18.7>
