                    "<p>The survey covers manufacturing industry and extraction industries; divisions 08 to 33 of NAF Rev. 2 (except 08.92Z, 09.10Z, 12, 19.10Z, 30.40Z).<br />Industrial enterprise</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
