                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/255> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/256> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Metadata report 1691"@en , "Rapport de métadonnées 1691"@fr .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/255>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Enquête Méthodologique - Information et Vie Quotidienne - Tome 1 : bilan du test 1, novembre 2002"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2003-06-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/enq_methodo_info_vie_quotidienne_doctrav0202.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/territoire/franceHorsMayotte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>\"Ordinary\" households, i.e. excluding households living in institutional collective dwellings units (hostels, prisons, hospitals, etc.) and those living in mobile accommodation (e.g. boatmen, homeless people, etc.).<br />Individual between 18 and 65 years old (a single individual per household).</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'Agence nationale de Lutte contre l'Illettrisme / ANLCISite internet<br /><a href=\"http://www.anlci.gouv.fr\"> http://www.anlci.gouv.fr</a><br /><br />Mesurer les comp&eacute;tences des adultes avec l'enqu&ecirc;te Information et vie quotidienne / IVQEconomie et Statistique n&deg;424-425<br /><a href=\"https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/27532\"> https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/27532</a></p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/H> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Regional extensions take place in the Pays-de-Loire and Nord-Pas-de-Calais regions.</p>\n<p>The IVQ survey was also conducted in Martinique in 2006, Reunion Island in 2007 and Guadeloupe in 2008, with representative samples of the population aged between 16 and 65 years old.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>M&eacute;nages dits \" ordinaires \", c'est-&agrave;-dire hors m&eacute;nages vivant en collectivit&eacute; (foyers, prisons, h&ocirc;pitaux&hellip;) et vivant dans des habitations mobiles (mariniers, sans-abri&hellip;).<br />Individu de 18 &agrave; 65 ans (un seul individu par m&eacute;nage).</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The survey was conducted from October to December 2004 by interviewers in face-to-face interrogations using a computer-assisted&nbsp;data collection method (CAPI).</p>\n<p>In order to motivate the respondents, the exercise materials were varied and not very academic, instead resembling the documents encountered in daily life (TV programmes, music CDs, etc.).</p>\n<p>The level of difficulty of the exercise is adapted to the skill level of the person, by means of a guidance procedure after a core assessment of literacy and numeracy skills.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the persons who perform at or above a minimum standard are routed to more complex items, which allows for the definition of skills such as the ability to select the essential information in a text.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, if the results following the procedure are poor, the respondent takes a test consisting of quite basic&nbsp;tasks dedicated to understand his or her difficulties in relation to written language.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Les comp&eacute;tences en lecture, en num&eacute;ratie et en compr&eacute;hension orale ;<br />- Les langues maternelles, d'apprentissage de la lecture, et parl&eacute;e actuellement ;<br />- Les difficult&eacute;s durant le parcours scolaire ;<br />- Les d&eacute;marches pour trouver du travail ;<br />- Les loisirs li&eacute;s &agrave; la lecture ;<br />- Le cas &eacute;ch&eacute;ant, le processus de contournement des difficult&eacute;s rencontr&eacute;es dans la vie quotidienne.</p>\n<p>Afin de mieux conna&icirc;tre le parcours de vies des personnes enqu&ecirc;t&eacute;es, un questionnaire biographique est propos&eacute;. Il porte sur leurs origines, les lieux o&ugrave; ils vivent, la scolarisation en France ou ailleurs&hellip;</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Des extensions r&eacute;gionales ont lieu en Pays de la Loire et en Nord-Pas-de-Calais.</p>\n<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te IVQ est &eacute;galement r&eacute;alis&eacute;e en Martinique en 2006, &agrave; la R&eacute;union en 2007, en Guadeloupe en 2008, sur des &eacute;chantillons repr&eacute;sentatifs de la population &acirc;g&eacute;e de 16 &agrave; 65 ans.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The sample consisted of approximately 10,400 households."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>- Reading, numeracy and oral comprehension skills<br />- Mother tongues, languages that people learn to read and currently speak<br />- Difficulties during school careers<br />- Job finding procedures<br />- Reading-related leisure activities<br />- If necessary, the procedures used to circumvent difficulties encountered in daily life</p>\n<p>In order to achieve a better understanding of the pathways through life of the people surveyed, a background questionnaire is proposed, which covers their origins, their places of residence, schooling in France or elsewhere, etc.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "L'échantillon comporte environ 10 400 ménages."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1908> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.8.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.8.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.8.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.8.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.6.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The declaration of the processing operation to the Commission nationale de l'informatique et des libert&eacute;s (Cnil) was made on 25 July 2005 under reference number 1109535. The favourable opinion was given and the order creating the automated processing of individual information from administrative files on self-employed persons, signed on 30 March 2006, was published in OJ No&nbsp;87 of 12 April 2006.</p>\n<p>Agreement No.&nbsp;2008-00061D1 between INSEE and the Agence centrale des organismes de s&eacute;curit&eacute; sociale (Acoss) was signed on 27 February 2008; it has been renewed by amendment since 2013.</p>\n<p>Agreement No.&nbsp;2006-00242 between INSEE and the Caisse centrale de la mutualit&eacute; sociale agricole (CCMSA) was signed on 18 October 2006.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Self-employed database 2015"@en , "Rapport qualité : Base non-salariés 2015"@fr ;
