    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.1.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.7>
                    "01 87 69 62 58"@fr , "01 87 69 62 58"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.10.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Un Insee Premi&egrave;re sur les revenus d&rsquo;activit&eacute; des non-salari&eacute;s est publi&eacute; tous les ans et disponible sur insee.fr.<br />Des donn&eacute;es sur les revenus d'activit&eacute; des non-salari&eacute;s par activit&eacute; sont mis &agrave; jour tous les ans &agrave; la rubrique Chiffres cl&eacute;s de insee.fr.<br />L&rsquo;ouvrage de la collection Insee r&eacute;f&eacute;rences portant sur l&rsquo;emploi et les revenus des ind&eacute;pendants est publi&eacute; environ tous les 5 ans et disponible sur insee.fr.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.2/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.2/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-F201> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base non-salari&eacute;s contient de fa&ccedil;on quasiment exhaustive les personnes affili&eacute;es &agrave; un r&eacute;gime de protection sociale des travailleurs non salari&eacute;s&nbsp;: r&eacute;gime social des ind&eacute;pendants (RSI), r&eacute;gime des professions lib&eacute;rales via les Urssaf ou r&eacute;gime agricole via la Mutualit&eacute; sociale agricole (MSA).<br />Ce champ constitue un compl&eacute;ment &agrave; celui couvert par les sources traitant les d&eacute;clarations sociales relatives aux salari&eacute;s.<br />Sont concern&eacute;s l&rsquo;ensemble des entrepreneurs individuels (y compris les micro-entrepreneurs) et les g&eacute;rants majoritaires de soci&eacute;t&eacute;s &agrave; responsabilit&eacute; limit&eacute;e (SARL, SELARL).<br />En revanche, ne sont pas concern&eacute;s les g&eacute;rants minoritaires de SARL, ainsi que les dirigeants de soci&eacute;t&eacute;s anonymes (SA) ou de soci&eacute;t&eacute;s par actions simplifi&eacute;es (SAS), qui sont assimil&eacute;s salari&eacute;s au sens de la s&eacute;curit&eacute; sociale et cotisent donc aux caisses de salari&eacute;s.<br />Les conjoints collaborateurs et les aides familiaux ne font pas partie du champ.<br />Certaines professions ind&eacute;pendantes des secteurs culturels, notamment les artistes auteurs cotisant &agrave; l&rsquo;Agessa, sont &eacute;galement absentes des sources statistiques. En l&rsquo;absence d&rsquo;information exploitable, les marins-p&ecirc;cheurs sont exclus du champ.</p>\n<p>Pour les donn&eacute;es MSA, les cotisants solidaires, exer&ccedil;ant sur une surface inf&eacute;rieure &agrave; la moiti&eacute; de la surface minimum d&rsquo;installation (SMI) sont &eacute;cart&eacute;s du champ.</p>\n<p>Pour certaines activit&eacute;s, le r&eacute;gime de protection sociale d&eacute;pend de la zone g&eacute;ographique&nbsp;: en particulier, les activit&eacute;s de services d&rsquo;am&eacute;nagement paysager et des centres &eacute;questres, les entreprises de travaux agricoles et entreprises de travaux forestiers sont couvertes par la MSA en France m&eacute;tropolitaine, et par l&rsquo;Acoss dans les DOM.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Classifications used in the self-employed database are as follows:<br />- the French classification of&nbsp; economic activities (NAF rev. 2, used at its finest level);<br />- the classification of legal categories (business legal status), also used at the most detailed level (level III);<br />- the classification of professions and socio-professional categories (PCS-ESE) for salaried positions held by self-employed is used at its most detailed level (level 3);<br />- the official geographical code used at the municipality level.</p>\n<p>These classifications are also available under insee.fr.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The self-employed database is based on the social declarations of self-employed persons, coming from two main suppliers:<br />- the Central Agency of Social Security Organisations (Acoss), pilot of the Urssaf network. This covers personal social security contributions for family allowances and the CSG-CRDS based on the remuneration of all self-employed, apart from the agricultural sector;<br />- the Caisse centrale de la mutualit&eacute; sociale agricole (CCMSA), which covers social contributions in the agricultural sector.</p>\n<p>These data are completed each year with variables from:<br />- on the one hand, annual social data declarations (DADS) completed by all private companies employing employees. These data are complemented by data from the Public Service Employee Information System (Siasp). The database thus gathers information on the salaried positions held by self-employed who had also a salaried job during the year (multi-activity);<br />- on the other hand, the \"Business Register Identification System (Sirene)\" directory (annual reference frame for active establishments as well as a complete directory), then the Registration System to the Statistical Unit Register (Sirus- generic reference frame). This operation makes it possible in particular to validate the SIREN/SIRET identifiers, to determine the real activity of the owner-operators of corporations (SA &amp; SAS excluded) and to enrich the data with characteristics of the companies.</p>\n<p>The self-employed annual database contains all individuals who are affiliated with a social protection (or welfare) scheme for self-employed workers and who had at least one day of activity in the year.</p>\n<p>The earned income of self-employed persons is calculated on the basis of their taxable professional income, where certain tax breaks and voluntary social contributions are reincluded. In practice, it corresponds to the basis used to calculate personal contributions to family allowances.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.6>
                    "contact@insee.fr"@fr , "contact@insee.fr"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.6.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La d&eacute;claration du traitement &agrave; la Commission nationale de l&rsquo;informatique et des libert&eacute;s (Cnil) a &eacute;t&eacute; effectu&eacute;e le 25 juillet 2005 sous la r&eacute;f&eacute;rence n&deg;&nbsp;1109535. L'avis favorable a &eacute;t&eacute; donn&eacute; et l'arr&ecirc;t&eacute; de cr&eacute;ation du traitement automatis&eacute; d'informations individuelles issues de fichiers administratifs sur les non-salari&eacute;s, sign&eacute; le 30 mars 2006, est paru au JO n&deg;&nbsp;87 du 12 avril 2006.</p>\n<p>La convention n&deg;&nbsp;2008-00061D1 entre l'Insee et l&rsquo;Agence centrale des organismes de s&eacute;curit&eacute; sociale (Acoss) a &eacute;t&eacute; sign&eacute;e le 27 f&eacute;vrier 2008&nbsp;; elle est reconduite par avenant depuis 2013.</p>\n<p>La convention n&deg;&nbsp;2006-00242 entre l'Insee et la Caisse centrale de la mutualit&eacute; sociale agricole (CCMSA) a &eacute;t&eacute; sign&eacute;e le 18 octobre 2006.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.15.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.1/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.1/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.10.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.10.2/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.10.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>On s'assure de la coh&eacute;rence des &eacute;volutions entre l'ann&eacute;e N et l'ann&eacute;e N-1 (mise &agrave; disposition de variables suppl&eacute;mentaires &agrave; concept comparable s'il y a un changement de concept entre deux ann&eacute;es).</p>\n<p>Dans le cadre des analyses temporelles, certaines ruptures de s&eacute;rie doivent &ecirc;tre gard&eacute;es &agrave; l&rsquo;esprit&nbsp;:</p>\n<p>Pour les donn&eacute;es Acoss&nbsp;:<br />- Apparition du statut d&rsquo;auto-entrepreneur en 2009&nbsp;;<br />Int&eacute;gration d&rsquo;une partie des dividendes dans l&rsquo;assiette de cotisation des g&eacute;rants majoritaires &agrave; partir de 2013&nbsp;;<br />- Am&eacute;lioration de la m&eacute;thode de calcul du revenu des auto-entrepreneurs &agrave; partir de 2014&nbsp;;<br />- Modification des donn&eacute;es en entr&eacute;e permettant d&rsquo;&eacute;tablir les liens entre les g&eacute;rants et les entreprises qu&rsquo;ils g&egrave;rent &agrave; partir de 2015 (entra&icirc;nant des ruptures sur le type de non-salari&eacute; &ndash; entrepreneur individuel ou g&eacute;rant majoritaire &ndash;, sur le nombre de g&eacute;rants sans lien et sur la r&eacute;partition des non-salari&eacute;s par secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute;)&nbsp;;<br />- Am&eacute;lioration de la d&eacute;termination du statut principal des pluriactifs en 2015.</p>\n<p>Pour les donn&eacute;es MSA&nbsp;:<br />- Int&eacute;gration progressive (sur deux ans) d&rsquo;une partie des dividendes dans l&rsquo;assiette de cotisation &agrave; partir de 2013&nbsp;;<br />- Mise &agrave; disposition des effectifs des DOM &agrave; partir de 2013&nbsp;;<br />- Mise &agrave; disposition des effectifs des cessations en cours d&rsquo;ann&eacute;e &agrave; partir de 2014&nbsp;;<br />- Am&eacute;lioration de la d&eacute;termination du secteur d&rsquo;activit&eacute; &agrave; partir de 2015.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.8.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The self-employed database for year N is available at the end of year N + 2.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "Individu"@fr , "Person"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The number of self-employed workers and their earned incomes are broken down by NAF sectors.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058 92541 Montrouge cedex</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058 92541 Montrouge cedex</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base non-salari&eacute;s est constitu&eacute;e &agrave; partir des donn&eacute;es s'appuyant notamment sur les d&eacute;clarations sociales des ind&eacute;pendants et provenant de deux principaux fournisseurs&nbsp;:<br />- l&rsquo;Agence centrale des organismes de s&eacute;curit&eacute; sociale (Acoss), pilote du r&eacute;seau des Urssaf. Celle-ci recouvre les cotisations sociales personnelles d&rsquo;allocations familiales et la CSG-CRDS assises sur les r&eacute;mun&eacute;rations de l&rsquo;ensemble des non-salari&eacute;s, hors sph&egrave;re agricole&nbsp;;<br />- la caisse centrale de la mutualit&eacute; sociale agricole (CCMSA), qui recouvre les cotisations sociales de la sph&egrave;re agricole.</p>\n<p>Les donn&eacute;es sont compl&eacute;t&eacute;es chaque ann&eacute;e par des variables provenant&nbsp;:<br />- d&rsquo;une part des D&eacute;clarations annuelles de donn&eacute;es sociales (DADS)&nbsp; remplies par toutes les entreprises employant des salari&eacute;s. Ces donn&eacute;es sont compl&eacute;t&eacute;es des donn&eacute;es issues du syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;information sur les agents des services publics (Siasp). La base rassemble ainsi des informations sur les postes salari&eacute;s occup&eacute;s par les non-salari&eacute;s qui ont eu un emploi salari&eacute; au cours de l&rsquo;ann&eacute;e&nbsp;(multi-activit&eacute;)&nbsp;;<br />- d&rsquo;autre part, du r&eacute;pertoire &laquo;&nbsp;Syst&egrave;me d'identification du r&eacute;pertoire des entreprises (Sirene)&nbsp;&raquo; (r&eacute;f&eacute;rentiel annuel des &eacute;tablissements actifs ainsi que r&eacute;pertoire complet), puis du Syst&egrave;me d&rsquo;immatriculation au r&eacute;pertoire des unit&eacute;s statistiques (Sirus- r&eacute;f&eacute;rentiel g&eacute;n&eacute;rique). Cette op&eacute;ration permet notamment de valider les identifiants SIREN/SIRET, de d&eacute;terminer l&rsquo;activit&eacute; r&eacute;elle des g&eacute;rants majoritaires de soci&eacute;t&eacute; et d&rsquo;enrichir les donn&eacute;es sources en ce qui concerne les caract&eacute;ristiques de l'entreprise.</p>\n<p>La base non-salari&eacute;s contient l&rsquo;ensemble des individus affili&eacute;s &agrave; un r&eacute;gime de protection sociale des travailleurs non salari&eacute;s et ayant eu au moins un jour d&rsquo;activit&eacute; en 2015.</p>\n<p>Le revenu d&rsquo;activit&eacute; des non‑salari&eacute;s est calcul&eacute; &agrave; partir de leur revenu professionnel imposable o&ugrave; sont r&eacute;int&eacute;gr&eacute;s certains all&egrave;gements fiscaux et cotisations sociales facultatives. En pratique, il correspond &agrave; l&rsquo;assiette qui sert au calcul des cotisations personnelles d&rsquo;allocations familiales.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les effectifs des non salari&eacute;s et les revenus d&rsquo;activit&eacute; sont ventil&eacute;s selon les secteurs de la NAF.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.10.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>An \"Insee Premi&egrave;re\" on the earned incomes of self-employed is published every year and available on insee.fr.<br />Data on the earned incomes of self-employed by economic activity are updated every year in the Key Figures section of insee.fr.<br />The book - from the Insee references collection on employment and incomes of self-employed is published approximately every 5 years and available on insee.fr.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The self-employed database contains almost exhaustively the persons affiliated with a social protection (or welfare) scheme for self-employed workers: the social scheme for self-employed persons (RSI), the scheme for liberal professions via the Urssaf or the agricultural scheme via the Agricultural Social Mutuality (MSA).<br />This field is complementary to that covered by the sources processing social declarations related to employees.<br />On the one hand, the non-employee database covers all independant workers in household market enterprises (including micro-entrepreneurs) and the majority managers (business owners) of limited liability companies (SARL, SELARL).<br />On the other hand, non-owner-operators of corporations (SARL), as well as operators of public limited companies (SA) or simplified joint stock companies (SAS), who are considered as employees regarding the social security schemes and therefore contribute to the employees' funds, are not covered.<br />Collaborating spouses and family workers are not included in the scope.<br />Some independent professions of the cultural sectors, such as artist-authors contributing to the Agessa, are also absent from statistical sources. In the absence of exploitable information, fishermen are excluded from the field.</p>\n<p>For MSA data, joint and several contributors, working on an area less than half the minimum installation area (MIS), are excluded from the field.</p>\n<p>For some activities, the social protection system depends on the geographical area: in particular, the activities of landscaping services and equestrian centres, agricultural and forestry work companies are covered by the MSA in metropolitan France and by Acoss in the French overseas departments.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Consistency of growth rates between year N and year N-1 is checked (additional variables with a comparable concept are made available if there is a change in concept between two years).</p>\n<p>When analysing time series, some breaks must be kept in mind:</p>\n<p>For Acoss data:<br />- Appearance of the status of auto-entrepreneur (self-employed entrepreneur) in 2009;<br />Inclusion of a part of dividends in the contribution basis of the majority managers from 2013 onwards;<br />- Improvement of the method for calculating the income of self-employed entrepreneurs from 2014 onwards;<br />- Modification of input data allowing to establish the links between managers and the companies they manage from 2015 onwards (leading to breaks in the type of self-employed &ndash; independant workers in household market enterprises or owner-operators of corporations (SA &amp; SAS excluded) -, in the number of managers with no link to a company, and in the allocation of self-employed by sector of activity);<br />- Improvement in the identification of the main status of pluriactive people in 2015.</p>\n<p>For MSA data:<br />- Progressive integration (over two years) of a part of dividends into the contribution basis from 2013 onwards;<br />- Provision of the number of self-employed in the French overseas departments from 2013 onwards;<br />- Provision of the number of self-employed for business ceasing during the year, from 2014 onwards;<br />- Improvement in the identification of the sector of activity from 2015 onwards.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.1.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.4>
                    "<p>Chef de la Division salaires et revenus d'activit&eacute;</p>"@fr , "<p>Head of Wages and Incomes Section</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.15.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The earned incomes from people affiliated with MSA in the overseas departments are not known.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.8.1/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>La base non-salari&eacute;s de l&rsquo;ann&eacute;e N est disponible en fin d&rsquo;ann&eacute;e N + 2.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.10.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Files with individual data are made available to users outside Insee via the CASD, after being reviewed by the Confidentiality Committee.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.2/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les nomenclatures de la base des non salari&eacute;s sont les suivantes&nbsp;:<br />- la nomenclature d&rsquo;activit&eacute; fran&ccedil;aise (NAF r&eacute;v.2, utilis&eacute;e &agrave; son niveau le plus fin) ;<br />- la nomenclature des cat&eacute;gories juridiques, utilis&eacute;e au niveau le plus fin (niveau III)&nbsp;;<br />- la nomenclature des professions et cat&eacute;gories socioprofessionnelles (PCS-ESE) pour les postes salari&eacute;s occup&eacute;s par les non-salari&eacute;s est utilis&eacute;&eacute; &agrave; son niveau le plus fin (niveau 3)&nbsp;;<br />- le code officiel g&eacute;ographique utilis&eacute; au niveau de la commune.</p>\n<p>Ces nomenclatures sont aussi disponibles sous insee.fr.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fabien Guggemos</p>"@fr , "<p>Fabien Guggemos</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.10.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Les fichiers individuels sont mis &agrave; disposition des utilisateurs ext&eacute;rieurs &agrave; l&rsquo;Insee via le CASD, apr&egrave;s avis favorable du Comit&eacute; du secret.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.3.8>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.8>
                    "<p>Year 2015.</p>"@en , "<p>&nbsp;L&rsquo;ann&eacute;e 2015.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1908> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1595> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/I.20/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1595> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.19/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.19/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1595> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/page/46> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/33> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/52> , <http://bauhaus/documents/page/53> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/416> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/418> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/417> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>Enqu&ecirc;te par sondage aupr&egrave;s de 4 000 entreprises industrielles de 20 salari&eacute;s ou plus.</p>\n<p>Toutes les entreprises d'au moins 500 salari&eacute;s ou 150 millions d'euros de chiffre d'affaires sont interrog&eacute;es.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.18.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>L'enqu&ecirc;te est r&eacute;alis&eacute;e tous les trimestres. Elle est effectu&eacute;e en janvier, avril, juillet et octobre, soit le premier mois de chaque trimestre.</p>\n<p>La collecte se fait par voie postale et par internet de la fin du mois pr&eacute;c&eacute;dant le mois de l'enqu&ecirc;te jusqu'&agrave; la fin du mois de l'enqu&ecirc;te.</p>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1595> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.18.3/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.18.3/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1595> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "<p>The quarterly business outlook survey on investment in industry records the opinion of industrialists on trends in the economic&nbsp;climate in investment, in the destination of investment (replacement, modernisation, capacity extension, etc.), trends in production capacity and displacement of facilities, investments abroad, and factors influencing their decision to invest.</p>\n<p>As well as qualitative questions, the survey is unusual in that it also includes quantitative questions. Annual amounts of investment by the company over two years and the current year are collected and also investment distribution according to destination.</p>"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1595/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1595> .
    
